steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
  metadata {
    created_at {
      seconds: 1794452439
      nanos: 148771750
    }
    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
    source_trajectory_step_info {
      trajectory_id: "13743dd2-7218-436a-8d82-e4fa2841d60a"
      step_index: 1
      cascade_id: "13743dd2-7218-436a-8d82-e4fa2841d60a"
    }
    model_api_content_id: "dbc1824616ea45b38605621337372076"
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "User: Build a mobile-first, dark-mode custom NASCAR Fantasy League web application called \"Pit Box Fantasy\" using Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Lucide React icons, and Supabase (Auth + PostgreSQL).\n\n### 1. Aesthetic & UI Design\n- **Theme:** Motorsport telemetry dark mode (deep carbon `#0B0D10` background, slate `#161920` cards, crisp white text, and series color badges: Amber `#F59E0B` for Cup, Red `#EF4444` for O\'Reilly\'s, and Electric Blue `#3B82F6` for Trucks).\n- **Navigation:** Mobile bottom bar and desktop sidebar with: \"Weekly Picks\", \"Live Standings\", \"Driver Bank\", \"Draft & Season Roster\", and \"Sync Status / Admin\".\n\n### 2. Automated NASCAR Data Pipeline (Zero Manual Scoring)\nBuild a Next.js backend service (`/api/nascar-sync`) and scheduled cron job that fetches official schedule, driver, and points data directly from NASCAR\'s public JSON CDN (`cf.nascar.com` - Series IDs: `1` = Cup, `2` = O\'Reilly\'s, `3` = Trucks):\n\n1. **Schedule & Active Series Auto-Detection:**\n   - Fetch `https://cf.nascar.com/cacher/{year}/race_list_basic.json` server-side (to avoid browser CORS).\n   - Parse `series_1`, `series_2`, and `series_3` schedules, storing `nascar_race_id`, `race_name`, `track_name`, and `race_date` (start timestamp).\n   - Group races by weekend. If a series does not have a race scheduled that weekend, automatically hide its weekly pick slot for that week.\n\n2. **Automated Race Points Ingestion (Friday Trucks, Saturday O\'Reilly\'s, Sunday Cup):**\n   - Poll `https://cf.nascar.com/live/feeds/series_{series_id}/{nascar_race_id}/live_points.json` during/after the race window and `https://cf.nascar.com/cacher/{year}/{series_id}/{nascar_race_id}/weekend-feed.json` (`weekend_race[0].results`) for official post-race results.\n   - Match drivers by `driver_id` (or normalized `driver_fullname` + `car_number`) and extract the total weekend points earned (stage points + finishing points).\n   - Run an automatic re-sync 3 hours post-race and on Monday at 8:00 AM ET to capture any post-race technical inspection disqualifications or official scoring updates.\n   - Include a \"Sync Now\" button in the header so any logged-in user can trigger an on-demand refresh from NASCAR\'s feed at any time.\n\n### 3. League Rules & Core Workflows\n\n#### A. Pre-Season Exclusive Draft & Mid-Season Chase Pick\n1. **Draft Order Engine:** Set pre-season draft order either by **Reverse Order of Last Year\'s Standings** or **Randomized Order**.\n2. **Pre-Season Exclusive Roster (No Duplicates Across the League):**\n   Each user drafts 4 permanent season-long drivers. Once drafted as a season-long pick, that driver is locked off the board and CANNOT be drafted as a season-long pick by anyone else:\n   - **1 O\'Reilly\'s Series Season Driver**\n   - **1 Truck Series Season Driver**\n   - **1 Cup Series \"Chase\" Driver** (made the Cup Playoffs/Chase the previous season)\n   - **1 Cup Series \"Non-Chase\" Driver** (missed the Cup Playoffs/Chase the previous season)\n3. **Mid-Season Cup Chase Pick (Duplicates Allowed):**\n   - When the Cup Series Chase begins (last 10 races of the Cup schedule), unlock a **5th Roster Slot: \"Cup Chase Bonus Pick\"**.\n   - Every user picks 1 eligible Cup Chase driver for the final 10 races. **Duplicates ARE allowed** across league members for this slot.\n\n#### B. Blind Weekly Picks & Driver Usage Bank\n- **1 Pick Per Active Series:** Each user selects **1 Weekly Driver** for each series racing that weekend.\n- **Blind Lockout Rule:** Weekly picks are strictly hidden from all other users until `current_time >= race_start_time`. Before the green flag, display only `\"Pick Locked In\"` or `\"Waiting on Pick\"` status badges on the league board. Once `current_time >= race_start_time`, lock pick editing for that series and reveal everyone\'s picks for that race.\n- **Driver Usage Bank (Remaining Picks Tracker):**\n  - Track how many times each user has selected a specific driver as their **Weekly Pick** during the season against a configurable `max_weekly_uses` limit per series (e.g., 5 uses per driver per season).\n  - Show a live usage badge next to every driver in the pick selector (e.g., `#5 Kyle Larson \342\200\224 3/5 Uses Left`). Automatically disable any driver with `0 Uses Left` for that user.\n  - Build a dedicated **Driver Bank** page where users filter by Cup, O\'Reilly\'s, or Trucks to see every driver, remaining uses, and which tracks they already used them at.\n\n#### C. Automatic Points Distribution & Standings Math\nWhenever the NASCAR Data Pipeline syncs a race\'s points for `series_id`, automatically calculate and update every user\'s points without human intervention:\n- **Cup Race Score** = (Weekly Cup Pick Points) + (Season Cup \"Chase\" Driver Points) + (Season Cup \"Non-Chase\" Driver Points) + (Mid-Season Cup Chase Pick Points, if active).\n- **O\'Reilly\'s Race Score** = (Weekly O\'Reilly\'s Pick Points) + (Season O\'Reilly\'s Driver Points).\n- **Trucks Race Score** = (Weekly Truck Pick Points) + (Season Truck Driver Points).\n- **Weekend Total** = Cup Race Score + O\'Reilly\'s Race Score + Trucks Race Score.\n- **Live & Season Standings:** Show cumulative season points, weekend-by-weekend matrix breakdowns (showing exact points pulled for each driver like \"Kyle Larson: 57 pts\" or \"Layne Riggs: 22 pts\"), and filterable leaderboards by Series or Weekly vs. Season Roster points.\n\n### 4. Database Schema (Supabase / PostgreSQL)\n- `users`: id, name, avatar, last_year_rank, role (\'admin\' | \'member\').\n- `series_config`: id (1 = Cup, 2 = O\'Reilly\'s, 3 = Trucks), name, max_weekly_uses_per_driver (int), chase_active (boolean).\n- `drivers`: id, nascar_driver_id (int), series_id, car_number, full_name, team, made_last_year_chase (boolean), in_current_chase (boolean), active (boolean).\n- `races`: id, nascar_race_id (int), series_id, weekend_group_id, race_name, track_name, race_start_time (timestamptz), is_chase_race (boolean), sync_status (\'upcoming\' | \'live\' | \'official\'), last_synced_at (timestamptz).\n- `season_rosters`: id, user_id, series_id, slot_type (\'oreillys_season\' | \'trucks_season\' | \'cup_prev_chase\' | \'cup_prev_non_chase\' | \'cup_current_chase\'), driver_id.\n  - *Constraint:* Unique index on `(series_id, driver_id)` where `slot_type != \'cup_current_chase\'`.\n- `weekly_picks`: id, user_id, race_id, series_id, driver_id, submitted_at (timestamptz).\n- `race_driver_results`: id, race_id, driver_id, finish_position (int), stage_points (int), official_points (int), updated_at (timestamptz).\n\n### 5. Initial Prototype & Live Feed Test\nInitialize the app with a working `/api/nascar-sync` route connected to `cf.nascar.com` alongside a pre-populated 6-member league so we can test live JSON fetching, automatic points distribution across Weekly and Season rosters, blind pick reveal timers, and the Driver Usage Bank right away.\n\n### UPGRADE: Automated \"Buschwhacker\" & Owner Points Scoring Engine\n\nUpdate the `/api/nascar-sync` scoring pipeline and database logic so that Cup drivers running in O\'Reilly\'s or Trucks (\"Buschwhackers\"), ride-swapping drivers, and substitute drivers always award full **Car / Owner Points** instead of `0` when a driver is declared for points in a different series:\n\n1. **Dual-Source Points Calculation (Official Points + Owner Points Fallback):**\n   When parsing race results from `https://cf.nascar.com/cacher/{year}/{series_id}/{nascar_race_id}/weekend-feed.json` and stage results from `https://cf.nascar.com/live/feeds/series_{series_id}/{nascar_race_id}/live-stage-points.json`:\n   - First, check the driver\'s reported `points_earned` field.\n   - **Buschwhacker Rule:** If `points_earned == 0` (because the driver is declared for points in Cup or another series, e.g., Chase Elliott or Kyle Larson running an O\'Reilly\'s or Truck race), DO NOT award 0 points. Instead, automatically calculate and award the **Vehicle / Owner Points** earned by that entry in that race using NASCAR\'s official points scale:\n     - **Position Points:** 1st = 55 pts (or 40 pts if configurable in Admin Settings), 2nd = 35 pts, 3rd = 34 pts, decreasing by 1 pt down to 36th\342\200\22340th = 1 pt (unless status is \' disqualified\', which scores 1 pt).\n     - **Stage Points:** Add Stage 1 + Stage 2 points earned by that vehicle (`1st = 10 pts` down to `10th = 1 pt`).\n     - **Fastest Lap Bonus:** Add `+1 pt` if that vehicle recorded the official fastest single lap of the race.\n   - Store both `driver_points` and `calculated_owner_points` in `race_driver_results`, and always credit fantasy players with `MAX(driver_points, calculated_owner_points)`.\n\n2. **Ride-Swapping & Car-Number Resolution:**\n   - Match Weekly Picks by `nascar_driver_id` (not static car number) so if a driver swaps from the #7 car one week to the #88 car the next week, the user still picks the driver and gets the Owner Points of whichever car they drove in that specific race.\n   - Display the dynamically matched car number on the user\'s pick card for that race (e.g., `Chase Elliott (#9 JR Motorsports) \342\200\224 49 Owner Pts`).\n\n3. **Season-Long Roster \"Car Anchor\" Fallback (Injury / Relief Driver Protection):**\n   - On `season_rosters`, store both `driver_id` and `fallback_car_number` (e.g., `#88`).\n   - Include a League Rule toggle in the Commissioner Admin panel: **\"Use Car Owner Points if Season Driver Misses Race\"**. When enabled, if a user\'s Season-Long driver does not start a race (injury/suspension), the scoring engine automatically looks up the `fallback_car_number` in that series and awards the Owner Points scored by the substitute driver in that car.\n\nModel: Here is the complete architecture and codebase for **Pit Box Fantasy**, a mobile-first, dark-mode NASCAR Fantasy League platform built with **Next.js 15 (App Router)**, **TypeScript**, **Tailwind CSS**, **Lucide React**, and **Supabase (PostgreSQL)**. \n\nIt includes the **Automated Buschwhacker & Owner Points Scoring Engine**, **Ride-Swapping Vehicle Resolution**, and **Season-Long Car Anchor Fallback** directly inside the `/api/nascar-sync` pipeline.\n\n---\n\n### 1. Database Schema & Migrations (`supabase/schema.sql`)\n\nRun this SQL inside your Supabase SQL Editor. It creates all tables, enforces the **Exclusive Season Roster constraint** (while allowing duplicates for the 5th Mid-Season Cup Chase slot), and includes the upgraded **Buschwhacker / Owner Points** and **Car Anchor** columns.\n\n```sql\n-- Enable UUID extension\nCREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS \"uuid-ossp\";\n\n-- 1. USERS TABLE\nCREATE TABLE users (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),\n  name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  avatar TEXT,\n  last_year_rank INT NOT NULL,\n  role TEXT CHECK (role IN (\'admin\', \'member\')) DEFAULT \'member\'\n);\n\n-- 2. SERIES & LEAGUE CONFIG TABLE\nCREATE TABLE series_config (\n  id INT PRIMARY KEY CHECK (id IN (1, 2, 3)), -- 1 = Cup, 2 = O\'Reilly\'s, 3 = Trucks\n  name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  badge_color TEXT NOT NULL,\n  max_weekly_uses_per_driver INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 5,\n  chase_active BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\n  first_place_points INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 55, -- Configurable: 55 pts or 40 pts\n  use_car_anchor_fallback BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE -- Injury/Relief Driver Protection toggle\n);\n\n-- 3. DRIVERS TABLE\nCREATE TABLE drivers (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),\n  nascar_driver_id INT NOT NULL,\n  series_id INT NOT NULL REFERENCES series_config(id),\n  car_number TEXT NOT NULL,\n  full_name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  team TEXT NOT NULL,\n  made_last_year_chase BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\n  in_current_chase BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\n  is_buschwhacker BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE, -- Declared for points in another series\n  active BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE,\n  UNIQUE(nascar_driver_id, series_id)\n);\n\n-- 4. RACES TABLE\nCREATE TABLE races (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),\n  nascar_race_id INT UNIQUE NOT NULL,\n  series_id INT NOT NULL REFERENCES series_config(id),\n  weekend_group_id TEXT NOT NULL, -- e.g., \'2026-W08-BRISTOL\'\n  race_name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  track_name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  race_start_time TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,\n  is_chase_race BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\n  sync_status TEXT CHECK (sync_status IN (\'upcoming\', \'live\', \'official\')) DEFAULT \'upcoming\',\n  last_synced_at TIMESTAMPTZ\n);\n\n-- 5. SEASON ROSTERS TABLE (With Car Anchor Fallback)\nCREATE TABLE season_rosters (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),\n  user_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n  series_id INT NOT NULL REFERENCES series_config(id),\n  slot_type TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (\n    slot_type IN (\n      \'oreillys_season\',\n      \'trucks_season\',\n      \'cup_prev_chase\',\n      \'cup_prev_non_chase\',\n      \'cup_current_chase\'\n    )\n  ),\n  driver_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES drivers(id),\n  fallback_car_number TEXT NOT NULL, -- e.g. \'88\' for Injury/Relief Car Anchor protection\n  UNIQUE(user_id, slot_type)\n);\n\n-- EXCLUSIVE DRAFT RULE: No duplicate season drivers across the league EXCEPT \'cup_current_chase\'\nCREATE UNIQUE INDEX idx_exclusive_season_driver \nON season_rosters (series_id, driver_id) \nWHERE slot_type != \'cup_current_chase\';\n\n-- 6. WEEKLY PICKS TABLE\nCREATE TABLE weekly_picks (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),\n  user_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n  race_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES races(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n  series_id INT NOT NULL REFERENCES series_config(id),\n  driver_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES drivers(id),\n  submitted_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW(),\n  UNIQUE(user_id, race_id)\n);\n\n-- 7. RACE DRIVER RESULTS TABLE (Upgraded for Buschwhacker & Ride-Swapping)\nCREATE TABLE race_driver_results (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),\n  race_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES races(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n  driver_id UUID REFERENCES drivers(id),\n  nascar_driver_id INT NOT NULL,\n  actual_car_number TEXT NOT NULL, -- Captures ride-swapping vehicle number (#7 vs #88)\n  actual_team_name TEXT,\n  finish_position INT NOT NULL,\n  stage_points INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n  fastest_lap_bonus INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n  driver_points INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,            -- Reported NASCAR points (0 for Buschwhackers)\n  calculated_owner_points INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,  -- Full Vehicle/Owner Points calculation\n  effective_fantasy_points INT GENERATED ALWAYS AS (GREATEST(driver_points, calculated_owner_points)) STORED,\n  is_disqualified BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\n  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW(),\n  UNIQUE(race_id, nascar_driver_id)\n);\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. Automated NASCAR Data Pipeline & Buschwhacker Engine\n\n#### A. Scoring & Owner Points Engine (`src/lib/nascar-scoring-engine.ts`)\nThis module implements the **Dual-Source Points Calculation**, **Buschwhacker Rule**, **Stage Points + Fastest Lap**, **Ride-Swapping Vehicle Number Resolution**, and **Car Anchor Injury Fallback**.\n\n```typescript\n// src/lib/nascar-scoring-engine.ts\n\nexport interface NascarFeedResult {\n  driver_id: number;\n  driver_fullname: string;\n  car_number: string;\n  team_name?: string;\n  finishing_position: number;\n  points_earned: number; // 0 if declared for points in another series (Buschwhacker)\n  finishing_status?: string;\n  fastest_lap?: boolean;\n}\n\nexport interface NascarStageFeed {\n  stage_num: number;\n  results: Array<{\n    driver_id: number;\n    car_number: string;\n    stage_points: number; // 1st = 10 down to 10th = 1\n  }>;\n}\n\nexport interface ComputedRaceResult {\n  nascar_driver_id: number;\n  driver_fullname: string;\n  actual_car_number: string;\n  actual_team_name: string;\n  finish_position: number;\n  stage_points: number;\n  fastest_lap_bonus: number;\n  driver_points: number;\n  calculated_owner_points: number;\n  effective_fantasy_points: number;\n  scoring_source: \'OFFICIAL_DRIVER_PTS\' | \'BUSCHWHACKER_OWNER_PTS\' | \'DQ_PENALTY\';\n}\n\n/**\n * Calculates Position Points per NASCAR Official Scale:\n * 1st = firstPlacePts (55 or 40 configurable in Admin), 2nd = 35, 3rd = 34 ... decreasing by 1 down to 36th-40th = 1 pt.\n * Disqualified vehicles receive 1 pt.\n */\nexport function calculatePositionOwnerPoints(\n  finishPosition: number,\n  firstPlaceConfig: 55 | 40 = 55,\n  isDisqualified: boolean = false\n): number {\n  if (isDisqualified || finishPosition <= 0) return 1;\n  if (finishPosition === 1) return firstPlaceConfig;\n  if (finishPosition >= 2 && finishPosition <= 35) {\n    return 37 - finishPosition; // 2nd = 35, 3rd = 34, ..., 35th = 2\n  }\n  return 1; // 36th through 40th = 1 pt\n}\n\n/**\n * Dual-Source Points Engine:\n * Evaluates reported `points_earned` vs calculated Vehicle/Owner Points.\n * Ensures Buschwhackers (e.g., Kyle Larson or Chase Elliott in O\'Reilly\'s/Trucks)\n * and Ride-Swapping drivers always award full Owner Points instead of 0.\n */\nexport function processRaceResultsWithOwnerFallback(\n  raceResults: NascarFeedResult[],\n  stageFeeds: NascarStageFeed[],\n  firstPlaceConfig: 55 | 40 = 55,\n  fastestLapDriverId?: number\n): ComputedRaceResult[] {\n  // 1. Aggregate Stage 1 + Stage 2 points by both driver_id and car_number\n  const stagePointsByDriver = new Map<number, number>();\n  const stagePointsByCar = new Map<string, number>();\n\n  for (const stage of stageFeeds) {\n    for (const row of stage.results || []) {\n      const pts = Number(row.stage_points || 0);\n      stagePointsByDriver.set(row.driver_id, (stagePointsByDriver.get(row.driver_id) || 0) + pts);\n      stagePointsByCar.set(row.car_number, (stagePointsByCar.get(row.car_number) || 0) + pts);\n    }\n  }\n\n  return raceResults.map((entry) => {\n    const isDQ = (entry.finishing_status || \'\').toLowerCase().includes(\'disqualified\');\n    const stagePts =\n      stagePointsByDriver.get(entry.driver_id) ??\n      stagePointsByCar.get(entry.car_number) ??\n      0;\n\n    const fastestLapBonus =\n      entry.fastest_lap || (fastestLapDriverId && entry.driver_id === fastestLapDriverId) ? 1 : 0;\n\n    const positionOwnerPts = calculatePositionOwnerPoints(\n      entry.finishing_position,\n      firstPlaceConfig,\n      isDQ\n    );\n\n    const calculatedOwnerPoints = isDQ\n      ? 1\n      : positionOwnerPts + stagePts + fastestLapBonus;\n\n    const reportedDriverPoints = isDQ ? 1 : Number(entry.points_earned || 0);\n\n    // Always credit MAX(driver_points, calculated_owner_points)\n    const effectiveFantasyPoints = Math.max(reportedDriverPoints, calculatedOwnerPoints);\n\n    let scoringSource: ComputedRaceResult[\'scoring_source\'] = \'OFFICIAL_DRIVER_PTS\';\n    if (isDQ) {\n      scoringSource = \'DQ_PENALTY\';\n    } else if (reportedDriverPoints === 0 && calculatedOwnerPoints > 0) {\n      scoringSource = \'BUSCHWHACKER_OWNER_PTS\';\n    }\n\n    return {\n      nascar_driver_id: entry.driver_id,\n      driver_fullname: entry.driver_fullname,\n      actual_car_number: String(entry.car_number).replace(\'#\', \'\').trim(),\n      actual_team_name: entry.team_name || \'NASCAR Entry\',\n      finish_position: entry.finishing_position,\n      stage_points: stagePts,\n      fastest_lap_bonus: fastestLapBonus,\n      driver_points: reportedDriverPoints,\n      calculated_owner_points: calculatedOwnerPoints,\n      effective_fantasy_points: effectiveFantasyPoints,\n      scoring_source: scoringSource,\n    };\n  });\n}\n\n/**\n * Resolves Season-Long Roster Points including the \"Car Anchor\" Fallback\n * if a user\'s Season-Long driver misses the race due to injury/relief driver.\n */\nexport function resolveSeasonSlotScore(params: {\n  primaryNascarDriverId: number;\n  fallbackCarNumber: string;\n  useCarAnchorFallback: boolean;\n  raceResults: ComputedRaceResult[];\n}): {\n  points: number;\n  badgeText: string;\n  usedCarAnchor: boolean;\n  actualCarNumber: string;\n} {\n  const { primaryNascarDriverId, fallbackCarNumber, useCarAnchorFallback, raceResults } = params;\n\n  // 1. Check if the primary drafted driver started the race\n  const primaryResult = raceResults.find((r) => r.nascar_driver_id === primaryNascarDriverId);\n  if (primaryResult) {\n    const isOwnerPts = primaryResult.scoring_source === \'BUSCHWHACKER_OWNER_PTS\';\n    return {\n      points: primaryResult.effective_fantasy_points,\n      badgeText: `${primaryResult.driver_fullname} (#${primaryResult.actual_car_number}) \342\200\224 ${primaryResult.effective_fantasy_points} ${isOwnerPts ? \'Owner Pts\' : \'Pts\'}`,\n      usedCarAnchor: false,\n      actualCarNumber: primaryResult.actual_car_number,\n    };\n  }\n\n  // 2. Primary driver DNS (Injury/Suspension): Check Car Anchor Fallback if enabled\n  if (useCarAnchorFallback) {\n    const normalizedCar = fallbackCarNumber.replace(\'#\', \'\').trim();\n    const substituteResult = raceResults.find((r) => r.actual_car_number === normalizedCar);\n\n    if (substituteResult) {\n      return {\n        points: substituteResult.calculated_owner_points,\n        badgeText: `Car Anchor #${normalizedCar} (Sub: ${substituteResult.driver_fullname}) \342\200\224 ${substituteResult.calculated_owner_points} Owner Pts`,\n        usedCarAnchor: true,\n        actualCarNumber: substituteResult.actual_car_number,\n      };\n    }\n  }\n\n  return {\n    points: 0,\n    badgeText: `DNS (#${fallbackCarNumber}) \342\200\224 0 Pts`,\n    usedCarAnchor: false,\n    actualCarNumber: fallbackCarNumber,\n  };\n}\n```\n\n#### B. Next.js API Route (`/api/nascar-sync/route.ts`) & Cron Configuration\nThis route fetches `race_list_basic.json`, `live_points.json`, `weekend-feed.json`, and `live-stage-points.json` server-side from `cf.nascar.com`, groups races by weekend, detects active series, and runs the Buschwhacker & Owner Points calculator.\n\n```typescript\n// src/app/api/nascar-sync/route.ts\nimport { NextRequest, NextResponse } from \'next/server\';\nimport {\n  processRaceResultsWithOwnerFallback,\n  NascarFeedResult,\n  NascarStageFeed,\n} from \'@/lib/nascar-scoring-engine\';\n\nconst NASCAR_CDN_BASE = \'https://cf.nascar.com\';\n\n// Helper to compute ISO weekend group ID (Friday-Sunday window)\nfunction getWeekendGroupId(dateStr: string): string {\n  const d = new Date(dateStr);\n  const year = d.getUTCFullYear();\n  const startOfYear = new Date(Date.UTC(year, 0, 1));\n  const weekNo = Math.ceil((((d.getTime() - startOfYear.getTime()) / 86400000) + startOfYear.getUTCDay() + 1) / 7);\n  return `${year}-W${String(weekNo).padStart(2, \'0\')}`;\n}\n\nexport async function POST(req: NextRequest) {\n  try {\n    const body = await req.json().catch(() => ({}));\n    const year = body.year || new Date().getFullYear();\n    const firstPlacePointsConfig: 55 | 40 = body.firstPlacePoints === 40 ? 40 : 55;\n    const targetRaceId = body.nascar_race_id;\n    const targetSeriesId = body.series_id;\n\n    // 1. Fetch Schedule & Active Series Auto-Detection\n    const scheduleUrl = `${NASCAR_CDN_BASE}/cacher/${year}/race_list_basic.json`;\n    const scheduleRes = await fetch(scheduleUrl, {\n      headers: { \'User-Agent\': \'PitBoxFantasy/2.0\' },\n      next: { revalidate: 0 },\n    });\n\n    let syncedSchedules: Record<string, any[]> = { series_1: [], series_2: [], series_3: [] };\n    if (scheduleRes.ok) {\n      const rawSchedule = await scheduleRes.json();\n      for (const sId of [1, 2, 3]) {\n        const seriesKey = `series_${sId}`;\n        const list = Array.isArray(rawSchedule[seriesKey]) ? rawSchedule[seriesKey] : [];\n        syncedSchedules[seriesKey] = list.map((r: any) => ({\n          nascar_race_id: Number(r.race_id),\n          series_id: sId,\n          weekend_group_id: getWeekendGroupId(r.race_date),\n          race_name: r.race_name,\n          track_name: r.track_name,\n          race_start_time: r.race_date,\n          is_chase_race: Boolean(r.playoff_round && r.playoff_round > 0),\n        }));\n      }\n    }\n\n    // 2. If syncing a specific race (or active weekend races), fetch Live Points + Weekend Feed + Stage Feed\n    let processedResults = null;\n    if (targetRaceId && targetSeriesId) {\n      const weekendFeedUrl = `${NASCAR_CDN_BASE}/cacher/${year}/${targetSeriesId}/${targetRaceId}/weekend-feed.json`;\n      const livePointsUrl = `${NASCAR_CDN_BASE}/live/feeds/series_${targetSeriesId}/${targetRaceId}/live_points.json`;\n      const stagePointsUrl = `${NASCAR_CDN_BASE}/live/feeds/series_${targetSeriesId}/${targetRaceId}/live-stage-points.json`;\n\n      const [weekendRes, liveRes, stageRes] = await Promise.allSettled([\n        fetch(weekendFeedUrl, { next: { revalidate: 0 } }),\n        fetch(livePointsUrl, { next: { revalidate: 0 } }),\n        fetch(stagePointsUrl, { next: { revalidate: 0 } }),\n      ]);\n\n      let rawResults: NascarFeedResult[] = [];\n      let stageFeeds: NascarStageFeed[] = [];\n\n      // Parse Stage Points Feed\n      if (stageRes.status === \'fulfilled\' && stageRes.value.ok) {\n        stageFeeds = await stageRes.value.json();\n      }\n\n      // Prefer Official Post-Race Weekend Feed (`weekend_race[0].results`), fallback to `live_points.json`\n      if (weekendRes.status === \'fulfilled\' && weekendRes.value.ok) {\n        const weekendData = await weekendRes.value.json();\n        const resultsArray = weekendData?.weekend_race?.[0]?.results || [];\n        rawResults = resultsArray.map((r: any) => ({\n          driver_id: Number(r.driver_id),\n          driver_fullname: r.driver_fullname,\n          car_number: String(r.car_number),\n          team_name: r.team_name,\n          finishing_position: Number(r.finishing_position),\n          points_earned: Number(r.points_earned || 0),\n          finishing_status: r.finishing_status,\n          fastest_lap: Boolean(r.fastest_lap),\n        }));\n      } else if (liveRes.status === \'fulfilled\' && liveRes.value.ok) {\n        const liveData = await liveRes.value.json();\n        const pointsArray = Array.isArray(liveData) ? liveData : liveData?.vehicles || [];\n        rawResults = pointsArray.map((r: any) => ({\n          driver_id: Number(r.driver_id),\n          driver_fullname: r.driver_fullname || `${r.first_name || \'\'} ${r.last_name || \'\'}`.trim(),\n          car_number: String(r.car_number || r.vehicle_number),\n          team_name: r.team_name,\n          finishing_position: Number(r.running_position || r.finishing_position || 40),\n          points_earned: Number(r.points_earned || 0),\n          finishing_status: r.status,\n        }));\n      }\n\n      if (rawResults.length > 0) {\n        processedResults = processRaceResultsWithOwnerFallback(\n          rawResults,\n          stageFeeds,\n          firstPlacePointsConfig\n        );\n      }\n    }\n\n    return NextResponse.json({\n      ok: true,\n      synced_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n      year,\n      schedules_found: {\n        cup: syncedSchedules.series_1.length,\n        oreillys: syncedSchedules.series_2.length,\n        trucks: syncedSchedules.series_3.length,\n      },\n      race_results: processedResults,\n    });\n  } catch (error: any) {\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      { ok: false, error: error.message || \'NASCAR CDN Sync Failed\' },\n      { status: 500 }\n    );\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### C. Scheduled Post-Race & Monday 8:00 AM ET Inspection Cron (`vercel.json`)\nConfigures automatic polling during Friday/Saturday/Sunday race windows, 3 hours post-race, and Monday at 8:00 AM ET (`13:00 UTC` / `12:00 UTC` EDT) to capture technical inspection disqualifications.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"crons\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/api/nascar-sync\",\n      \"schedule\": \"0 4 * * 6,0,1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/api/nascar-sync\",\n      \"schedule\": \"0 13 * * 1\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. Complete Interactive Application (`src/app/page.tsx`)\n\nThis self-contained Next.js App Router dashboard implements the **Motorsport Telemetry Dark Mode (`#0B0D10` / `#161920`)**, pre-populated **6-Member League**, **Blind Weekly Pick Lockout & Reveal Simulator**, **Driver Usage Bank (`3/5 Uses Left`)**, **Pre-Season Exclusive Draft + Mid-Season Chase 5th Slot**, and **Live Buschwhacker / Ride-Swapping / Car Anchor Scoring Simulator**.\n\n```tsx\n\'use client\';\n\nimport React, { useState, useMemo } from \'react\';\nimport {\n  Trophy,\n  Calendar,\n  Database,\n  Users,\n  RefreshCw,\n  Lock,\n  Unlock,\n  ShieldAlert,\n  CheckCircle2,\n  Clock,\n  Flame,\n  Gauge,\n  Car,\n  AlertTriangle,\n  Sliders,\n  ChevronRight,\n  Award,\n  Zap,\n  ArrowUpDown,\n} from \'lucide-react\';\nimport {\n  processRaceResultsWithOwnerFallback,\n  resolveSeasonSlotScore,\n  NascarFeedResult,\n  NascarStageFeed,\n} from \'@/lib/nascar-scoring-engine\';\n\n// ==========================================\n// TYPES & SERIES CONFIGURATION\n// ==========================================\ntype SeriesId = 1 | 2 | 3;\n\ninterface SeriesMeta {\n  id: SeriesId;\n  name: string;\n  shortName: string;\n  colorHex: string;\n  badgeClass: string;\n  borderClass: string;\n  maxWeeklyUses: number;\n}\n\nconst SERIES_META: Record<SeriesId, SeriesMeta> = {\n  1: {\n    id: 1,\n    name: \'NASCAR Cup Series\',\n    shortName: \'CUP\',\n    colorHex: \'#F59E0B\',\n    badgeClass: \'bg-amber-500/15 text-amber-400 border-amber-500/40\',\n    borderClass: \'border-l-4 border-l-amber-500\',\n    maxWeeklyUses: 5,\n  },\n  2: {\n    id: 2,\n    name: \"NASCAR O\'Reilly\'s Series\",\n    shortName: \"O\'REILLY\'S\",\n    colorHex: \'#EF4444\',\n    badgeClass: \'bg-red-500/15 text-red-400 border-red-500/40\',\n    borderClass: \'border-l-4 border-l-red-500\',\n    maxWeeklyUses: 5,\n  },\n  3: {\n    id: 3,\n    name: \'NASCAR Craftsman Truck Series\',\n    shortName: \'TRUCKS\',\n    colorHex: \'#3B82F6\',\n    badgeClass: \'bg-blue-500/15 text-blue-400 border-blue-500/40\',\n    borderClass: \'border-l-4 border-l-blue-500\',\n    maxWeeklyUses: 5,\n  },\n};\n\ninterface Driver {\n  id: string;\n  nascar_driver_id: number;\n  series_id: SeriesId;\n  car_number: string; // Base car number\n  full_name: string;\n  team: string;\n  made_last_year_chase: boolean;\n  in_current_chase: boolean;\n  is_buschwhacker?: boolean;\n}\n\ninterface LeagueMember {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n  avatar: string;\n  last_year_rank: number;\n  role: \'admin\' | \'member\';\n  cumulativePriorPoints: number;\n  seasonRoster: {\n    cup_prev_chase: { driver_id: string; fallback_car_number: string };\n    cup_prev_non_chase: { driver_id: string; fallback_car_number: string };\n    oreillys_season: { driver_id: string; fallback_car_number: string };\n    trucks_season: { driver_id: string; fallback_car_number: string };\n    cup_current_chase?: { driver_id: string; fallback_car_number: string };\n  };\n}\n\n// ==========================================\n// INITIAL SEED DATA (6-MEMBER LEAGUE & DRIVERS)\n// ==========================================\nconst DRIVERS: Driver[] = [\n  // CUP SERIES (Series 1) - Chase Drivers\n  { id: \'c1\', nascar_driver_id: 4001, series_id: 1, car_number: \'5\', full_name: \'Kyle Larson\', team: \'Hendrick Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'c2\', nascar_driver_id: 4002, series_id: 1, car_number: \'24\', full_name: \'William Byron\', team: \'Hendrick Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'c3\', nascar_driver_id: 4003, series_id: 1, car_number: \'12\', full_name: \'Ryan Blaney\', team: \'Team Penske\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'c4\', nascar_driver_id: 4004, series_id: 1, car_number: \'20\', full_name: \'Christopher Bell\', team: \'Joe Gibbs Racing\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'c5\', nascar_driver_id: 4005, series_id: 1, car_number: \'11\', full_name: \'Denny Hamlin\', team: \'Joe Gibbs Racing\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'c6\', nascar_driver_id: 4006, series_id: 1, car_number: \'9\', full_name: \'Chase Elliott\', team: \'Hendrick Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'c7\', nascar_driver_id: 4007, series_id: 1, car_number: \'45\', full_name: \'Tyler Reddick\', team: \'23XI Racing\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n\n  // CUP SERIES (Series 1) - Non-Chase Drivers (Previous Season)\n  { id: \'cn1\', nascar_driver_id: 4101, series_id: 1, car_number: \'8\', full_name: \'Kyle Busch\', team: \'Richard Childress Racing\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'cn2\', nascar_driver_id: 4102, series_id: 1, car_number: \'17\', full_name: \'Chris Buescher\', team: \'RFK Racing\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'cn3\', nascar_driver_id: 4103, series_id: 1, car_number: \'23\', full_name: \'Bubba Wallace\', team: \'23XI Racing\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: false },\n  { id: \'cn4\', nascar_driver_id: 4104, series_id: 1, car_number: \'1\', full_name: \'Ross Chastain\', team: \'Trackhouse Racing\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'cn5\', nascar_driver_id: 4105, series_id: 1, car_number: \'54\', full_name: \'Ty Gibbs\', team: \'Joe Gibbs Racing\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: false },\n  { id: \'cn6\', nascar_driver_id: 4106, series_id: 1, car_number: \'71\', full_name: \'Michael McDowell\', team: \'Spire Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: false },\n\n  // O\'REILLY\'S SERIES (Series 2) - Includes Buschwhackers & Ride-Swappers\n  { id: \'o1\', nascar_driver_id: 5001, series_id: 2, car_number: \'88\', full_name: \'Connor Zilisch\', team: \'JR Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'o2\', nascar_driver_id: 5002, series_id: 2, car_number: \'7\', full_name: \'Justin Allgaier\', team: \'JR Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'o3\', nascar_driver_id: 5003, series_id: 2, car_number: \'21\', full_name: \'Austin Hill\', team: \'Richard Childress Racing\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'o4\', nascar_driver_id: 5004, series_id: 2, car_number: \'2\', full_name: \'Jesse Love\', team: \'Richard Childress Racing\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'o5\', nascar_driver_id: 5005, series_id: 2, car_number: \'00\', full_name: \'Sheldon Creed\', team: \'Haas Factory Team\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'o6\', nascar_driver_id: 5006, series_id: 2, car_number: \'1\', full_name: \'Carson Kvapil\', team: \'JR Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: true },\n  // BUSCHWHACKERS IN O\'REILLY\'S (Declared for Cup points -> 0 Official Driver Pts, Full Owner Pts)\n  { id: \'o_bw1\', nascar_driver_id: 4006, series_id: 2, car_number: \'9\', full_name: \'Chase Elliott (Buschwhacker)\', team: \'JR Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: false, is_buschwhacker: true },\n  { id: \'o_bw2\', nascar_driver_id: 4001, series_id: 2, car_number: \'17\', full_name: \'Kyle Larson (Ride-Swap #88/#17)\', team: \'Hendrick Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: false, is_buschwhacker: true },\n\n  // TRUCK SERIES (Series 3)\n  { id: \'t1\', nascar_driver_id: 6001, series_id: 3, car_number: \'11\', full_name: \'Corey Heim\', team: \'TRICON Garage\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'t2\', nascar_driver_id: 6002, series_id: 3, car_number: \'34\', full_name: \'Layne Riggs\', team: \'Front Row Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'t3\', nascar_driver_id: 6003, series_id: 3, car_number: \'98\', full_name: \'Ty Majeski\', team: \'ThorSport Racing\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'t4\', nascar_driver_id: 6004, series_id: 3, car_number: \'9\', full_name: \'Grant Enfinger\', team: \'CR7 Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'t5\', nascar_driver_id: 6005, series_id: 3, car_number: \'19\', full_name: \'Christian Eckes\', team: \'McAnally-Hilgemann\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'t6\', nascar_driver_id: 6006, series_id: 3, car_number: \'71\', full_name: \'Rajah Caruth\', team: \'Spire Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  // BUSCHWHACKER IN TRUCKS\n  { id: \'t_bw1\', nascar_driver_id: 4101, series_id: 3, car_number: \'7\', full_name: \'Kyle Busch (Buschwhacker)\', team: \'Spire Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: false, is_buschwhacker: true },\n];\n\nconst INITIAL_MEMBERS: LeagueMember[] = [\n  {\n    id: \'u1\',\n    name: \'Cole Trickle (You)\',\n    avatar: \'CT\',\n    last_year_rank: 4,\n    role: \'admin\',\n    cumulativePriorPoints: 2410,\n    seasonRoster: {\n      cup_prev_chase: { driver_id: \'c1\', fallback_car_number: \'5\' },\n      cup_prev_non_chase: { driver_id: \'cn1\', fallback_car_number: \'8\' },\n      oreillys_season: { driver_id: \'o1\', fallback_car_number: \'88\' }, // Connor Zilisch (#88) - Tested with Injury Car Anchor!\n      trucks_season: { driver_id: \'t2\', fallback_car_number: \'34\' },\n      cup_current_chase: { driver_id: \'c4\', fallback_car_number: \'20\' },\n    },\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'u2\',\n    name: \'Rowdy Burns\',\n    avatar: \'RB\',\n    last_year_rank: 1,\n    role: \'member\',\n    cumulativePriorPoints: 2465,\n    seasonRoster: {\n      cup_prev_chase: { driver_id: \'c2\', fallback_car_number: \'24\' },\n      cup_prev_non_chase: { driver_id: \'cn2\', fallback_car_number: \'17\' },\n      oreillys_season: { driver_id: \'o2\', fallback_car_number: \'7\' },\n      trucks_season: { driver_id: \'t1\', fallback_car_number: \'11\' },\n      cup_current_chase: { driver_id: \'c1\', fallback_car_number: \'5\' }, // Duplicate allowed in 5th slot!\n    },\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'u3\',\n    name: \'Ricky Bobby\',\n    avatar: \'RI\',\n    last_year_rank: 2,\n    role: \'member\',\n    cumulativePriorPoints: 2390,\n    seasonRoster: {\n      cup_prev_chase: { driver_id: \'c3\', fallback_car_number: \'12\' },\n      cup_prev_non_chase: { driver_id: \'cn4\', fallback_car_number: \'1\' },\n      oreillys_season: { driver_id: \'o3\', fallback_car_number: \'21\' },\n      trucks_season: { driver_id: \'t3\', fallback_car_number: \'98\' },\n      cup_current_chase: { driver_id: \'c1\', fallback_car_number: \'5\' },\n    },\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'u4\',\n    name: \'Cal Naughton Jr.\',\n    avatar: \'CN\',\n    last_year_rank: 3,\n    role: \'member\',\n    cumulativePriorPoints: 2345,\n    seasonRoster: {\n      cup_prev_chase: { driver_id: \'c4\', fallback_car_number: \'20\' },\n      cup_prev_non_chase: { driver_id: \'cn3\', fallback_car_number: \'23\' },\n      oreillys_season: { driver_id: \'o4\', fallback_car_number: \'2\' },\n      trucks_season: { driver_id: \'t4\', fallback_car_number: \'9\' },\n      cup_current_chase: { driver_id: \'c2\', fallback_car_number: \'24\' },\n    },\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'u5\',\n    name: \'Russ Wheeler\',\n    avatar: \'RW\',\n    last_year_rank: 5,\n    role: \'member\',\n    cumulativePriorPoints: 2295,\n    seasonRoster: {\n      cup_prev_chase: { driver_id: \'c5\', fallback_car_number: \'11\' },\n      cup_prev_non_chase: { driver_id: \'cn5\', fallback_car_number: \'54\' },\n      oreillys_season: { driver_id: \'o5\', fallback_car_number: \'00\' },\n      trucks_season: { driver_id: \'t5\', fallback_car_number: \'19\' },\n      cup_current_chase: { driver_id: \'c3\', fallback_car_number: \'12\' },\n    },\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'u6\',\n    name: \'Jean Girard\',\n    avatar: \'JG\',\n    last_year_rank: 6,\n    role: \'member\',\n    cumulativePriorPoints: 2260,\n    seasonRoster: {\n      cup_prev_chase: { driver_id: \'c6\', fallback_car_number: \'9\' },\n      cup_prev_non_chase: { driver_id: \'cn6\', fallback_car_number: \'71\' },\n      oreillys_season: { driver_id: \'o6\', fallback_car_number: \'1\' },\n      trucks_season: { driver_id: \'t6\', fallback_car_number: \'71\' },\n      cup_current_chase: { driver_id: \'c6\', fallback_car_number: \'9\' },\n    },\n  },\n];\n\n// Historical usage log for User 1 (\'u1\') to demonstrate the Driver Usage Bank\nconst INITIAL_USAGE_HISTORY: Record<string, string[]> = {\n  c1: [\'Daytona 500\', \'Las Vegas\', \'Homestead\'], // 3/5 used -> 2 Left\n  c2: [\'Atlanta\', \'Phoenix\', \'Darlington\', \'Bristol\', \'Kansas\'], // 5/5 used -> 0 Left (LOCKED)\n  c3: [\'Martinsville\'], // 1/5 used -> 4 Left\n  cn1: [\'Talladega\', \'Dover\'], // 2/5 used -> 3 Left\n  o_bw1: [\'Darlington\'], // 1/5 used -> 4 Left\n  o1: [\'Watkins Glen\', \'Road America\'], // 2/5 used -> 3 Left\n  t2: [\'Bristol\', \'Martinsville\', \'North Wilkesboro\', \'Charlotte\'], // 4/5 used -> 1 Left\n  t_bw1: [\'Atlanta\', \'Las Vegas\'], // 2/5 used -> 3 Left\n};\n\nexport default function PitBoxFantasyApp() {\n  // Navigation State\n  const [activeTab, setActiveTab] = useState<\'picks\' | \'standings\' | \'bank\' | \'draft\' | \'admin\'>(\'picks\');\n\n  // League Rules & Telemetry Simulation Toggles\n  const [firstPlacePoints, setFirstPlacePoints] = useState<55 | 40>(55);\n  const [useCarAnchorFallback, setUseCarAnchorFallback] = useState<boolean>(true);\n  const [simulateZilischInjury, setSimulateZilischInjury] = useState<boolean>(true);\n  const [midSeasonChaseActive, setMidSeasonChaseActive] = useState<boolean>(true);\n  const [draftOrderMode, setDraftOrderMode] = useState<\'reverse_standings\' | \'random\'>(\'reverse_standings\');\n\n  // Weekend Schedule & Blind Lockout State\n  // Simulates Friday Trucks (Locked/Official), Saturday O\'Reilly\'s (Live/Green Flag), Sunday Cup (Toggleable Pre-Race vs Green Flag)\n  const [raceLockStates, setRaceLockStates] = useState<Record<SeriesId, boolean>>({\n    3: true,  // Friday Trucks: Green Flag Passed -> Picks Revealed!\n    2: true,  // Saturday O\'Reilly\'s: Green Flag Passed -> Picks Revealed!\n    1: false, // Sunday Cup: Pre-Race Blind Lockout Active (Click toggle to simulate Green Flag)\n  });\n\n  // Active Series on Weekend (Simulates auto-hiding a series if off-week)\n  const [activeSeriesThisWeekend, setActiveSeriesThisWeekend] = useState<Record<SeriesId, boolean>>({\n    1: true,\n    2: true,\n    3: true,\n  });\n\n  // Weekly Picks per User per Series\n  const [weeklyPicks, setWeeklyPicks] = useState<Record<string, Record<SeriesId, string>>>({\n    u1: { 1: \'c1\', 2: \'o_bw1\', 3: \'t2\' },   // You picked Kyle Larson (Cup), Chase Elliott Buschwhacker (O\'Reilly\'s), Layne Riggs (Trucks)\n    u2: { 1: \'c3\', 2: \'o_bw2\', 3: \'t_bw1\' }, // Rowdy picked Kyle Larson Ride-Swap in O\'Reilly\'s & Kyle Busch Buschwhacker in Trucks\n    u3: { 1: \'c4\', 2: \'o2\', 3: \'t1\' },\n    u4: { 1: \'cn1\', 2: \'o3\', 3: \'t3\' },\n    u5: { 1: \'c5\', 2: \'o4\', 3: \'t4\' },\n    u6: { 1: \'c6\', 2: \'o5\', 3: \'t6\' },\n  });\n\n  // Driver Bank Filter State\n  const [bankSeriesFilter, setBankSeriesFilter] = useState<SeriesId>(1);\n  const [standingsViewFilter, setStandingsViewFilter] = useState<\'all\' | \'weekly_only\' | \'season_only\'>(\'all\');\n\n  // Sync Status State\n  const [isSyncing, setIsSyncing] = useState(false);\n  const [lastSyncedAt, setLastSyncedAt] = useState<string>(\'2026-11-12 02:45:10 UTC\');\n  const [syncLogMessage, setSyncLogMessage] = useState<string>(\n    \'Automated Pipeline Ready: Dual-Source Official + Owner Points Engine Active\'\n  );\n\n  // ==========================================\n  // LIVE / OFFICIAL RACE FEED SIMULATION DATA\n  // ==========================================\n  const computedWeekendResults = useMemo(() => {\n    // 1. CUP SERIES FEED (Sunday)\n    const cupRaw: NascarFeedResult[] = [\n      { driver_id: 4001, driver_fullname: \'Kyle Larson\', car_number: \'5\', team_name: \'Hendrick Motorsports\', finishing_position: 1, points_earned: firstPlacePoints + 10, fastest_lap: true },\n      { driver_id: 4003, driver_fullname: \'Ryan Blaney\', car_number: \'12\', team_name: \'Team Penske\', finishing_position: 2, points_earned: 35 + 8 },\n      { driver_id: 4004, driver_fullname: \'Christopher Bell\', car_number: \'20\', team_name: \'Joe Gibbs Racing\', finishing_position: 3, points_earned: 34 + 6 },\n      { driver_id: 4002, driver_fullname: \'William Byron\', car_number: \'24\', team_name: \'Hendrick Motorsports\', finishing_position: 4, points_earned: 33 + 5 },\n      { driver_id: 4101, driver_fullname: \'Kyle Busch\', car_number: \'8\', team_name: \'Richard Childress Racing\', finishing_position: 5, points_earned: 32 + 4 },\n      { driver_id: 4005, driver_fullname: \'Denny Hamlin\', car_number: \'11\', team_name: \'Joe Gibbs Racing\', finishing_position: 6, points_earned: 31 + 2 },\n      { driver_id: 4006, driver_fullname: \'Chase Elliott\', car_number: \'9\', team_name: \'Hendrick Motorsports\', finishing_position: 7, points_earned: 30 + 3 },\n      { driver_id: 4102, driver_fullname: \'Chris Buescher\', car_number: \'17\', team_name: \'RFK Racing\', finishing_position: 8, points_earned: 29 },\n      { driver_id: 4104, driver_fullname: \'Ross Chastain\', car_number: \'1\', team_name: \'Trackhouse Racing\', finishing_position: 9, points_earned: 28 },\n      { driver_id: 4103, driver_fullname: \'Bubba Wallace\', car_number: \'23\', team_name: \'23XI Racing\', finishing_position: 12, points_earned: 25 },\n      { driver_id: 4105, driver_fullname: \'Ty Gibbs\', car_number: \'54\', team_name: \'Joe Gibbs Racing\', finishing_position: 14, points_earned: 23 },\n      { driver_id: 4106, driver_fullname: \'Michael McDowell\', car_number: \'71\', team_name: \'Spire Motorsports\', finishing_position: 18, points_earned: 19 },\n    ];\n    const cupStages: NascarStageFeed[] = [\n      { stage_num: 1, results: [{ driver_id: 4001, car_number: \'5\', stage_points: 10 }, { driver_id: 4003, car_number: \'12\', stage_points: 8 }] },\n    ];\n\n    // 2. O\'REILLY\'S SERIES FEED (Saturday) - Features Buschwhackers (points_earned: 0) & Car Anchor Sub\n    const oreillysRaw: NascarFeedResult[] = [\n      // Kyle Larson ride-swapped into the #88 JR Motorsports entry (if Zilisch is injured) or #17 Hendrick entry!\n      // Declared for Cup points -> NASCAR feed reports `points_earned: 0`!\n      {\n        driver_id: 4001,\n        driver_fullname: \'Kyle Larson\',\n        car_number: simulateZilischInjury ? \'88\' : \'17\',\n        team_name: simulateZilischInjury ? \'JR Motorsports (Relief Sub)\' : \'Hendrick Motorsports\',\n        finishing_position: 1,\n        points_earned: 0, // BUSCHWHACKER RULE TRIGGER: 0 Official Driver Points!\n        fastest_lap: true,\n      },\n      // Chase Elliott in the #9 JR Motorsports entry -> `points_earned: 0` (Buschwhacker)\n      {\n        driver_id: 4006,\n        driver_fullname: \'Chase Elliott\',\n        car_number: \'9\',\n        team_name: \'JR Motorsports\',\n        finishing_position: 2,\n        points_earned: 0, // BUSCHWHACKER RULE TRIGGER: 2nd (35) + Stage (14) = 49 Owner Pts!\n      },\n      // If Connor Zilisch is NOT injured, he runs his #88 car\n      ...(!simulateZilischInjury\n        ? [\n            {\n              driver_id: 5001,\n              driver_fullname: \'Connor Zilisch\',\n              car_number: \'88\',\n              team_name: \'JR Motorsports\',\n              finishing_position: 3,\n              points_earned: 42,\n            },\n          ]\n        : []),\n      { driver_id: 5002, driver_fullname: \'Justin Allgaier\', car_number: \'7\', team_name: \'JR Motorsports\', finishing_position: 4, points_earned: 41 },\n      { driver_id: 5003, driver_fullname: \'Austin Hill\', car_number: \'21\', team_name: \'Richard Childress Racing\', finishing_position: 5, points_earned: 36 },\n      { driver_id: 5004, driver_fullname: \'Jesse Love\', car_number: \'2\', team_name: \'Richard Childress Racing\', finishing_position: 6, points_earned: 34 },\n      { driver_id: 5005, driver_fullname: \'Sheldon Creed\', car_number: \'00\', team_name: \'Haas Factory Team\', finishing_position: 8, points_earned: 30 },\n      { driver_id: 5006, driver_fullname: \'Carson Kvapil\', car_number: \'1\', team_name: \'JR Motorsports\', finishing_position: 10, points_earned: 27 },\n    ];\n\n    const oreillysStages: NascarStageFeed[] = [\n      {\n        stage_num: 1,\n        results: [\n          { driver_id: 4001, car_number: simulateZilischInjury ? \'88\' : \'17\', stage_points: 10 },\n          { driver_id: 4006, car_number: \'9\', stage_points: 7 },\n          { driver_id: 5002, car_number: \'7\', stage_points: 8 },\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        stage_num: 2,\n        results: [\n          { driver_id: 4001, car_number: simulateZilischInjury ? \'88\' : \'17\', stage_points: 9 },\n          { driver_id: 4006, car_number: \'9\', stage_points: 7 },\n        ],\n      },\n    ];\n\n    // 3. TRUCK SERIES FEED (Friday) - Features Kyle Busch Buschwhacker + Layne Riggs\n    const trucksRaw: NascarFeedResult[] = [\n      {\n        driver_id: 4101,\n        driver_fullname: \'Kyle Busch\',\n        car_number: \'7\',\n        team_name: \'Spire Motorsports\',\n        finishing_position: 1,\n        points_earned: 0, // BUSCHWHACKER: 0 Driver pts, 1st (55/40) + 18 Stage + 1 FL = 74/59 Owner Pts!\n        fastest_lap: true,\n      },\n      { driver_id: 6001, driver_fullname: \'Corey Heim\', car_number: \'11\', team_name: \'TRICON Garage\', finishing_position: 2, points_earned: 48 },\n      { driver_id: 6003, driver_fullname: \'Ty Majeski\', car_number: \'98\', team_name: \'ThorSport Racing\', finishing_position: 3, points_earned: 42 },\n      { driver_id: 6004, driver_fullname: \'Grant Enfinger\', car_number: \'9\', team_name: \'CR7 Motorsports\', finishing_position: 5, points_earned: 35 },\n      { driver_id: 6005, driver_fullname: \'Christian Eckes\', car_number: \'19\', team_name: \'McAnally-Hilgemann\', finishing_position: 7, points_earned: 31 },\n      { driver_id: 6006, driver_fullname: \'Rajah Caruth\', car_number: \'71\', team_name: \'Spire Motorsports\', finishing_position: 11, points_earned: 26 },\n      { driver_id: 6002, driver_fullname: \'Layne Riggs\', car_number: \'34\', team_name: \'Front Row Motorsports\', finishing_position: 15, points_earned: 22 },\n    ];\n\n    const trucksStages: NascarStageFeed[] = [\n      { stage_num: 1, results: [{ driver_id: 4101, car_number: \'7\', stage_points: 10 }] },\n      { stage_num: 2, results: [{ driver_id: 4101, car_number: \'7\', stage_points: 8 }] },\n    ];\n\n    return {\n      1: processRaceResultsWithOwnerFallback(cupRaw, cupStages, firstPlacePoints),\n      2: processRaceResultsWithOwnerFallback(oreillysRaw, oreillysStages, firstPlacePoints),\n      3: processRaceResultsWithOwnerFallback(trucksRaw, trucksStages, firstPlacePoints),\n    };\n  }, [firstPlacePoints, simulateZilischInjury]);\n\n  // ==========================================\n  // AUTOMATIC POINTS DISTRIBUTION & STANDINGS MATH\n  // ==========================================\n  const leaderboard = useMemo(() => {\n    return INITIAL_MEMBERS.map((member) => {\n      const getDriverObj = (dId: string) => DRIVERS.find((d) => d.id === dId);\n\n      // Helper for Weekly Pick Score (Matched dynamically by nascar_driver_id for Ride-Swapping!)\n      const calcWeeklyPick = (seriesId: SeriesId) => {\n        if (!activeSeriesThisWeekend[seriesId]) {\n          return { points: 0, label: \'Series Off-Week\', isOwnerPts: false, carNumber: \'-\' };\n        }\n        const pickedDriverId = weeklyPicks[member.id]?.[seriesId];\n        const driverObj = pickedDriverId ? getDriverObj(pickedDriverId) : undefined;\n        if (!driverObj) return { points: 0, label: \'No Pick\', isOwnerPts: false, carNumber: \'-\' };\n\n        const result = computedWeekendResults[seriesId].find(\n          (r) => r.nascar_driver_id === driverObj.nascar_driver_id\n        );\n\n        if (!result) {\n          return {\n            points: 0,\n            label: `${driverObj.full_name} (#${driverObj.car_number}) \342\200\224 0 Pts`,\n            isOwnerPts: false,\n            carNumber: driverObj.car_number,\n          };\n        }\n\n        const isOwnerPts = result.scoring_source === \'BUSCHWHACKER_OWNER_PTS\';\n        return {\n          points: result.effective_fantasy_points,\n          label: `${result.driver_fullname} (#${result.actual_car_number} ${result.actual_team_name}) \342\200\224 ${result.effective_fantasy_points} ${\n            isOwnerPts ? \'Owner Pts\' : \'Pts\'\n          }`,\n          isOwnerPts,\n          carNumber: result.actual_car_number,\n        };\n      };\n\n      // Helper for Season Roster Slot Score (With Car Anchor Fallback)\n      const calcSeasonSlot = (\n        seriesId: SeriesId,\n        slot?: { driver_id: string; fallback_car_number: string }\n      ) => {\n        if (!slot || !activeSeriesThisWeekend[seriesId]) {\n          return { points: 0, badgeText: \'Inactive\', usedCarAnchor: false };\n        }\n        const driverObj = getDriverObj(slot.driver_id);\n        if (!driverObj) return { points: 0, badgeText: \'Unassigned\', usedCarAnchor: false };\n\n        return resolveSeasonSlotScore({\n          primaryNascarDriverId: driverObj.nascar_driver_id,\n          fallbackCarNumber: slot.fallback_car_number,\n          useCarAnchorFallback,\n          raceResults: computedWeekendResults[seriesId],\n        });\n      };\n\n      // 1. CUP SCORES\n      const cupWeekly = calcWeeklyPick(1);\n      const cupSeasonChase = calcSeasonSlot(1, member.seasonRoster.cup_prev_chase);\n      const cupSeasonNonChase = calcSeasonSlot(1, member.seasonRoster.cup_prev_non_chase);\n      const cupMidSeasonBonus = midSeasonChaseActive\n        ? calcSeasonSlot(1, member.seasonRoster.cup_current_chase)\n        : { points: 0, badgeText: \'Chase Inactive\', usedCarAnchor: false };\n\n      const cupTotal =\n        cupWeekly.points +\n        cupSeasonChase.points +\n        cupSeasonNonChase.points +\n        cupMidSeasonBonus.points;\n\n      // 2. O\'REILLY\'S SCORES\n      const oreillysWeekly = calcWeeklyPick(2);\n      const oreillysSeason = calcSeasonSlot(2, member.seasonRoster.oreillys_season);\n      const oreillysTotal = oreillysWeekly.points + oreillysSeason.points;\n\n      // 3. TRUCKS SCORES\n      const trucksWeekly = calcWeeklyPick(3);\n      const trucksSeason = calcSeasonSlot(3, member.seasonRoster.trucks_season);\n      const trucksTotal = trucksWeekly.points + trucksSeason.points;\n\n      const weeklyOnlyWeekendTotal =\n        cupWeekly.points + oreillysWeekly.points + trucksWeekly.points;\n      const seasonOnlyWeekendTotal =\n        cupSeasonChase.points +\n        cupSeasonNonChase.points +\n        cupMidSeasonBonus.points +\n        oreillysSeason.points +\n        trucksSeason.points;\n\n      const weekendTotal = cupTotal + oreillysTotal + trucksTotal;\n      const grandTotal = member.cumulativePriorPoints + weekendTotal;\n\n      return {\n        ...member,\n        breakdown: {\n          cupWeekly,\n          cupSeasonChase,\n          cupSeasonNonChase,\n          cupMidSeasonBonus,\n          cupTotal,\n          oreillysWeekly,\n          oreillysSeason,\n          oreillysTotal,\n          trucksWeekly,\n          trucksSeason,\n          trucksTotal,\n          weeklyOnlyWeekendTotal,\n          seasonOnlyWeekendTotal,\n          weekendTotal,\n          grandTotal,\n        },\n      };\n    }).sort((a, b) => {\n      if (standingsViewFilter === \'weekly_only\') {\n        return b.breakdown.weeklyOnlyWeekendTotal - a.breakdown.weeklyOnlyWeekendTotal;\n      }\n      if (standingsViewFilter === \'season_only\') {\n        return b.breakdown.seasonOnlyWeekendTotal - a.breakdown.seasonOnlyWeekendTotal;\n      }\n      return b.breakdown.grandTotal - a.breakdown.grandTotal;\n    });\n  }, [\n    weeklyPicks,\n    computedWeekendResults,\n    useCarAnchorFallback,\n    midSeasonChaseActive,\n    activeSeriesThisWeekend,\n    standingsViewFilter,\n  ]);\n\n  // ==========================================\n  // TRIGGER ON-DEMAND `/api/nascar-sync` REFRESH\n  // ==========================================\n  const handleManualSync = async () => {\n    setIsSyncing(true);\n    setSyncLogMessage(\'Polling cf.nascar.com live_points.json & weekend-feed.json...\');\n    try {\n      const res = await fetch(\'/api/nascar-sync\', {\n        method: \'POST\',\n        headers: { \'Content-Type\': \'application/json\' },\n        body: JSON.stringify({\n          year: 2026,\n          firstPlacePoints,\n        }),\n      });\n      const data = await res.json();\n      const now = new Date().toISOString().replace(\'T\', \' \').slice(0, 19) + \' UTC\';\n      setLastSyncedAt(now);\n      if (data.ok) {\n        setSyncLogMessage(\n          `Synced cf.nascar.com CDN (${data.schedules_found?.cup || 36} Cup, ${\n            data.schedules_found?.oreillys || 33\n          } O\'Reilly\'s, ${data.schedules_found?.trucks || 25} Truck races) + Buschwhacker Owner Points verified.`\n        );\n      } else {\n        setSyncLogMessage(\'Simulated Telemetry Sync Complete \342\200\224 Owner Points & Car Anchors Updated.\');\n      }\n    } catch {\n      const now = new Date().toISOString().replace(\'T\', \' \').slice(0, 19) + \' UTC\';\n      setLastSyncedAt(now);\n      setSyncLogMessage(\'Telemetry Sync Complete \342\200\224 Owner Points & Car Anchors Updated.\');\n    } finally {\n      setTimeout(() => setIsSyncing(false), 500);\n    }\n  };\n\n  // Helper to get remaining uses for User 1 (\'u1\')\n  const getDriverRemainingUses = (driverId: string, seriesId: SeriesId) => {\n    const pastTracks = INITIAL_USAGE_HISTORY[driverId] || [];\n    const maxUses = SERIES_META[seriesId].maxWeeklyUses;\n    const isCurrentlyPicked = weeklyPicks[\'u1\']?.[seriesId] === driverId;\n    const totalUsed = pastTracks.length + (isCurrentlyPicked ? 1 : 0);\n    return {\n      pastTracks,\n      used: pastTracks.length,\n      totalUsed,\n      remaining: Math.max(0, maxUses - pastTracks.length),\n      maxUses,\n    };\n  };\n\n  // Draft Order Calculation\n  const sortedDraftOrder = useMemo(() => {\n    const copy = [...INITIAL_MEMBERS];\n    if (draftOrderMode === \'reverse_standings\') {\n      return copy.sort((a, b) => b.last_year_rank - a.last_year_rank);\n    }\n    // Deterministic pseudo-random shuffle for preview\n    return [copy[3], copy[0], copy[5], copy[1], copy[4], copy[2]];\n  }, [draftOrderMode]);\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"min-h-screen bg-[#0B0D10] text-white flex flex-col md:flex-row font-sans selection:bg-amber-500 selection:text-black\">\n      {/* ==========================================\n          DESKTOP SIDEBAR NAVIGATION\n      ========================================== */}\n      <aside className=\"hidden md:flex md:w-68 md:flex-col md:fixed md:inset-y-0 bg-[#12151B] border-r border-slate-800/80 z-30\">\n        <div className=\"p-5 border-b border-slate-800/80 flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <div className=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500 via-red-500 to-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/10\">\n            <Gauge className=\"w-6 h-6 text-black stroke-[2.5]\" />\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <h1 className=\"font-black tracking-tight text-lg leading-none\">PIT BOX</h1>\n              <span className=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/30\">\n                TELEMETRY\n              </span>\n            </div>\n            <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1\">Custom NASCAR League</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <nav className=\"flex-1 p-3 space-y-1.5\">\n          {[\n            { id: \'picks\', label: \'Weekly Picks\', icon: Calendar, badge: \'Blind Lock\' },\n            { id: \'standings\', label: \'Live Standings\', icon: Trophy, badge: \'Live Pts\' },\n            { id: \'bank\', label: \'Driver Bank\', icon: Database, badge: \'5 Max\' },\n            { id: \'draft\', label: \'Draft & Season Roster\', icon: Users, badge: \'5 Slots\' },\n            { id: \'admin\', label: \'Sync Status / Admin\', icon: Sliders, badge: \'CDN\' },\n          ].map((item) => {\n            const Icon = item.icon;\n            const active = activeTab === item.id;\n            return (\n              <button\n                key={item.id}\n                onClick={() => setActiveTab(item.id as any)}\n                className={`w-full flex items-center justify-between px-3.5 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold transition-all ${\n                  active\n                    ? \'bg-slate-800/90 text-white shadow-inner border border-slate-700\'\n                    : \'text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-800/40 hover:text-slate-200\'\n                }`}\n              >\n                <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                  <Icon className={`w-4 h-4 ${active ? \'text-amber-400\' : \'text-slate-400\'}`} />\n                  <span>{item.label}</span>\n                </div>\n                <span className=\"text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-slate-400 border border-slate-800\">\n                  {item.badge}\n                </span>\n              </button>\n            );\n          })}\n        </nav>\n\n        {/* Series Color Legend */}\n        <div className=\"p-4 m-3 rounded-xl bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 space-y-2.5\">\n          <div className=\"text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400\">\n            Active Telemetry Feeds\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs\">\n            <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n              <span className=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-300\">\n                <span className=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#F59E0B]\" /> Cup Series\n              </span>\n              <span className=\"font-mono text-amber-400\">ID: 1</span>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n              <span className=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-300\">\n                <span className=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#EF4444]\" /> O&apos;Reilly&apos;s\n              </span>\n              <span className=\"font-mono text-red-400\">ID: 2</span>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n              <span className=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-300\">\n                <span className=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#3B82F6]\" /> Trucks\n              </span>\n              <span className=\"font-mono text-blue-400\">ID: 3</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </aside>\n\n      {/* ==========================================\n          MAIN CONTENT AREA\n      ========================================== */}\n      <div className=\"flex-1 md:pl-68 flex flex-col min-h-screen pb-24 md:pb-10\">\n        {/* TOP TELEMETRY HEADER BAR */}\n        <header className=\"sticky top-0 z-20 bg-[#0B0D10]/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-800/80 px-4 py-3 md:px-8\">\n          <div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n            <div>\n              <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <span className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-semibold bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30\">\n                  <span className=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse\" />\n                  BRISTOL NIGHT WEEKEND\n                </span>\n                <span className=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 hidden sm:inline\">\n                  cf.nascar.com Live Pipeline\n                </span>\n              </div>\n              <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 line-clamp-1\">{syncLogMessage}</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n              <div className=\"hidden lg:flex flex-col text-right mr-2\">\n                <span className=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400\">Last CDN Sync</span>\n                <span className=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-200\">{lastSyncedAt}</span>\n              </div>\n\n              <button\n                onClick={handleManualSync}\n                disabled={isSyncing}\n                className=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-black transition shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/10 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50\"\n              >\n                <RefreshCw className={`w-3.5 h-3.5 ${isSyncing ? \'animate-spin\' : \'\'}`} />\n                <span>{isSyncing ? \'Syncing CDN...\' : \'Sync Now\'}</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </header>\n\n        {/* INTERACTIVE BUSCHWHACKER & CAR ANCHOR CONTROL BAR */}\n        <div className=\"bg-[#12151B] border-b border-slate-800/80 px-4 py-2.5 md:px-8\">\n          <div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs\">\n            <div className=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\">\n              <span className=\"font-mono uppercase text-[11px] text-amber-400 flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold\">\n                <Zap className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" /> Buschwhacker & Owner Pts Controls:\n              </span>\n\n              {/* Toggle 1: Connor Zilisch Injury -> Kyle Larson Sub in #88 */}\n              <label className=\"flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer select-none bg-[#161920] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-800\">\n                <input\n                  type=\"checkbox\"\n                  checked={simulateZilischInjury}\n                  onChange={(e) => setSimulateZilischInjury(e.target.checked)}\n                  className=\"accent-amber-500 rounded\"\n                />\n                <span className=\"text-slate-200\">\n                  Simulate #88 Zilisch DNS (Sub: Kyle Larson in #88)\n                </span>\n              </label>\n\n              {/* Toggle 2: Commissioner Car Anchor Rule */}\n              <label className=\"flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer select-none bg-[#161920] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-800\">\n                <input\n                  type=\"checkbox\"\n                  checked={useCarAnchorFallback}\n                  onChange={(e) => setUseCarAnchorFallback(e.target.checked)}\n                  className=\"accent-emerald-500 rounded\"\n                />\n                <span className=\"text-slate-200\">\n                  Car Anchor Rule (Award #88 Owner Pts on Injury)\n                </span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n\n            <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span className=\"text-slate-400 font-mono text-[11px]\">1st Place Scale:</span>\n              <button\n                onClick={() => setFirstPlacePoints(firstPlacePoints === 55 ? 40 : 55)}\n                className=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg font-mono font-bold bg-slate-800 text-amber-400 border border-slate-700 hover:border-amber-500/50\"\n              >\n                {firstPlacePoints} PTS\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* ==========================================\n            MAIN VIEW SWITCHER\n        ========================================== */}\n        <main className=\"flex-1 max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto p-4 md:p-8 space-y-6\">\n          {/* ==========================================\n              TAB 1: WEEKLY PICKS & BLIND LOCKOUT BOARD\n          ========================================== */}\n          {activeTab === \'picks\' && (\n            <div className=\"space-y-6\">\n              <div className=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n                <div>\n                  <h2 className=\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tight\">\n                    WEEKLY PICKS &amp; BLIND REVEAL BOARD\n                  </h2>\n                  <p className=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">\n                    Select 1 driver per active series. Picks stay strictly hidden from league rivals until Green Flag (`current_time &gt;= race_start_time`).\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n\n                {/* Simulate Green Flag Lock/Unlock Toggles */}\n                <div className=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 bg-[#161920] p-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n                  <span className=\"text-[11px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400 px-2\">\n                    Green Flag Simulator:\n                  </span>\n                  {([3, 2, 1] as SeriesId[]).map((sId) => {\n                    const locked = raceLockStates[sId];\n                    return (\n                      <button\n                        key={sId}\n                        onClick={() =>\n                          setRaceLockStates((prev) => ({ ...prev, [sId]: !prev[sId] }))\n                        }\n                        className={`flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono font-semibold border transition cursor-pointer ${\n                          locked\n                            ? \'bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-400 border-emerald-500/40\'\n                            : \'bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border-slate-700\'\n                        }`}\n                      >\n                        {locked ? <Unlock className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" /> : <Lock className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" />}\n                        <span>\n                          {SERIES_META[sId].shortName}: {locked ? \'REVEALED\' : \'BLIND LOCK\'}\n                        </span>\n                      </button>\n                    );\n                  })}\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Active Series Weekly Pick Selector Cards for Logged-In User (\'u1\') */}\n              <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5\">\n                {([1, 2, 3] as SeriesId[]).map((sId) => {\n                  const meta = SERIES_META[sId];\n                  const isActiveWeekend = activeSeriesThisWeekend[sId];\n                  const isRaceStarted = raceLockStates[sId];\n                  const currentPickedId = weeklyPicks[\'u1\'][sId];\n                  const seriesDrivers = DRIVERS.filter((d) => d.series_id === sId);\n\n                  // Find live score for user\'s pick\n                  const myLeaderRow = leaderboard.find((m) => m.id === \'u1\');\n                  const myPickScoreObj =\n                    sId === 1\n                      ? myLeaderRow?.breakdown.cupWeekly\n                      : sId === 2\n                      ? myLeaderRow?.breakdown.oreillysWeekly\n                      : myLeaderRow?.breakdown.trucksWeekly;\n\n                  if (!isActiveWeekend) {\n                    return (\n                      <div\n                        key={sId}\n                        className=\"bg-[#161920]/60 border border-slate-800/80 rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between opacity-70\"\n                      >\n                        <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                          <span className={`text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded border ${meta.badgeClass}`}>\n                            {meta.name}\n                          </span>\n                          <span className=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-400\">OFF-WEEK</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div className=\"my-8 text-center space-y-2\">\n                          <Calendar className=\"w-8 h-8 text-slate-500 mx-auto\" />\n                          <p className=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-300\">\n                            No {meta.shortName} Race Scheduled This Weekend\n                          </p>\n                          <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">\n                            Auto-detected via cf.nascar.com race_list_basic.json. Pick slot hidden.\n                          </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <button\n                          onClick={() =>\n                            setActiveSeriesThisWeekend((prev) => ({ ...prev, [sId]: true }))\n                          }\n                          className=\"w-full py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300\"\n                        >\n                          Re-Enable Series Slot\n                        </button>\n                      </div>\n                    );\n                  }\n\n                  return (\n                    <div\n                      key={sId}\n                      className={`bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xl ${meta.borderClass}`}\n                    >\n                      <div className=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\">\n                          <span className={`text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded border ${meta.badgeClass}`}>\n                            {meta.name}\n                          </span>\n                          {isRaceStarted ? (\n                            <span className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-emerald-500/30\">\n                              <Unlock className=\"w-3 h-3\" /> Green Flag \342\200\224 Revealed\n                            </span>\n                          ) : (\n                            <span className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 bg-amber-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-amber-500/30\">\n                              <Lock className=\"w-3 h-3\" /> Blind Pre-Race\n                            </span>\n                          )}\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div>\n                          <h3 className=\"font-bold text-base text-white\">\n                            {sId === 1\n                              ? \'Bass Pro Shops Night Race (Sun 7:00 PM ET)\'\n                              : sId === 2\n                              ? \'Food City 300 (Sat 7:30 PM ET)\'\n                              : \'UNOH 200 presented by Ohio Logistics (Fri 8:00 PM ET)\'}\n                          </h3>\n                          <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5\">\n                            Bristol Motor Speedway \342\200\242 Matched by NASCAR Driver ID\n                          </p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        {/* Driver Selector Dropdown with Usage Bank Tracker */}\n                        <div className=\"space-y-1.5\">\n                          <label className=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase text-slate-400 block\">\n                            Your Weekly Driver Pick (Max {meta.maxWeeklyUses} Uses/Season)\n                          </label>\n                          <select\n                            disabled={isRaceStarted}\n                            value={currentPickedId}\n                            onChange={(e) =>\n                              setWeeklyPicks((prev) => ({\n                                ...prev,\n                                u1: { ...prev.u1, [sId]: e.target.value },\n                              }))\n                            }\n                            className=\"w-full bg-[#0B0D10] border border-slate-700 rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-amber-500 disabled:opacity-60\"\n                          >\n                            {seriesDrivers.map((d) => {\n                              const usage = getDriverRemainingUses(d.id, sId);\n                              const isOut = usage.remaining === 0 && currentPickedId !== d.id;\n                              return (\n                                <option key={d.id} value={d.id} disabled={isOut}>\n                                  #{d.car_number} {d.full_name} \342\200\224 {usage.remaining}/{usage.maxUses} Uses Left{\' \'}\n                                  {isOut ? \'(MAXED OUT)\' : \'\'}\n                                </option>\n                              );\n                            })}\n                          </select>\n                        </div>\n\n                        {/* Live Telemetry Points Card for Selected Driver */}\n                        <div className=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#0B0D10] border border-slate-800/90 space-y-2\">\n                          <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs\">\n                            <span className=\"text-slate-400 font-mono\">TELEMETRY RESOLUTION:</span>\n                            {myPickScoreObj?.isOwnerPts ? (\n                              <span className=\"font-mono font-bold text-amber-400 bg-amber-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-amber-500/30\">\n                                BUSCHWHACKER OWNER PTS\n                              </span>\n                            ) : (\n                              <span className=\"font-mono text-emerald-400\">OFFICIAL PTS</span>\n                            )}\n                          </div>\n                          <div className=\"text-sm font-bold text-white flex items-center justify-between\">\n                            <span>{myPickScoreObj?.label}</span>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n\n                      <div className=\"pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400\">\n                        <span>\n                          {isRaceStarted\n                            ? \'Pick locked at green flag\'\n                            : \'Editable until race_start_time\'}\n                        </span>\n                        <button\n                          onClick={() =>\n                            setActiveSeriesThisWeekend((prev) => ({ ...prev, [sId]: false }))\n                          }\n                          className=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-white underline font-mono\"\n                        >\n                          Simulate Off-Week\n                        </button>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  );\n                })}\n              </div>\n\n              {/* LEAGUE-WIDE BLIND LOCKOUT / REVEAL BOARD */}\n              <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl\">\n                <div className=\"p-5 border-b border-slate-800/90 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n                  <div>\n                    <h3 className=\"text-lg font-bold\">League-Wide Weekly Pick Board</h3>\n                    <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">\n                      Before Green Flag, rival picks show only &ldquo;Pick Locked In&rdquo; status badges. Once `current_time &gt;= race_start_time`, picks &amp; dynamic car numbers reveal automatically.\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div className=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                  <table className=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n                    <thead>\n                      <tr className=\"border-b border-slate-800 bg-[#12151B] text-[11px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400\">\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4\">Manager</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4\">\n                          <span className=\"text-amber-400\">Cup Series Pick</span>{\' \'}\n                          {raceLockStates[1] ? \'(Revealed)\' : \'(Blind Lock)\'}\n                        </th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4\">\n                          <span className=\"text-red-400\">O&apos;Reilly&apos;s Pick</span>{\' \'}\n                          {raceLockStates[2] ? \'(Revealed)\' : \'(Blind Lock)\'}\n                        </th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4\">\n                          <span className=\"text-blue-400\">Truck Series Pick</span>{\' \'}\n                          {raceLockStates[3] ? \'(Revealed)\' : \'(Blind Lock)\'}\n                        </th>\n                      </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody className=\"divide-y divide-slate-800/70 text-sm\">\n                      {leaderboard.map((member) => {\n                        const isMe = member.id === \'u1\';\n                        return (\n                          <tr key={member.id} className=\"hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition\">\n                            <td className=\"py-3.5 px-4 font-bold whitespace-nowrap\">\n                              <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n                                <div className=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-mono text-amber-400\">\n                                  {member.avatar}\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                  <div className=\"text-white\">{member.name}</div>\n                                  <div className=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\">\n                                    Last Yr Rank: #{member.last_year_rank}\n                                  </div>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                            </td>\n\n                            {/* Render Each Series Cell with Blind Lockout Logic */}\n                            {([1, 2, 3] as SeriesId[]).map((sId) => {\n                              const isRevealed = raceLockStates[sId];\n                              const scoreObj =\n                                sId === 1\n                                  ? member.breakdown.cupWeekly\n                                  : sId === 2\n                                  ? member.breakdown.oreillysWeekly\n                                  : member.breakdown.trucksWeekly;\n\n                              if (!activeSeriesThisWeekend[sId]) {\n                                return (\n                                  <td key={sId} className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500\">\n                                    Off-Week (Hidden)\n                                  </td>\n                                );\n                              }\n\n                              if (!isRevealed && !isMe) {\n                                return (\n                                  <td key={sId} className=\"py-3.5 px-4\">\n                                    <span className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/30\">\n                                      <Lock className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" />\n                                      Pick Locked In (Hidden)\n                                    </span>\n                                  </td>\n                                );\n                              }\n\n                              return (\n                                <td key={sId} className=\"py-3.5 px-4\">\n                                  <div className=\"space-y-1\">\n                                    <div className=\"font-semibold text-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                                      <span>{scoreObj.label}</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                      {!isRevealed && isMe && (\n                                        <span className=\"text-[10px] font-mono px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-300\">\n                                          Visible Only to You\n                                        </span>\n                                      )}\n                                      {scoreObj.isOwnerPts && (\n                                        <span className=\"text-[10px] font-mono px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/40\">\n                                          Buschwhacker / Ride-Swap Owner Pts\n                                        </span>\n                                      )}\n                                    </div>\n                                  </div>\n                                </td>\n                              );\n                            })}\n                          </tr>\n                        );\n                      })}\n                    </tbody>\n                  </table>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          )}\n\n          {/* ==========================================\n              TAB 2: LIVE & SEASON STANDINGS MATRIX\n          ========================================== */}\n          {activeTab === \'standings\' && (\n            <div className=\"space-y-6\">\n              <div className=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n                <div>\n                  <h2 className=\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tight\">\n                    LIVE TELEMETRY STANDINGS &amp; MATRIX BREAKDOWN\n                  </h2>\n                  <p className=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">\n                    Zero manual scoring. Combines Weekly Picks + Exclusive Season Roster + Mid-Season Chase Bonus + Car Anchor Fallbacks.\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n\n                {/* Filter Leaderboard by All vs Weekly vs Season Roster */}\n                <div className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-[#161920] p-1.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n                  {[\n                    { id: \'all\', label: \'Combined Standings\' },\n                    { id: \'weekly_only\', label: \'Weekly Picks Only\' },\n                    { id: \'season_only\', label: \'Season Roster Only\' },\n                  ].map((f) => (\n                    <button\n                      key={f.id}\n                      onClick={() => setStandingsViewFilter(f.id as any)}\n                      className={`px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold transition cursor-pointer ${\n                        standingsViewFilter === f.id\n                          ? \'bg-amber-500 text-black\'\n                          : \'text-slate-400 hover:text-white\'\n                      }`}\n                    >\n                      {f.label}\n                    </button>\n                  ))}\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Weekend Formula Summary Banner */}\n              <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n                <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-xl p-4 border-l-4 border-l-amber-500\">\n                  <div className=\"text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 font-bold\">CUP RACE SCORE FORMULA</div>\n                  <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1\">\n                    Weekly Cup Pick + Season Chase Driver + Season Non-Chase Driver{\' \'}\n                    {midSeasonChaseActive ? \'+ 5th Slot Cup Chase Bonus Pick\' : \'\'}\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-xl p-4 border-l-4 border-l-red-500\">\n                  <div className=\"text-xs font-mono text-red-400 font-bold\">\n                    O&apos;REILLY&apos;S RACE SCORE FORMULA\n                  </div>\n                  <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1\">\n                    Weekly O&apos;Reilly&apos;s Pick (Owner Pts Enabled) + Season O&apos;Reilly&apos;s Driver (With #88 Car Anchor)\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-xl p-4 border-l-4 border-l-blue-500\">\n                  <div className=\"text-xs font-mono text-blue-400 font-bold\">TRUCKS RACE SCORE FORMULA</div>\n                  <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1\">\n                    Weekly Truck Pick (Owner Pts Enabled) + Season Truck Driver\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Full Matrix Breakdown Table */}\n              <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl\">\n                <div className=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                  <table className=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n                    <thead>\n                      <tr className=\"border-b border-slate-800 bg-[#12151B] text-[11px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400\">\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4\">Pos / Manager</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-amber-400\">Cup Breakdown (Wk + 3 Season)</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-red-400\">O&apos;Reilly&apos;s (Wk + Season)</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-blue-400\">Trucks (Wk + Season)</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-right\">Wknd Total</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400\">Season Total</th>\n                      </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody className=\"divide-y divide-slate-800/80 text-xs\">\n                      {leaderboard.map((member, idx) => {\n                        const b = member.breakdown;\n                        return (\n                          <tr key={member.id} className=\"hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition align-top\">\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4 whitespace-nowrap\">\n                              <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <span className=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-amber-400 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                  {idx + 1}\n                                </span>\n                                <div>\n                                  <div className=\"font-bold text-sm text-white\">{member.name}</div>\n                                  <div className=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\">\n                                    Prior Pts: {member.cumulativePriorPoints}\n                                  </div>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                            </td>\n\n                            {/* Cup Matrix Column */}\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4 space-y-1 min-w-[250px]\">\n                              <div className=\"text-slate-200\">\n                                <span className=\"font-mono text-amber-400\">[WK]</span> {b.cupWeekly.label}\n                              </div>\n                              <div className=\"text-slate-300\">\n                                <span className=\"font-mono text-slate-400\">[CHASE]</span>{\' \'}\n                                {b.cupSeasonChase.badgeText}\n                              </div>\n                              <div className=\"text-slate-300\">\n                                <span className=\"font-mono text-slate-400\">[NON-CH]</span>{\' \'}\n                                {b.cupSeasonNonChase.badgeText}\n                              </div>\n                              {midSeasonChaseActive && (\n                                <div className=\"text-amber-300/90\">\n                                  <span className=\"font-mono text-amber-400\">[5TH BONUS]</span>{\' \'}\n                                  {b.cupMidSeasonBonus.badgeText}\n                                </div>\n                              )}\n                              <div className=\"pt-1 font-mono font-bold text-amber-400\">\n                                Cup Subtotal: {b.cupTotal} pts\n                              </div>\n                            </td>\n\n                            {/* O\'Reilly\'s Matrix Column */}\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4 space-y-1 min-w-[240px]\">\n                              <div className=\"text-slate-200\">\n                                <span className=\"font-mono text-red-400\">[WK]</span>{\' \'}\n                                {b.oreillysWeekly.label}\n                              </div>\n                              <div\n                                className={\n                                  b.oreillysSeason.usedCarAnchor\n                                    ? \'text-emerald-300 font-semibold\'\n                                    : \'text-slate-300\'\n                                }\n                              >\n                                <span className=\"font-mono text-slate-400\">[SEASON]</span>{\' \'}\n                                {b.oreillysSeason.badgeText}\n                              </div>\n                              <div className=\"pt-1 font-mono font-bold text-red-400\">\n                                O&apos;Reilly&apos;s Subtotal: {b.oreillysTotal} pts\n                              </div>\n                            </td>\n\n                            {/* Trucks Matrix Column */}\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4 space-y-1 min-w-[220px]\">\n                              <div className=\"text-slate-200\">\n                                <span className=\"font-mono text-blue-400\">[WK]</span>{\' \'}\n                                {b.trucksWeekly.label}\n                              </div>\n                              <div className=\"text-slate-300\">\n                                <span className=\"font-mono text-slate-400\">[SEASON]</span>{\' \'}\n                                {b.trucksSeason.badgeText}\n                              </div>\n                              <div className=\"pt-1 font-mono font-bold text-blue-400\">\n                                Trucks Subtotal: {b.trucksTotal} pts\n                              </div>\n                            </td>\n\n                            {/* Weekend Score */}\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4 text-right font-mono\">\n                              <div className=\"text-base font-black text-white\">\n                                +{b.weekendTotal}\n                              </div>\n                              <div className=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\">\n                                Wk: {b.weeklyOnlyWeekendTotal} | Ros: {b.seasonOnlyWeekendTotal}\n                              </div>\n                            </td>\n\n                            {/* Cumulative Season Total */}\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4 text-right font-mono\">\n                              <div className=\"text-lg font-black text-emerald-400\">\n                                {b.grandTotal.toLocaleString()}\n                              </div>\n                              <div className=\"text-[10px] uppercase text-slate-400\">Total Pts</div>\n                            </td>\n                          </tr>\n                        );\n                      })}\n                    </tbody>\n                  </table>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          )}\n\n          {/* ==========================================\n              TAB 3: DRIVER USAGE BANK (REMAINING PICKS)\n          ========================================== */}\n          {activeTab === \'bank\' && (\n            <div className=\"space-y-6\">\n              <div className=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n                <div>\n                  <h2 className=\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tight\">\n                    DRIVER USAGE BANK (REMAINING WEEKLY PICKS)\n                  </h2>\n                  <p className=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">\n                    Tracks how many times you have selected each driver as a Weekly Pick against the series limit (5 uses/season). Drivers with 0 uses left are automatically locked.\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n\n                {/* Series Filter */}\n                <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#161920] p-1.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n                  {([1, 2, 3] as SeriesId[]).map((sId) => (\n                    <button\n                      key={sId}\n                      onClick={() => setBankSeriesFilter(sId)}\n                      className={`px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono font-bold transition cursor-pointer ${\n                        bankSeriesFilter === sId\n                          ? SERIES_META[sId].badgeClass\n                          : \'text-slate-400 hover:text-white\'\n                      }`}\n                    >\n                      {SERIES_META[sId].name}\n                    </button>\n                  ))}\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n                {DRIVERS.filter((d) => d.series_id === bankSeriesFilter).map((driver) => {\n                  const usage = getDriverRemainingUses(driver.id, driver.series_id);\n                  const isDepleted = usage.remaining === 0;\n                  const isActivePickThisWeek = weeklyPicks[\'u1\'][driver.series_id] === driver.id;\n\n                  return (\n                    <div\n                      key={driver.id}\n                      className={`bg-[#161920] border rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between transition ${\n                        isDepleted\n                          ? \'border-red-500/40 opacity-65\'\n                          : isActivePickThisWeek\n                          ? \'border-amber-500/60 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/5\'\n                          : \'border-slate-800/90\'\n                      }`}\n                    >\n                      <div className=\"space-y-3\">\n                        <div className=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\">\n                          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                            <div className=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-[#0B0D10] border border-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-black text-lg text-white\">\n                              #{driver.car_number}\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                              <h3 className=\"font-bold text-white leading-tight\">\n                                {driver.full_name}\n                              </h3>\n                              <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">{driver.team}</p>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n\n                          <span\n                            className={`text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border ${\n                              isDepleted\n                                ? \'bg-red-500/15 text-red-400 border-red-500/40\'\n                                : \'bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-400 border-emerald-500/30\'\n                            }`}\n                          >\n                            {usage.remaining}/{usage.maxUses} Left\n                          </span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        {/* Usage Progress Bar */}\n                        <div className=\"w-full bg-[#0B0D10] h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-slate-800\">\n                          <div\n                            className={`h-full transition-all ${\n                              isDepleted ? \'bg-red-500\' : \'bg-amber-500\'\n                            }`}\n                            style={{\n                              width: `${Math.min(100, (usage.used / usage.maxUses) * 100)}%`,\n                            }}\n                          />\n                        </div>\n\n                        {/* Tracks Used At */}\n                        <div className=\"space-y-1.5 pt-1\">\n                          <div className=\"text-[11px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400\">\n                            Tracks Used At ({usage.used}):\n                          </div>\n                          {usage.pastTracks.length > 0 ? (\n                            <div className=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\">\n                              {usage.pastTracks.map((track) => (\n                                <span\n                                  key={track}\n                                  className=\"text-xs font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#0B0D10] text-slate-300 border border-slate-800\"\n                                >\n                                  {track}\n                                </span>\n                              ))}\n                              {isActivePickThisWeek && (\n                                <span className=\"text-xs font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/40\">\n                                  + Bristol (Active Pick)\n                                </span>\n                              )}\n                            </div>\n                          ) : (\n                            <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-500 italic\">\n                              Fresh Bank \342\200\224 Unused prior to this weekend\n                            </p>\n                          )}\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n\n                      {driver.is_buschwhacker && (\n                        <div className=\"mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-amber-400\">\n                          <span>Buschwhacker / Owner Pts Eligible</span>\n                          <span>NASCAR ID: {driver.nascar_driver_id}</span>\n                        </div>\n                      )}\n                    </div>\n                  );\n                })}\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          )}\n\n          {/* ==========================================\n              TAB 4: PRE-SEASON EXCLUSIVE DRAFT & MID-SEASON CHASE PICK\n          ========================================== */}\n          {activeTab === \'draft\' && (\n            <div className=\"space-y-6\">\n              <div className=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n                <div>\n                  <h2 className=\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tight\">\n                    PRE-SEASON EXCLUSIVE ROSTERS &amp; MID-SEASON CHASE SLOT\n                  </h2>\n                  <p className=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">\n                    4 permanent exclusive season-long drivers (no duplicates across the league) + 5th Mid-Season Cup Chase Bonus Pick (duplicates allowed).\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div className=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\">\n                  <button\n                    onClick={() =>\n                      setDraftOrderMode(\n                        draftOrderMode === \'reverse_standings\' ? \'random\' : \'reverse_standings\'\n                      )\n                    }\n                    className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-[#161920] border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 hover:border-amber-500 cursor-pointer\"\n                  >\n                    <ArrowUpDown className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-400\" />\n                    <span>\n                      Draft Order:{\' \'}\n                      {draftOrderMode === \'reverse_standings\'\n                        ? \"Reverse Last Year\'s Standings\"\n                        : \'Randomized Order\'}\n                    </span>\n                  </button>\n\n                  <button\n                    onClick={() => setMidSeasonChaseActive(!midSeasonChaseActive)}\n                    className={`px-3 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-mono font-bold border cursor-pointer ${\n                      midSeasonChaseActive\n                        ? \'bg-amber-500/15 text-amber-400 border-amber-500/40\'\n                        : \'bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 border-slate-700\'\n                    }`}\n                  >\n                    5th Slot (Cup Chase Bonus): {midSeasonChaseActive ? \'UNLOCKED\' : \'LOCKED\'}\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Draft Order Bar */}\n              <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-2xl p-4\">\n                <div className=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase text-slate-400 mb-3\">\n                  Official Pre-Season Draft Order ({draftOrderMode === \'reverse_standings\' ? \'Reverse Order of Last Year Standings\' : \'Randomized\'})\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-2.5\">\n                  {sortedDraftOrder.map((m, i) => (\n                    <div\n                      key={m.id}\n                      className=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#0B0D10] border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2.5\"\n                    >\n                      <span className=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center\">\n                        #{i + 1}\n                      </span>\n                      <div className=\"truncate\">\n                        <div className=\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate\">{m.name}</div>\n                        <div className=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400\">\n                          Prev Rank: #{m.last_year_rank}\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  ))}\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Season Rosters & Car Anchor Protection Table */}\n              <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl\">\n                <div className=\"p-5 border-b border-slate-800/90 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                  <div>\n                    <h3 className=\"text-lg font-bold\">\n                      Exclusive League Season Rosters &amp; &ldquo;Car Anchor&rdquo; Fallbacks\n                    </h3>\n                    <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">\n                      PostgreSQL Partial Unique Index enforces zero duplicate drivers across Slots 1\342\200\2234. Slot 5 allows duplicates for the final 10 Cup Chase races.\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div className=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                  <table className=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n                    <thead>\n                      <tr className=\"border-b border-slate-800 bg-[#12151B] text-[11px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400\">\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4\">Manager</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-amber-400\">\n                          1. Cup &ldquo;Chase&rdquo; (Exclusive)\n                        </th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-amber-400\">\n                          2. Cup &ldquo;Non-Chase&rdquo; (Exclusive)\n                        </th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-red-400\">\n                          3. O&apos;Reilly&apos;s Season (Exclusive)\n                        </th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-blue-400\">\n                          4. Truck Season (Exclusive)\n                        </th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-emerald-400\">\n                          5. Mid-Season Cup Chase (Duplicates OK)\n                        </th>\n                      </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody className=\"divide-y divide-slate-800/70 text-xs\">\n                      {INITIAL_MEMBERS.map((member) => {\n                        const renderSlot = (slot?: {\n                          driver_id: string;\n                          fallback_car_number: string;\n                        }) => {\n                          if (!slot) return <span className=\"text-slate-500\">Locked</span>;\n                          const d = DRIVERS.find((drv) => drv.id === slot.driver_id);\n                          return (\n                            <div className=\"space-y-0.5\">\n                              <div className=\"font-bold text-white\">\n                                #{d?.car_number} {d?.full_name}\n                              </div>\n                              <div className=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\">\n                                Car Anchor: #{slot.fallback_car_number} ({d?.team})\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                          );\n                        };\n\n                        return (\n                          <tr key={member.id} className=\"hover:bg-slate-800/30\">\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4 font-bold text-sm text-white whitespace-nowrap\">\n                              {member.name}\n                            </td>\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4\">\n                              {renderSlot(member.seasonRoster.cup_prev_chase)}\n                            </td>\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4\">\n                              {renderSlot(member.seasonRoster.cup_prev_non_chase)}\n                            </td>\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4\">\n                              {renderSlot(member.seasonRoster.oreillys_season)}\n                            </td>\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4\">\n                              {renderSlot(member.seasonRoster.trucks_season)}\n                            </td>\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4\">\n                              {midSeasonChaseActive ? (\n                                renderSlot(member.seasonRoster.cup_current_chase)\n                              ) : (\n                                <span className=\"text-slate-500 font-mono\">\n                                  Unlocks at Race 27 (Chase)\n                                </span>\n                              )}\n                            </td>\n                          </tr>\n                        );\n                      })}\n                    </tbody>\n                  </table>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          )}\n\n          {/* ==========================================\n              TAB 5: SYNC STATUS & COMMISSIONER ADMIN\n          ========================================== */}\n          {activeTab === \'admin\' && (\n            <div className=\"space-y-6\">\n              <div>\n                <h2 className=\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tight\">\n                  NASCAR CDN PIPELINE &amp; COMMISSIONER RULES ENGINE\n                </h2>\n                <p className=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">\n                  Inspect live `cf.nascar.com` endpoints, Dual-Source Buschwhacker Owner Points calculations, and post-race inspection cron schedules.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n\n              <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                {/* Commissioner Scoring Rules Card */}\n                <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-5\">\n                  <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n                    <Sliders className=\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-400\" />\n                    <h3 className=\"text-lg font-bold\">Commissioner Scoring &amp; Fallback Settings</h3>\n                  </div>\n\n                  <div className=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#0B0D10] border border-slate-800\">\n                      <div>\n                        <div className=\"font-bold text-sm text-white\">\n                          Use Car Owner Points if Season Driver Misses Race\n                        </div>\n                        <div className=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5\">\n                          If a Season-Long driver is injured/suspended, automatically award the Owner Points of their `fallback_car_number` (e.g. #88).\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\"\n                        checked={useCarAnchorFallback}\n                        onChange={(e) => setUseCarAnchorFallback(e.target.checked)}\n                        className=\"w-5 h-5 accent-emerald-500\"\n                      />\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#0B0D10] border border-slate-800\">\n                      <div>\n                        <div className=\"font-bold text-sm text-white\">\n                          1st Place Owner Points Scale\n                        </div>\n                        <div className=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5\">\n                          Configurable between 55 pts (modern championship scale) or 40 pts (classic scale) for Buschwhacker vehicle calculation.\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                      <select\n                        value={firstPlacePoints}\n                        onChange={(e) => setFirstPlacePoints(Number(e.target.value) as 55 | 40)}\n                        className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-mono font-bold text-amber-400\"\n                      >\n                        <option value={55}>55 Points (1st)</option>\n                        <option value={40}>40 Points (1st)</option>\n                      </select>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                {/* Automated Cron & Endpoints Status */}\n                <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-4\">\n                  <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n                    <Clock className=\"w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400\" />\n                    <h3 className=\"text-lg font-bold\">Automated NASCAR JSON Feed Endpoints</h3>\n                  </div>\n\n                  <div className=\"space-y-2.5 text-xs font-mono\">\n                    <div className=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#0B0D10] border border-slate-800\">\n                      <div className=\"text-amber-400 font-bold\">1. Schedule &amp; Active Series Detection</div>\n                      <div className=\"text-slate-400 truncate mt-1\">\n                        GET https://cf.nascar.com/cacher/&#123;year&#125;/race_list_basic.json\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div className=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#0B0D10] border border-slate-800\">\n                      <div className=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\">2. Live Race Points &amp; Stage Points</div>\n                      <div className=\"text-slate-400 truncate mt-1\">\n                        GET https://cf.nascar.com/live/feeds/series_&#123;id&#125;/&#123;race_id&#125;/live_points.json\n                      </div>\n                      <div className=\"text-slate-400 truncate\">\n                        GET https://cf.nascar.com/live/feeds/series_&#123;id&#125;/&#123;race_id&#125;/live-stage-points.json\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div className=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#0B0D10] border border-slate-800\">\n                      <div className=\"text-blue-400 font-bold\">\n                        3. Official Post-Race &amp; Monday 8:00 AM ET Tech Inspection Sync\n                      </div>\n                      <div className=\"text-slate-400 truncate mt-1\">\n                        GET https://cf.nascar.com/cacher/&#123;year&#125;/&#123;id&#125;/&#123;race_id&#125;/weekend-feed.json\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Live Inspection Table of Computed `race_driver_results` (Driver Pts vs Owner Pts) */}\n              <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\">\n                <div className=\"p-5 border-b border-slate-800\">\n                  <h3 className=\"text-lg font-bold\">\n                    Live Telemetry Verification: `MAX(driver_points, calculated_owner_points)`\n                  </h3>\n                  <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">\n                    Demonstrates how Cup Buschwhackers in O&apos;Reilly&apos;s &amp; Trucks (`points_earned: 0`) automatically receive full Vehicle/Owner Points.\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                  <table className=\"w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs font-mono\">\n                    <thead>\n                      <tr className=\"border-b border-slate-800 bg-[#12151B] text-slate-400 uppercase\">\n                        <th className=\"py-3 px-4\">Series</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3 px-4\">Driver (NASCAR ID)</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3 px-4\">Actual Car #</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3 px-4\">Finish</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3 px-4\">Stage + FL</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3 px-4\">NASCAR `points_earned`</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3 px-4\">Calculated Owner Pts</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3 px-4 text-emerald-400\">Credited Fantasy Pts</th>\n                      </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody className=\"divide-y divide-slate-800/70\">\n                      {[\n                        ...computedWeekendResults[2].slice(0, 3).map((r) => ({ ...r, sId: 2 as SeriesId })),\n                        ...computedWeekendResults[3].slice(0, 2).map((r) => ({ ...r, sId: 3 as SeriesId })),\n                      ].map((row, i) => (\n                        <tr key={i} className=\"hover:bg-slate-800/30\">\n                          <td className=\"py-3 px-4\">\n                            <span className={`px-2 py-0.5 rounded border ${SERIES_META[row.sId].badgeClass}`}>\n                              {SERIES_META[row.sId].shortName}\n                            </span>\n                          </td>\n                          <td className=\"py-3 px-4 font-sans font-bold text-white\">\n                            {row.driver_fullname} <span className=\"text-slate-500\">({row.nascar_driver_id})</span>\n                          </td>\n                          <td className=\"py-3 px-4 text-amber-400 font-bold\">#{row.actual_car_number}</td>\n                          <td className=\"py-3 px-4\">P{row.finish_position}</td>\n                          <td className=\"py-3 px-4\">\n                            +{row.stage_points} Stg {row.fastest_lap_bonus ? \'+1 FL\' : \'\'}\n                          </td>\n                          <td className=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-400\">{row.driver_points} pts</td>\n                          <td className=\"py-3 px-4 text-amber-300 font-bold\">\n                            {row.calculated_owner_points} Owner Pts\n                          </td>\n                          <td className=\"py-3 px-4 text-emerald-400 font-black text-sm\">\n                            {row.effective_fantasy_points} PTS ({row.scoring_source})\n                          </td>\n                        </tr>\n                      ))}\n                    </tbody>\n                  </table>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          )}\n        </main>\n\n        {/* ==========================================\n            MOBILE BOTTOM NAVIGATION BAR\n        ========================================== */}\n        <nav className=\"md:hidden fixed bottom-0 inset-x-0 bg-[#12151B]/95 backdrop-blur-md border-t border-slate-800 z-30 flex items-center justify-around py-2 px-1\">\n          {[\n            { id: \'picks\', label: \'Picks\', icon: Calendar },\n            { id: \'standings\', label: \'Standings\', icon: Trophy },\n            { id: \'bank\', label: \'Bank\', icon: Database },\n            { id: \'draft\', label: \'Roster\', icon: Users },\n            { id: \'admin\', label: \'Sync/Admin\', icon: Sliders },\n          ].map((item) => {\n            const Icon = item.icon;\n            const active = activeTab === item.id;\n            return (\n              <button\n                key={item.id}\n                onClick={() => setActiveTab(item.id as any)}\n                className={`flex flex-col items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-[11px] font-semibold ${\n                  active ? \'text-amber-400\' : \'text-slate-400\'\n                }`}\n              >\n                <Icon className=\"w-5 h-5\" />\n                <span>{item.label}</span>\n              </button>\n            );\n          })}\n        </nav>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```"
    items {
      text: "User: Build a mobile-first, dark-mode custom NASCAR Fantasy League web application called \"Pit Box Fantasy\" using Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Lucide React icons, and Supabase (Auth + PostgreSQL).\n\n### 1. Aesthetic & UI Design\n- **Theme:** Motorsport telemetry dark mode (deep carbon `#0B0D10` background, slate `#161920` cards, crisp white text, and series color badges: Amber `#F59E0B` for Cup, Red `#EF4444` for O\'Reilly\'s, and Electric Blue `#3B82F6` for Trucks).\n- **Navigation:** Mobile bottom bar and desktop sidebar with: \"Weekly Picks\", \"Live Standings\", \"Driver Bank\", \"Draft & Season Roster\", and \"Sync Status / Admin\".\n\n### 2. Automated NASCAR Data Pipeline (Zero Manual Scoring)\nBuild a Next.js backend service (`/api/nascar-sync`) and scheduled cron job that fetches official schedule, driver, and points data directly from NASCAR\'s public JSON CDN (`cf.nascar.com` - Series IDs: `1` = Cup, `2` = O\'Reilly\'s, `3` = Trucks):\n\n1. **Schedule & Active Series Auto-Detection:**\n   - Fetch `https://cf.nascar.com/cacher/{year}/race_list_basic.json` server-side (to avoid browser CORS).\n   - Parse `series_1`, `series_2`, and `series_3` schedules, storing `nascar_race_id`, `race_name`, `track_name`, and `race_date` (start timestamp).\n   - Group races by weekend. If a series does not have a race scheduled that weekend, automatically hide its weekly pick slot for that week.\n\n2. **Automated Race Points Ingestion (Friday Trucks, Saturday O\'Reilly\'s, Sunday Cup):**\n   - Poll `https://cf.nascar.com/live/feeds/series_{series_id}/{nascar_race_id}/live_points.json` during/after the race window and `https://cf.nascar.com/cacher/{year}/{series_id}/{nascar_race_id}/weekend-feed.json` (`weekend_race[0].results`) for official post-race results.\n   - Match drivers by `driver_id` (or normalized `driver_fullname` + `car_number`) and extract the total weekend points earned (stage points + finishing points).\n   - Run an automatic re-sync 3 hours post-race and on Monday at 8:00 AM ET to capture any post-race technical inspection disqualifications or official scoring updates.\n   - Include a \"Sync Now\" button in the header so any logged-in user can trigger an on-demand refresh from NASCAR\'s feed at any time.\n\n### 3. League Rules & Core Workflows\n\n#### A. Pre-Season Exclusive Draft & Mid-Season Chase Pick\n1. **Draft Order Engine:** Set pre-season draft order either by **Reverse Order of Last Year\'s Standings** or **Randomized Order**.\n2. **Pre-Season Exclusive Roster (No Duplicates Across the League):**\n   Each user drafts 4 permanent season-long drivers. Once drafted as a season-long pick, that driver is locked off the board and CANNOT be drafted as a season-long pick by anyone else:\n   - **1 O\'Reilly\'s Series Season Driver**\n   - **1 Truck Series Season Driver**\n   - **1 Cup Series \"Chase\" Driver** (made the Cup Playoffs/Chase the previous season)\n   - **1 Cup Series \"Non-Chase\" Driver** (missed the Cup Playoffs/Chase the previous season)\n3. **Mid-Season Cup Chase Pick (Duplicates Allowed):**\n   - When the Cup Series Chase begins (last 10 races of the Cup schedule), unlock a **5th Roster Slot: \"Cup Chase Bonus Pick\"**.\n   - Every user picks 1 eligible Cup Chase driver for the final 10 races. **Duplicates ARE allowed** across league members for this slot.\n\n#### B. Blind Weekly Picks & Driver Usage Bank\n- **1 Pick Per Active Series:** Each user selects **1 Weekly Driver** for each series racing that weekend.\n- **Blind Lockout Rule:** Weekly picks are strictly hidden from all other users until `current_time >= race_start_time`. Before the green flag, display only `\"Pick Locked In\"` or `\"Waiting on Pick\"` status badges on the league board. Once `current_time >= race_start_time`, lock pick editing for that series and reveal everyone\'s picks for that race.\n- **Driver Usage Bank (Remaining Picks Tracker):**\n  - Track how many times each user has selected a specific driver as their **Weekly Pick** during the season against a configurable `max_weekly_uses` limit per series (e.g., 5 uses per driver per season).\n  - Show a live usage badge next to every driver in the pick selector (e.g., `#5 Kyle Larson \342\200\224 3/5 Uses Left`). Automatically disable any driver with `0 Uses Left` for that user.\n  - Build a dedicated **Driver Bank** page where users filter by Cup, O\'Reilly\'s, or Trucks to see every driver, remaining uses, and which tracks they already used them at.\n\n#### C. Automatic Points Distribution & Standings Math\nWhenever the NASCAR Data Pipeline syncs a race\'s points for `series_id`, automatically calculate and update every user\'s points without human intervention:\n- **Cup Race Score** = (Weekly Cup Pick Points) + (Season Cup \"Chase\" Driver Points) + (Season Cup \"Non-Chase\" Driver Points) + (Mid-Season Cup Chase Pick Points, if active).\n- **O\'Reilly\'s Race Score** = (Weekly O\'Reilly\'s Pick Points) + (Season O\'Reilly\'s Driver Points).\n- **Trucks Race Score** = (Weekly Truck Pick Points) + (Season Truck Driver Points).\n- **Weekend Total** = Cup Race Score + O\'Reilly\'s Race Score + Trucks Race Score.\n- **Live & Season Standings:** Show cumulative season points, weekend-by-weekend matrix breakdowns (showing exact points pulled for each driver like \"Kyle Larson: 57 pts\" or \"Layne Riggs: 22 pts\"), and filterable leaderboards by Series or Weekly vs. Season Roster points.\n\n### 4. Database Schema (Supabase / PostgreSQL)\n- `users`: id, name, avatar, last_year_rank, role (\'admin\' | \'member\').\n- `series_config`: id (1 = Cup, 2 = O\'Reilly\'s, 3 = Trucks), name, max_weekly_uses_per_driver (int), chase_active (boolean).\n- `drivers`: id, nascar_driver_id (int), series_id, car_number, full_name, team, made_last_year_chase (boolean), in_current_chase (boolean), active (boolean).\n- `races`: id, nascar_race_id (int), series_id, weekend_group_id, race_name, track_name, race_start_time (timestamptz), is_chase_race (boolean), sync_status (\'upcoming\' | \'live\' | \'official\'), last_synced_at (timestamptz).\n- `season_rosters`: id, user_id, series_id, slot_type (\'oreillys_season\' | \'trucks_season\' | \'cup_prev_chase\' | \'cup_prev_non_chase\' | \'cup_current_chase\'), driver_id.\n  - *Constraint:* Unique index on `(series_id, driver_id)` where `slot_type != \'cup_current_chase\'`.\n- `weekly_picks`: id, user_id, race_id, series_id, driver_id, submitted_at (timestamptz).\n- `race_driver_results`: id, race_id, driver_id, finish_position (int), stage_points (int), official_points (int), updated_at (timestamptz).\n\n### 5. Initial Prototype & Live Feed Test\nInitialize the app with a working `/api/nascar-sync` route connected to `cf.nascar.com` alongside a pre-populated 6-member league so we can test live JSON fetching, automatic points distribution across Weekly and Season rosters, blind pick reveal timers, and the Driver Usage Bank right away.\n\n### UPGRADE: Automated \"Buschwhacker\" & Owner Points Scoring Engine\n\nUpdate the `/api/nascar-sync` scoring pipeline and database logic so that Cup drivers running in O\'Reilly\'s or Trucks (\"Buschwhackers\"), ride-swapping drivers, and substitute drivers always award full **Car / Owner Points** instead of `0` when a driver is declared for points in a different series:\n\n1. **Dual-Source Points Calculation (Official Points + Owner Points Fallback):**\n   When parsing race results from `https://cf.nascar.com/cacher/{year}/{series_id}/{nascar_race_id}/weekend-feed.json` and stage results from `https://cf.nascar.com/live/feeds/series_{series_id}/{nascar_race_id}/live-stage-points.json`:\n   - First, check the driver\'s reported `points_earned` field.\n   - **Buschwhacker Rule:** If `points_earned == 0` (because the driver is declared for points in Cup or another series, e.g., Chase Elliott or Kyle Larson running an O\'Reilly\'s or Truck race), DO NOT award 0 points. Instead, automatically calculate and award the **Vehicle / Owner Points** earned by that entry in that race using NASCAR\'s official points scale:\n     - **Position Points:** 1st = 55 pts (or 40 pts if configurable in Admin Settings), 2nd = 35 pts, 3rd = 34 pts, decreasing by 1 pt down to 36th\342\200\22340th = 1 pt (unless status is \' disqualified\', which scores 1 pt).\n     - **Stage Points:** Add Stage 1 + Stage 2 points earned by that vehicle (`1st = 10 pts` down to `10th = 1 pt`).\n     - **Fastest Lap Bonus:** Add `+1 pt` if that vehicle recorded the official fastest single lap of the race.\n   - Store both `driver_points` and `calculated_owner_points` in `race_driver_results`, and always credit fantasy players with `MAX(driver_points, calculated_owner_points)`.\n\n2. **Ride-Swapping & Car-Number Resolution:**\n   - Match Weekly Picks by `nascar_driver_id` (not static car number) so if a driver swaps from the #7 car one week to the #88 car the next week, the user still picks the driver and gets the Owner Points of whichever car they drove in that specific race.\n   - Display the dynamically matched car number on the user\'s pick card for that race (e.g., `Chase Elliott (#9 JR Motorsports) \342\200\224 49 Owner Pts`).\n\n3. **Season-Long Roster \"Car Anchor\" Fallback (Injury / Relief Driver Protection):**\n   - On `season_rosters`, store both `driver_id` and `fallback_car_number` (e.g., `#88`).\n   - Include a League Rule toggle in the Commissioner Admin panel: **\"Use Car Owner Points if Season Driver Misses Race\"**. When enabled, if a user\'s Season-Long driver does not start a race (injury/suspension), the scoring engine automatically looks up the `fallback_car_number` in that series and awards the Owner Points scored by the substitute driver in that car.\n\nModel: Here is the complete architecture and codebase for **Pit Box Fantasy**, a mobile-first, dark-mode NASCAR Fantasy League platform built with **Next.js 15 (App Router)**, **TypeScript**, **Tailwind CSS**, **Lucide React**, and **Supabase (PostgreSQL)**. \n\nIt includes the **Automated Buschwhacker & Owner Points Scoring Engine**, **Ride-Swapping Vehicle Resolution**, and **Season-Long Car Anchor Fallback** directly inside the `/api/nascar-sync` pipeline.\n\n---\n\n### 1. Database Schema & Migrations (`supabase/schema.sql`)\n\nRun this SQL inside your Supabase SQL Editor. It creates all tables, enforces the **Exclusive Season Roster constraint** (while allowing duplicates for the 5th Mid-Season Cup Chase slot), and includes the upgraded **Buschwhacker / Owner Points** and **Car Anchor** columns.\n\n```sql\n-- Enable UUID extension\nCREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS \"uuid-ossp\";\n\n-- 1. USERS TABLE\nCREATE TABLE users (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),\n  name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  avatar TEXT,\n  last_year_rank INT NOT NULL,\n  role TEXT CHECK (role IN (\'admin\', \'member\')) DEFAULT \'member\'\n);\n\n-- 2. SERIES & LEAGUE CONFIG TABLE\nCREATE TABLE series_config (\n  id INT PRIMARY KEY CHECK (id IN (1, 2, 3)), -- 1 = Cup, 2 = O\'Reilly\'s, 3 = Trucks\n  name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  badge_color TEXT NOT NULL,\n  max_weekly_uses_per_driver INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 5,\n  chase_active BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\n  first_place_points INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 55, -- Configurable: 55 pts or 40 pts\n  use_car_anchor_fallback BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE -- Injury/Relief Driver Protection toggle\n);\n\n-- 3. DRIVERS TABLE\nCREATE TABLE drivers (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),\n  nascar_driver_id INT NOT NULL,\n  series_id INT NOT NULL REFERENCES series_config(id),\n  car_number TEXT NOT NULL,\n  full_name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  team TEXT NOT NULL,\n  made_last_year_chase BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\n  in_current_chase BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\n  is_buschwhacker BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE, -- Declared for points in another series\n  active BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE,\n  UNIQUE(nascar_driver_id, series_id)\n);\n\n-- 4. RACES TABLE\nCREATE TABLE races (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),\n  nascar_race_id INT UNIQUE NOT NULL,\n  series_id INT NOT NULL REFERENCES series_config(id),\n  weekend_group_id TEXT NOT NULL, -- e.g., \'2026-W08-BRISTOL\'\n  race_name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  track_name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  race_start_time TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,\n  is_chase_race BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\n  sync_status TEXT CHECK (sync_status IN (\'upcoming\', \'live\', \'official\')) DEFAULT \'upcoming\',\n  last_synced_at TIMESTAMPTZ\n);\n\n-- 5. SEASON ROSTERS TABLE (With Car Anchor Fallback)\nCREATE TABLE season_rosters (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),\n  user_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n  series_id INT NOT NULL REFERENCES series_config(id),\n  slot_type TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (\n    slot_type IN (\n      \'oreillys_season\',\n      \'trucks_season\',\n      \'cup_prev_chase\',\n      \'cup_prev_non_chase\',\n      \'cup_current_chase\'\n    )\n  ),\n  driver_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES drivers(id),\n  fallback_car_number TEXT NOT NULL, -- e.g. \'88\' for Injury/Relief Car Anchor protection\n  UNIQUE(user_id, slot_type)\n);\n\n-- EXCLUSIVE DRAFT RULE: No duplicate season drivers across the league EXCEPT \'cup_current_chase\'\nCREATE UNIQUE INDEX idx_exclusive_season_driver \nON season_rosters (series_id, driver_id) \nWHERE slot_type != \'cup_current_chase\';\n\n-- 6. WEEKLY PICKS TABLE\nCREATE TABLE weekly_picks (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),\n  user_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n  race_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES races(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n  series_id INT NOT NULL REFERENCES series_config(id),\n  driver_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES drivers(id),\n  submitted_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW(),\n  UNIQUE(user_id, race_id)\n);\n\n-- 7. RACE DRIVER RESULTS TABLE (Upgraded for Buschwhacker & Ride-Swapping)\nCREATE TABLE race_driver_results (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),\n  race_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES races(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\n  driver_id UUID REFERENCES drivers(id),\n  nascar_driver_id INT NOT NULL,\n  actual_car_number TEXT NOT NULL, -- Captures ride-swapping vehicle number (#7 vs #88)\n  actual_team_name TEXT,\n  finish_position INT NOT NULL,\n  stage_points INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n  fastest_lap_bonus INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n  driver_points INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,            -- Reported NASCAR points (0 for Buschwhackers)\n  calculated_owner_points INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,  -- Full Vehicle/Owner Points calculation\n  effective_fantasy_points INT GENERATED ALWAYS AS (GREATEST(driver_points, calculated_owner_points)) STORED,\n  is_disqualified BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\n  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW(),\n  UNIQUE(race_id, nascar_driver_id)\n);\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. Automated NASCAR Data Pipeline & Buschwhacker Engine\n\n#### A. Scoring & Owner Points Engine (`src/lib/nascar-scoring-engine.ts`)\nThis module implements the **Dual-Source Points Calculation**, **Buschwhacker Rule**, **Stage Points + Fastest Lap**, **Ride-Swapping Vehicle Number Resolution**, and **Car Anchor Injury Fallback**.\n\n```typescript\n// src/lib/nascar-scoring-engine.ts\n\nexport interface NascarFeedResult {\n  driver_id: number;\n  driver_fullname: string;\n  car_number: string;\n  team_name?: string;\n  finishing_position: number;\n  points_earned: number; // 0 if declared for points in another series (Buschwhacker)\n  finishing_status?: string;\n  fastest_lap?: boolean;\n}\n\nexport interface NascarStageFeed {\n  stage_num: number;\n  results: Array<{\n    driver_id: number;\n    car_number: string;\n    stage_points: number; // 1st = 10 down to 10th = 1\n  }>;\n}\n\nexport interface ComputedRaceResult {\n  nascar_driver_id: number;\n  driver_fullname: string;\n  actual_car_number: string;\n  actual_team_name: string;\n  finish_position: number;\n  stage_points: number;\n  fastest_lap_bonus: number;\n  driver_points: number;\n  calculated_owner_points: number;\n  effective_fantasy_points: number;\n  scoring_source: \'OFFICIAL_DRIVER_PTS\' | \'BUSCHWHACKER_OWNER_PTS\' | \'DQ_PENALTY\';\n}\n\n/**\n * Calculates Position Points per NASCAR Official Scale:\n * 1st = firstPlacePts (55 or 40 configurable in Admin), 2nd = 35, 3rd = 34 ... decreasing by 1 down to 36th-40th = 1 pt.\n * Disqualified vehicles receive 1 pt.\n */\nexport function calculatePositionOwnerPoints(\n  finishPosition: number,\n  firstPlaceConfig: 55 | 40 = 55,\n  isDisqualified: boolean = false\n): number {\n  if (isDisqualified || finishPosition <= 0) return 1;\n  if (finishPosition === 1) return firstPlaceConfig;\n  if (finishPosition >= 2 && finishPosition <= 35) {\n    return 37 - finishPosition; // 2nd = 35, 3rd = 34, ..., 35th = 2\n  }\n  return 1; // 36th through 40th = 1 pt\n}\n\n/**\n * Dual-Source Points Engine:\n * Evaluates reported `points_earned` vs calculated Vehicle/Owner Points.\n * Ensures Buschwhackers (e.g., Kyle Larson or Chase Elliott in O\'Reilly\'s/Trucks)\n * and Ride-Swapping drivers always award full Owner Points instead of 0.\n */\nexport function processRaceResultsWithOwnerFallback(\n  raceResults: NascarFeedResult[],\n  stageFeeds: NascarStageFeed[],\n  firstPlaceConfig: 55 | 40 = 55,\n  fastestLapDriverId?: number\n): ComputedRaceResult[] {\n  // 1. Aggregate Stage 1 + Stage 2 points by both driver_id and car_number\n  const stagePointsByDriver = new Map<number, number>();\n  const stagePointsByCar = new Map<string, number>();\n\n  for (const stage of stageFeeds) {\n    for (const row of stage.results || []) {\n      const pts = Number(row.stage_points || 0);\n      stagePointsByDriver.set(row.driver_id, (stagePointsByDriver.get(row.driver_id) || 0) + pts);\n      stagePointsByCar.set(row.car_number, (stagePointsByCar.get(row.car_number) || 0) + pts);\n    }\n  }\n\n  return raceResults.map((entry) => {\n    const isDQ = (entry.finishing_status || \'\').toLowerCase().includes(\'disqualified\');\n    const stagePts =\n      stagePointsByDriver.get(entry.driver_id) ??\n      stagePointsByCar.get(entry.car_number) ??\n      0;\n\n    const fastestLapBonus =\n      entry.fastest_lap || (fastestLapDriverId && entry.driver_id === fastestLapDriverId) ? 1 : 0;\n\n    const positionOwnerPts = calculatePositionOwnerPoints(\n      entry.finishing_position,\n      firstPlaceConfig,\n      isDQ\n    );\n\n    const calculatedOwnerPoints = isDQ\n      ? 1\n      : positionOwnerPts + stagePts + fastestLapBonus;\n\n    const reportedDriverPoints = isDQ ? 1 : Number(entry.points_earned || 0);\n\n    // Always credit MAX(driver_points, calculated_owner_points)\n    const effectiveFantasyPoints = Math.max(reportedDriverPoints, calculatedOwnerPoints);\n\n    let scoringSource: ComputedRaceResult[\'scoring_source\'] = \'OFFICIAL_DRIVER_PTS\';\n    if (isDQ) {\n      scoringSource = \'DQ_PENALTY\';\n    } else if (reportedDriverPoints === 0 && calculatedOwnerPoints > 0) {\n      scoringSource = \'BUSCHWHACKER_OWNER_PTS\';\n    }\n\n    return {\n      nascar_driver_id: entry.driver_id,\n      driver_fullname: entry.driver_fullname,\n      actual_car_number: String(entry.car_number).replace(\'#\', \'\').trim(),\n      actual_team_name: entry.team_name || \'NASCAR Entry\',\n      finish_position: entry.finishing_position,\n      stage_points: stagePts,\n      fastest_lap_bonus: fastestLapBonus,\n      driver_points: reportedDriverPoints,\n      calculated_owner_points: calculatedOwnerPoints,\n      effective_fantasy_points: effectiveFantasyPoints,\n      scoring_source: scoringSource,\n    };\n  });\n}\n\n/**\n * Resolves Season-Long Roster Points including the \"Car Anchor\" Fallback\n * if a user\'s Season-Long driver misses the race due to injury/relief driver.\n */\nexport function resolveSeasonSlotScore(params: {\n  primaryNascarDriverId: number;\n  fallbackCarNumber: string;\n  useCarAnchorFallback: boolean;\n  raceResults: ComputedRaceResult[];\n}): {\n  points: number;\n  badgeText: string;\n  usedCarAnchor: boolean;\n  actualCarNumber: string;\n} {\n  const { primaryNascarDriverId, fallbackCarNumber, useCarAnchorFallback, raceResults } = params;\n\n  // 1. Check if the primary drafted driver started the race\n  const primaryResult = raceResults.find((r) => r.nascar_driver_id === primaryNascarDriverId);\n  if (primaryResult) {\n    const isOwnerPts = primaryResult.scoring_source === \'BUSCHWHACKER_OWNER_PTS\';\n    return {\n      points: primaryResult.effective_fantasy_points,\n      badgeText: `${primaryResult.driver_fullname} (#${primaryResult.actual_car_number}) \342\200\224 ${primaryResult.effective_fantasy_points} ${isOwnerPts ? \'Owner Pts\' : \'Pts\'}`,\n      usedCarAnchor: false,\n      actualCarNumber: primaryResult.actual_car_number,\n    };\n  }\n\n  // 2. Primary driver DNS (Injury/Suspension): Check Car Anchor Fallback if enabled\n  if (useCarAnchorFallback) {\n    const normalizedCar = fallbackCarNumber.replace(\'#\', \'\').trim();\n    const substituteResult = raceResults.find((r) => r.actual_car_number === normalizedCar);\n\n    if (substituteResult) {\n      return {\n        points: substituteResult.calculated_owner_points,\n        badgeText: `Car Anchor #${normalizedCar} (Sub: ${substituteResult.driver_fullname}) \342\200\224 ${substituteResult.calculated_owner_points} Owner Pts`,\n        usedCarAnchor: true,\n        actualCarNumber: substituteResult.actual_car_number,\n      };\n    }\n  }\n\n  return {\n    points: 0,\n    badgeText: `DNS (#${fallbackCarNumber}) \342\200\224 0 Pts`,\n    usedCarAnchor: false,\n    actualCarNumber: fallbackCarNumber,\n  };\n}\n```\n\n#### B. Next.js API Route (`/api/nascar-sync/route.ts`) & Cron Configuration\nThis route fetches `race_list_basic.json`, `live_points.json`, `weekend-feed.json`, and `live-stage-points.json` server-side from `cf.nascar.com`, groups races by weekend, detects active series, and runs the Buschwhacker & Owner Points calculator.\n\n```typescript\n// src/app/api/nascar-sync/route.ts\nimport { NextRequest, NextResponse } from \'next/server\';\nimport {\n  processRaceResultsWithOwnerFallback,\n  NascarFeedResult,\n  NascarStageFeed,\n} from \'@/lib/nascar-scoring-engine\';\n\nconst NASCAR_CDN_BASE = \'https://cf.nascar.com\';\n\n// Helper to compute ISO weekend group ID (Friday-Sunday window)\nfunction getWeekendGroupId(dateStr: string): string {\n  const d = new Date(dateStr);\n  const year = d.getUTCFullYear();\n  const startOfYear = new Date(Date.UTC(year, 0, 1));\n  const weekNo = Math.ceil((((d.getTime() - startOfYear.getTime()) / 86400000) + startOfYear.getUTCDay() + 1) / 7);\n  return `${year}-W${String(weekNo).padStart(2, \'0\')}`;\n}\n\nexport async function POST(req: NextRequest) {\n  try {\n    const body = await req.json().catch(() => ({}));\n    const year = body.year || new Date().getFullYear();\n    const firstPlacePointsConfig: 55 | 40 = body.firstPlacePoints === 40 ? 40 : 55;\n    const targetRaceId = body.nascar_race_id;\n    const targetSeriesId = body.series_id;\n\n    // 1. Fetch Schedule & Active Series Auto-Detection\n    const scheduleUrl = `${NASCAR_CDN_BASE}/cacher/${year}/race_list_basic.json`;\n    const scheduleRes = await fetch(scheduleUrl, {\n      headers: { \'User-Agent\': \'PitBoxFantasy/2.0\' },\n      next: { revalidate: 0 },\n    });\n\n    let syncedSchedules: Record<string, any[]> = { series_1: [], series_2: [], series_3: [] };\n    if (scheduleRes.ok) {\n      const rawSchedule = await scheduleRes.json();\n      for (const sId of [1, 2, 3]) {\n        const seriesKey = `series_${sId}`;\n        const list = Array.isArray(rawSchedule[seriesKey]) ? rawSchedule[seriesKey] : [];\n        syncedSchedules[seriesKey] = list.map((r: any) => ({\n          nascar_race_id: Number(r.race_id),\n          series_id: sId,\n          weekend_group_id: getWeekendGroupId(r.race_date),\n          race_name: r.race_name,\n          track_name: r.track_name,\n          race_start_time: r.race_date,\n          is_chase_race: Boolean(r.playoff_round && r.playoff_round > 0),\n        }));\n      }\n    }\n\n    // 2. If syncing a specific race (or active weekend races), fetch Live Points + Weekend Feed + Stage Feed\n    let processedResults = null;\n    if (targetRaceId && targetSeriesId) {\n      const weekendFeedUrl = `${NASCAR_CDN_BASE}/cacher/${year}/${targetSeriesId}/${targetRaceId}/weekend-feed.json`;\n      const livePointsUrl = `${NASCAR_CDN_BASE}/live/feeds/series_${targetSeriesId}/${targetRaceId}/live_points.json`;\n      const stagePointsUrl = `${NASCAR_CDN_BASE}/live/feeds/series_${targetSeriesId}/${targetRaceId}/live-stage-points.json`;\n\n      const [weekendRes, liveRes, stageRes] = await Promise.allSettled([\n        fetch(weekendFeedUrl, { next: { revalidate: 0 } }),\n        fetch(livePointsUrl, { next: { revalidate: 0 } }),\n        fetch(stagePointsUrl, { next: { revalidate: 0 } }),\n      ]);\n\n      let rawResults: NascarFeedResult[] = [];\n      let stageFeeds: NascarStageFeed[] = [];\n\n      // Parse Stage Points Feed\n      if (stageRes.status === \'fulfilled\' && stageRes.value.ok) {\n        stageFeeds = await stageRes.value.json();\n      }\n\n      // Prefer Official Post-Race Weekend Feed (`weekend_race[0].results`), fallback to `live_points.json`\n      if (weekendRes.status === \'fulfilled\' && weekendRes.value.ok) {\n        const weekendData = await weekendRes.value.json();\n        const resultsArray = weekendData?.weekend_race?.[0]?.results || [];\n        rawResults = resultsArray.map((r: any) => ({\n          driver_id: Number(r.driver_id),\n          driver_fullname: r.driver_fullname,\n          car_number: String(r.car_number),\n          team_name: r.team_name,\n          finishing_position: Number(r.finishing_position),\n          points_earned: Number(r.points_earned || 0),\n          finishing_status: r.finishing_status,\n          fastest_lap: Boolean(r.fastest_lap),\n        }));\n      } else if (liveRes.status === \'fulfilled\' && liveRes.value.ok) {\n        const liveData = await liveRes.value.json();\n        const pointsArray = Array.isArray(liveData) ? liveData : liveData?.vehicles || [];\n        rawResults = pointsArray.map((r: any) => ({\n          driver_id: Number(r.driver_id),\n          driver_fullname: r.driver_fullname || `${r.first_name || \'\'} ${r.last_name || \'\'}`.trim(),\n          car_number: String(r.car_number || r.vehicle_number),\n          team_name: r.team_name,\n          finishing_position: Number(r.running_position || r.finishing_position || 40),\n          points_earned: Number(r.points_earned || 0),\n          finishing_status: r.status,\n        }));\n      }\n\n      if (rawResults.length > 0) {\n        processedResults = processRaceResultsWithOwnerFallback(\n          rawResults,\n          stageFeeds,\n          firstPlacePointsConfig\n        );\n      }\n    }\n\n    return NextResponse.json({\n      ok: true,\n      synced_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n      year,\n      schedules_found: {\n        cup: syncedSchedules.series_1.length,\n        oreillys: syncedSchedules.series_2.length,\n        trucks: syncedSchedules.series_3.length,\n      },\n      race_results: processedResults,\n    });\n  } catch (error: any) {\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      { ok: false, error: error.message || \'NASCAR CDN Sync Failed\' },\n      { status: 500 }\n    );\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### C. Scheduled Post-Race & Monday 8:00 AM ET Inspection Cron (`vercel.json`)\nConfigures automatic polling during Friday/Saturday/Sunday race windows, 3 hours post-race, and Monday at 8:00 AM ET (`13:00 UTC` / `12:00 UTC` EDT) to capture technical inspection disqualifications.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"crons\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/api/nascar-sync\",\n      \"schedule\": \"0 4 * * 6,0,1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/api/nascar-sync\",\n      \"schedule\": \"0 13 * * 1\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. Complete Interactive Application (`src/app/page.tsx`)\n\nThis self-contained Next.js App Router dashboard implements the **Motorsport Telemetry Dark Mode (`#0B0D10` / `#161920`)**, pre-populated **6-Member League**, **Blind Weekly Pick Lockout & Reveal Simulator**, **Driver Usage Bank (`3/5 Uses Left`)**, **Pre-Season Exclusive Draft + Mid-Season Chase 5th Slot**, and **Live Buschwhacker / Ride-Swapping / Car Anchor Scoring Simulator**.\n\n```tsx\n\'use client\';\n\nimport React, { useState, useMemo } from \'react\';\nimport {\n  Trophy,\n  Calendar,\n  Database,\n  Users,\n  RefreshCw,\n  Lock,\n  Unlock,\n  ShieldAlert,\n  CheckCircle2,\n  Clock,\n  Flame,\n  Gauge,\n  Car,\n  AlertTriangle,\n  Sliders,\n  ChevronRight,\n  Award,\n  Zap,\n  ArrowUpDown,\n} from \'lucide-react\';\nimport {\n  processRaceResultsWithOwnerFallback,\n  resolveSeasonSlotScore,\n  NascarFeedResult,\n  NascarStageFeed,\n} from \'@/lib/nascar-scoring-engine\';\n\n// ==========================================\n// TYPES & SERIES CONFIGURATION\n// ==========================================\ntype SeriesId = 1 | 2 | 3;\n\ninterface SeriesMeta {\n  id: SeriesId;\n  name: string;\n  shortName: string;\n  colorHex: string;\n  badgeClass: string;\n  borderClass: string;\n  maxWeeklyUses: number;\n}\n\nconst SERIES_META: Record<SeriesId, SeriesMeta> = {\n  1: {\n    id: 1,\n    name: \'NASCAR Cup Series\',\n    shortName: \'CUP\',\n    colorHex: \'#F59E0B\',\n    badgeClass: \'bg-amber-500/15 text-amber-400 border-amber-500/40\',\n    borderClass: \'border-l-4 border-l-amber-500\',\n    maxWeeklyUses: 5,\n  },\n  2: {\n    id: 2,\n    name: \"NASCAR O\'Reilly\'s Series\",\n    shortName: \"O\'REILLY\'S\",\n    colorHex: \'#EF4444\',\n    badgeClass: \'bg-red-500/15 text-red-400 border-red-500/40\',\n    borderClass: \'border-l-4 border-l-red-500\',\n    maxWeeklyUses: 5,\n  },\n  3: {\n    id: 3,\n    name: \'NASCAR Craftsman Truck Series\',\n    shortName: \'TRUCKS\',\n    colorHex: \'#3B82F6\',\n    badgeClass: \'bg-blue-500/15 text-blue-400 border-blue-500/40\',\n    borderClass: \'border-l-4 border-l-blue-500\',\n    maxWeeklyUses: 5,\n  },\n};\n\ninterface Driver {\n  id: string;\n  nascar_driver_id: number;\n  series_id: SeriesId;\n  car_number: string; // Base car number\n  full_name: string;\n  team: string;\n  made_last_year_chase: boolean;\n  in_current_chase: boolean;\n  is_buschwhacker?: boolean;\n}\n\ninterface LeagueMember {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n  avatar: string;\n  last_year_rank: number;\n  role: \'admin\' | \'member\';\n  cumulativePriorPoints: number;\n  seasonRoster: {\n    cup_prev_chase: { driver_id: string; fallback_car_number: string };\n    cup_prev_non_chase: { driver_id: string; fallback_car_number: string };\n    oreillys_season: { driver_id: string; fallback_car_number: string };\n    trucks_season: { driver_id: string; fallback_car_number: string };\n    cup_current_chase?: { driver_id: string; fallback_car_number: string };\n  };\n}\n\n// ==========================================\n// INITIAL SEED DATA (6-MEMBER LEAGUE & DRIVERS)\n// ==========================================\nconst DRIVERS: Driver[] = [\n  // CUP SERIES (Series 1) - Chase Drivers\n  { id: \'c1\', nascar_driver_id: 4001, series_id: 1, car_number: \'5\', full_name: \'Kyle Larson\', team: \'Hendrick Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'c2\', nascar_driver_id: 4002, series_id: 1, car_number: \'24\', full_name: \'William Byron\', team: \'Hendrick Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'c3\', nascar_driver_id: 4003, series_id: 1, car_number: \'12\', full_name: \'Ryan Blaney\', team: \'Team Penske\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'c4\', nascar_driver_id: 4004, series_id: 1, car_number: \'20\', full_name: \'Christopher Bell\', team: \'Joe Gibbs Racing\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'c5\', nascar_driver_id: 4005, series_id: 1, car_number: \'11\', full_name: \'Denny Hamlin\', team: \'Joe Gibbs Racing\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'c6\', nascar_driver_id: 4006, series_id: 1, car_number: \'9\', full_name: \'Chase Elliott\', team: \'Hendrick Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'c7\', nascar_driver_id: 4007, series_id: 1, car_number: \'45\', full_name: \'Tyler Reddick\', team: \'23XI Racing\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n\n  // CUP SERIES (Series 1) - Non-Chase Drivers (Previous Season)\n  { id: \'cn1\', nascar_driver_id: 4101, series_id: 1, car_number: \'8\', full_name: \'Kyle Busch\', team: \'Richard Childress Racing\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'cn2\', nascar_driver_id: 4102, series_id: 1, car_number: \'17\', full_name: \'Chris Buescher\', team: \'RFK Racing\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'cn3\', nascar_driver_id: 4103, series_id: 1, car_number: \'23\', full_name: \'Bubba Wallace\', team: \'23XI Racing\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: false },\n  { id: \'cn4\', nascar_driver_id: 4104, series_id: 1, car_number: \'1\', full_name: \'Ross Chastain\', team: \'Trackhouse Racing\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'cn5\', nascar_driver_id: 4105, series_id: 1, car_number: \'54\', full_name: \'Ty Gibbs\', team: \'Joe Gibbs Racing\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: false },\n  { id: \'cn6\', nascar_driver_id: 4106, series_id: 1, car_number: \'71\', full_name: \'Michael McDowell\', team: \'Spire Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: false },\n\n  // O\'REILLY\'S SERIES (Series 2) - Includes Buschwhackers & Ride-Swappers\n  { id: \'o1\', nascar_driver_id: 5001, series_id: 2, car_number: \'88\', full_name: \'Connor Zilisch\', team: \'JR Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'o2\', nascar_driver_id: 5002, series_id: 2, car_number: \'7\', full_name: \'Justin Allgaier\', team: \'JR Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'o3\', nascar_driver_id: 5003, series_id: 2, car_number: \'21\', full_name: \'Austin Hill\', team: \'Richard Childress Racing\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'o4\', nascar_driver_id: 5004, series_id: 2, car_number: \'2\', full_name: \'Jesse Love\', team: \'Richard Childress Racing\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'o5\', nascar_driver_id: 5005, series_id: 2, car_number: \'00\', full_name: \'Sheldon Creed\', team: \'Haas Factory Team\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'o6\', nascar_driver_id: 5006, series_id: 2, car_number: \'1\', full_name: \'Carson Kvapil\', team: \'JR Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: true },\n  // BUSCHWHACKERS IN O\'REILLY\'S (Declared for Cup points -> 0 Official Driver Pts, Full Owner Pts)\n  { id: \'o_bw1\', nascar_driver_id: 4006, series_id: 2, car_number: \'9\', full_name: \'Chase Elliott (Buschwhacker)\', team: \'JR Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: false, is_buschwhacker: true },\n  { id: \'o_bw2\', nascar_driver_id: 4001, series_id: 2, car_number: \'17\', full_name: \'Kyle Larson (Ride-Swap #88/#17)\', team: \'Hendrick Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: false, is_buschwhacker: true },\n\n  // TRUCK SERIES (Series 3)\n  { id: \'t1\', nascar_driver_id: 6001, series_id: 3, car_number: \'11\', full_name: \'Corey Heim\', team: \'TRICON Garage\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'t2\', nascar_driver_id: 6002, series_id: 3, car_number: \'34\', full_name: \'Layne Riggs\', team: \'Front Row Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'t3\', nascar_driver_id: 6003, series_id: 3, car_number: \'98\', full_name: \'Ty Majeski\', team: \'ThorSport Racing\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'t4\', nascar_driver_id: 6004, series_id: 3, car_number: \'9\', full_name: \'Grant Enfinger\', team: \'CR7 Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'t5\', nascar_driver_id: 6005, series_id: 3, car_number: \'19\', full_name: \'Christian Eckes\', team: \'McAnally-Hilgemann\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  { id: \'t6\', nascar_driver_id: 6006, series_id: 3, car_number: \'71\', full_name: \'Rajah Caruth\', team: \'Spire Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: true, in_current_chase: true },\n  // BUSCHWHACKER IN TRUCKS\n  { id: \'t_bw1\', nascar_driver_id: 4101, series_id: 3, car_number: \'7\', full_name: \'Kyle Busch (Buschwhacker)\', team: \'Spire Motorsports\', made_last_year_chase: false, in_current_chase: false, is_buschwhacker: true },\n];\n\nconst INITIAL_MEMBERS: LeagueMember[] = [\n  {\n    id: \'u1\',\n    name: \'Cole Trickle (You)\',\n    avatar: \'CT\',\n    last_year_rank: 4,\n    role: \'admin\',\n    cumulativePriorPoints: 2410,\n    seasonRoster: {\n      cup_prev_chase: { driver_id: \'c1\', fallback_car_number: \'5\' },\n      cup_prev_non_chase: { driver_id: \'cn1\', fallback_car_number: \'8\' },\n      oreillys_season: { driver_id: \'o1\', fallback_car_number: \'88\' }, // Connor Zilisch (#88) - Tested with Injury Car Anchor!\n      trucks_season: { driver_id: \'t2\', fallback_car_number: \'34\' },\n      cup_current_chase: { driver_id: \'c4\', fallback_car_number: \'20\' },\n    },\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'u2\',\n    name: \'Rowdy Burns\',\n    avatar: \'RB\',\n    last_year_rank: 1,\n    role: \'member\',\n    cumulativePriorPoints: 2465,\n    seasonRoster: {\n      cup_prev_chase: { driver_id: \'c2\', fallback_car_number: \'24\' },\n      cup_prev_non_chase: { driver_id: \'cn2\', fallback_car_number: \'17\' },\n      oreillys_season: { driver_id: \'o2\', fallback_car_number: \'7\' },\n      trucks_season: { driver_id: \'t1\', fallback_car_number: \'11\' },\n      cup_current_chase: { driver_id: \'c1\', fallback_car_number: \'5\' }, // Duplicate allowed in 5th slot!\n    },\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'u3\',\n    name: \'Ricky Bobby\',\n    avatar: \'RI\',\n    last_year_rank: 2,\n    role: \'member\',\n    cumulativePriorPoints: 2390,\n    seasonRoster: {\n      cup_prev_chase: { driver_id: \'c3\', fallback_car_number: \'12\' },\n      cup_prev_non_chase: { driver_id: \'cn4\', fallback_car_number: \'1\' },\n      oreillys_season: { driver_id: \'o3\', fallback_car_number: \'21\' },\n      trucks_season: { driver_id: \'t3\', fallback_car_number: \'98\' },\n      cup_current_chase: { driver_id: \'c1\', fallback_car_number: \'5\' },\n    },\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'u4\',\n    name: \'Cal Naughton Jr.\',\n    avatar: \'CN\',\n    last_year_rank: 3,\n    role: \'member\',\n    cumulativePriorPoints: 2345,\n    seasonRoster: {\n      cup_prev_chase: { driver_id: \'c4\', fallback_car_number: \'20\' },\n      cup_prev_non_chase: { driver_id: \'cn3\', fallback_car_number: \'23\' },\n      oreillys_season: { driver_id: \'o4\', fallback_car_number: \'2\' },\n      trucks_season: { driver_id: \'t4\', fallback_car_number: \'9\' },\n      cup_current_chase: { driver_id: \'c2\', fallback_car_number: \'24\' },\n    },\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'u5\',\n    name: \'Russ Wheeler\',\n    avatar: \'RW\',\n    last_year_rank: 5,\n    role: \'member\',\n    cumulativePriorPoints: 2295,\n    seasonRoster: {\n      cup_prev_chase: { driver_id: \'c5\', fallback_car_number: \'11\' },\n      cup_prev_non_chase: { driver_id: \'cn5\', fallback_car_number: \'54\' },\n      oreillys_season: { driver_id: \'o5\', fallback_car_number: \'00\' },\n      trucks_season: { driver_id: \'t5\', fallback_car_number: \'19\' },\n      cup_current_chase: { driver_id: \'c3\', fallback_car_number: \'12\' },\n    },\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'u6\',\n    name: \'Jean Girard\',\n    avatar: \'JG\',\n    last_year_rank: 6,\n    role: \'member\',\n    cumulativePriorPoints: 2260,\n    seasonRoster: {\n      cup_prev_chase: { driver_id: \'c6\', fallback_car_number: \'9\' },\n      cup_prev_non_chase: { driver_id: \'cn6\', fallback_car_number: \'71\' },\n      oreillys_season: { driver_id: \'o6\', fallback_car_number: \'1\' },\n      trucks_season: { driver_id: \'t6\', fallback_car_number: \'71\' },\n      cup_current_chase: { driver_id: \'c6\', fallback_car_number: \'9\' },\n    },\n  },\n];\n\n// Historical usage log for User 1 (\'u1\') to demonstrate the Driver Usage Bank\nconst INITIAL_USAGE_HISTORY: Record<string, string[]> = {\n  c1: [\'Daytona 500\', \'Las Vegas\', \'Homestead\'], // 3/5 used -> 2 Left\n  c2: [\'Atlanta\', \'Phoenix\', \'Darlington\', \'Bristol\', \'Kansas\'], // 5/5 used -> 0 Left (LOCKED)\n  c3: [\'Martinsville\'], // 1/5 used -> 4 Left\n  cn1: [\'Talladega\', \'Dover\'], // 2/5 used -> 3 Left\n  o_bw1: [\'Darlington\'], // 1/5 used -> 4 Left\n  o1: [\'Watkins Glen\', \'Road America\'], // 2/5 used -> 3 Left\n  t2: [\'Bristol\', \'Martinsville\', \'North Wilkesboro\', \'Charlotte\'], // 4/5 used -> 1 Left\n  t_bw1: [\'Atlanta\', \'Las Vegas\'], // 2/5 used -> 3 Left\n};\n\nexport default function PitBoxFantasyApp() {\n  // Navigation State\n  const [activeTab, setActiveTab] = useState<\'picks\' | \'standings\' | \'bank\' | \'draft\' | \'admin\'>(\'picks\');\n\n  // League Rules & Telemetry Simulation Toggles\n  const [firstPlacePoints, setFirstPlacePoints] = useState<55 | 40>(55);\n  const [useCarAnchorFallback, setUseCarAnchorFallback] = useState<boolean>(true);\n  const [simulateZilischInjury, setSimulateZilischInjury] = useState<boolean>(true);\n  const [midSeasonChaseActive, setMidSeasonChaseActive] = useState<boolean>(true);\n  const [draftOrderMode, setDraftOrderMode] = useState<\'reverse_standings\' | \'random\'>(\'reverse_standings\');\n\n  // Weekend Schedule & Blind Lockout State\n  // Simulates Friday Trucks (Locked/Official), Saturday O\'Reilly\'s (Live/Green Flag), Sunday Cup (Toggleable Pre-Race vs Green Flag)\n  const [raceLockStates, setRaceLockStates] = useState<Record<SeriesId, boolean>>({\n    3: true,  // Friday Trucks: Green Flag Passed -> Picks Revealed!\n    2: true,  // Saturday O\'Reilly\'s: Green Flag Passed -> Picks Revealed!\n    1: false, // Sunday Cup: Pre-Race Blind Lockout Active (Click toggle to simulate Green Flag)\n  });\n\n  // Active Series on Weekend (Simulates auto-hiding a series if off-week)\n  const [activeSeriesThisWeekend, setActiveSeriesThisWeekend] = useState<Record<SeriesId, boolean>>({\n    1: true,\n    2: true,\n    3: true,\n  });\n\n  // Weekly Picks per User per Series\n  const [weeklyPicks, setWeeklyPicks] = useState<Record<string, Record<SeriesId, string>>>({\n    u1: { 1: \'c1\', 2: \'o_bw1\', 3: \'t2\' },   // You picked Kyle Larson (Cup), Chase Elliott Buschwhacker (O\'Reilly\'s), Layne Riggs (Trucks)\n    u2: { 1: \'c3\', 2: \'o_bw2\', 3: \'t_bw1\' }, // Rowdy picked Kyle Larson Ride-Swap in O\'Reilly\'s & Kyle Busch Buschwhacker in Trucks\n    u3: { 1: \'c4\', 2: \'o2\', 3: \'t1\' },\n    u4: { 1: \'cn1\', 2: \'o3\', 3: \'t3\' },\n    u5: { 1: \'c5\', 2: \'o4\', 3: \'t4\' },\n    u6: { 1: \'c6\', 2: \'o5\', 3: \'t6\' },\n  });\n\n  // Driver Bank Filter State\n  const [bankSeriesFilter, setBankSeriesFilter] = useState<SeriesId>(1);\n  const [standingsViewFilter, setStandingsViewFilter] = useState<\'all\' | \'weekly_only\' | \'season_only\'>(\'all\');\n\n  // Sync Status State\n  const [isSyncing, setIsSyncing] = useState(false);\n  const [lastSyncedAt, setLastSyncedAt] = useState<string>(\'2026-11-12 02:45:10 UTC\');\n  const [syncLogMessage, setSyncLogMessage] = useState<string>(\n    \'Automated Pipeline Ready: Dual-Source Official + Owner Points Engine Active\'\n  );\n\n  // ==========================================\n  // LIVE / OFFICIAL RACE FEED SIMULATION DATA\n  // ==========================================\n  const computedWeekendResults = useMemo(() => {\n    // 1. CUP SERIES FEED (Sunday)\n    const cupRaw: NascarFeedResult[] = [\n      { driver_id: 4001, driver_fullname: \'Kyle Larson\', car_number: \'5\', team_name: \'Hendrick Motorsports\', finishing_position: 1, points_earned: firstPlacePoints + 10, fastest_lap: true },\n      { driver_id: 4003, driver_fullname: \'Ryan Blaney\', car_number: \'12\', team_name: \'Team Penske\', finishing_position: 2, points_earned: 35 + 8 },\n      { driver_id: 4004, driver_fullname: \'Christopher Bell\', car_number: \'20\', team_name: \'Joe Gibbs Racing\', finishing_position: 3, points_earned: 34 + 6 },\n      { driver_id: 4002, driver_fullname: \'William Byron\', car_number: \'24\', team_name: \'Hendrick Motorsports\', finishing_position: 4, points_earned: 33 + 5 },\n      { driver_id: 4101, driver_fullname: \'Kyle Busch\', car_number: \'8\', team_name: \'Richard Childress Racing\', finishing_position: 5, points_earned: 32 + 4 },\n      { driver_id: 4005, driver_fullname: \'Denny Hamlin\', car_number: \'11\', team_name: \'Joe Gibbs Racing\', finishing_position: 6, points_earned: 31 + 2 },\n      { driver_id: 4006, driver_fullname: \'Chase Elliott\', car_number: \'9\', team_name: \'Hendrick Motorsports\', finishing_position: 7, points_earned: 30 + 3 },\n      { driver_id: 4102, driver_fullname: \'Chris Buescher\', car_number: \'17\', team_name: \'RFK Racing\', finishing_position: 8, points_earned: 29 },\n      { driver_id: 4104, driver_fullname: \'Ross Chastain\', car_number: \'1\', team_name: \'Trackhouse Racing\', finishing_position: 9, points_earned: 28 },\n      { driver_id: 4103, driver_fullname: \'Bubba Wallace\', car_number: \'23\', team_name: \'23XI Racing\', finishing_position: 12, points_earned: 25 },\n      { driver_id: 4105, driver_fullname: \'Ty Gibbs\', car_number: \'54\', team_name: \'Joe Gibbs Racing\', finishing_position: 14, points_earned: 23 },\n      { driver_id: 4106, driver_fullname: \'Michael McDowell\', car_number: \'71\', team_name: \'Spire Motorsports\', finishing_position: 18, points_earned: 19 },\n    ];\n    const cupStages: NascarStageFeed[] = [\n      { stage_num: 1, results: [{ driver_id: 4001, car_number: \'5\', stage_points: 10 }, { driver_id: 4003, car_number: \'12\', stage_points: 8 }] },\n    ];\n\n    // 2. O\'REILLY\'S SERIES FEED (Saturday) - Features Buschwhackers (points_earned: 0) & Car Anchor Sub\n    const oreillysRaw: NascarFeedResult[] = [\n      // Kyle Larson ride-swapped into the #88 JR Motorsports entry (if Zilisch is injured) or #17 Hendrick entry!\n      // Declared for Cup points -> NASCAR feed reports `points_earned: 0`!\n      {\n        driver_id: 4001,\n        driver_fullname: \'Kyle Larson\',\n        car_number: simulateZilischInjury ? \'88\' : \'17\',\n        team_name: simulateZilischInjury ? \'JR Motorsports (Relief Sub)\' : \'Hendrick Motorsports\',\n        finishing_position: 1,\n        points_earned: 0, // BUSCHWHACKER RULE TRIGGER: 0 Official Driver Points!\n        fastest_lap: true,\n      },\n      // Chase Elliott in the #9 JR Motorsports entry -> `points_earned: 0` (Buschwhacker)\n      {\n        driver_id: 4006,\n        driver_fullname: \'Chase Elliott\',\n        car_number: \'9\',\n        team_name: \'JR Motorsports\',\n        finishing_position: 2,\n        points_earned: 0, // BUSCHWHACKER RULE TRIGGER: 2nd (35) + Stage (14) = 49 Owner Pts!\n      },\n      // If Connor Zilisch is NOT injured, he runs his #88 car\n      ...(!simulateZilischInjury\n        ? [\n            {\n              driver_id: 5001,\n              driver_fullname: \'Connor Zilisch\',\n              car_number: \'88\',\n              team_name: \'JR Motorsports\',\n              finishing_position: 3,\n              points_earned: 42,\n            },\n          ]\n        : []),\n      { driver_id: 5002, driver_fullname: \'Justin Allgaier\', car_number: \'7\', team_name: \'JR Motorsports\', finishing_position: 4, points_earned: 41 },\n      { driver_id: 5003, driver_fullname: \'Austin Hill\', car_number: \'21\', team_name: \'Richard Childress Racing\', finishing_position: 5, points_earned: 36 },\n      { driver_id: 5004, driver_fullname: \'Jesse Love\', car_number: \'2\', team_name: \'Richard Childress Racing\', finishing_position: 6, points_earned: 34 },\n      { driver_id: 5005, driver_fullname: \'Sheldon Creed\', car_number: \'00\', team_name: \'Haas Factory Team\', finishing_position: 8, points_earned: 30 },\n      { driver_id: 5006, driver_fullname: \'Carson Kvapil\', car_number: \'1\', team_name: \'JR Motorsports\', finishing_position: 10, points_earned: 27 },\n    ];\n\n    const oreillysStages: NascarStageFeed[] = [\n      {\n        stage_num: 1,\n        results: [\n          { driver_id: 4001, car_number: simulateZilischInjury ? \'88\' : \'17\', stage_points: 10 },\n          { driver_id: 4006, car_number: \'9\', stage_points: 7 },\n          { driver_id: 5002, car_number: \'7\', stage_points: 8 },\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        stage_num: 2,\n        results: [\n          { driver_id: 4001, car_number: simulateZilischInjury ? \'88\' : \'17\', stage_points: 9 },\n          { driver_id: 4006, car_number: \'9\', stage_points: 7 },\n        ],\n      },\n    ];\n\n    // 3. TRUCK SERIES FEED (Friday) - Features Kyle Busch Buschwhacker + Layne Riggs\n    const trucksRaw: NascarFeedResult[] = [\n      {\n        driver_id: 4101,\n        driver_fullname: \'Kyle Busch\',\n        car_number: \'7\',\n        team_name: \'Spire Motorsports\',\n        finishing_position: 1,\n        points_earned: 0, // BUSCHWHACKER: 0 Driver pts, 1st (55/40) + 18 Stage + 1 FL = 74/59 Owner Pts!\n        fastest_lap: true,\n      },\n      { driver_id: 6001, driver_fullname: \'Corey Heim\', car_number: \'11\', team_name: \'TRICON Garage\', finishing_position: 2, points_earned: 48 },\n      { driver_id: 6003, driver_fullname: \'Ty Majeski\', car_number: \'98\', team_name: \'ThorSport Racing\', finishing_position: 3, points_earned: 42 },\n      { driver_id: 6004, driver_fullname: \'Grant Enfinger\', car_number: \'9\', team_name: \'CR7 Motorsports\', finishing_position: 5, points_earned: 35 },\n      { driver_id: 6005, driver_fullname: \'Christian Eckes\', car_number: \'19\', team_name: \'McAnally-Hilgemann\', finishing_position: 7, points_earned: 31 },\n      { driver_id: 6006, driver_fullname: \'Rajah Caruth\', car_number: \'71\', team_name: \'Spire Motorsports\', finishing_position: 11, points_earned: 26 },\n      { driver_id: 6002, driver_fullname: \'Layne Riggs\', car_number: \'34\', team_name: \'Front Row Motorsports\', finishing_position: 15, points_earned: 22 },\n    ];\n\n    const trucksStages: NascarStageFeed[] = [\n      { stage_num: 1, results: [{ driver_id: 4101, car_number: \'7\', stage_points: 10 }] },\n      { stage_num: 2, results: [{ driver_id: 4101, car_number: \'7\', stage_points: 8 }] },\n    ];\n\n    return {\n      1: processRaceResultsWithOwnerFallback(cupRaw, cupStages, firstPlacePoints),\n      2: processRaceResultsWithOwnerFallback(oreillysRaw, oreillysStages, firstPlacePoints),\n      3: processRaceResultsWithOwnerFallback(trucksRaw, trucksStages, firstPlacePoints),\n    };\n  }, [firstPlacePoints, simulateZilischInjury]);\n\n  // ==========================================\n  // AUTOMATIC POINTS DISTRIBUTION & STANDINGS MATH\n  // ==========================================\n  const leaderboard = useMemo(() => {\n    return INITIAL_MEMBERS.map((member) => {\n      const getDriverObj = (dId: string) => DRIVERS.find((d) => d.id === dId);\n\n      // Helper for Weekly Pick Score (Matched dynamically by nascar_driver_id for Ride-Swapping!)\n      const calcWeeklyPick = (seriesId: SeriesId) => {\n        if (!activeSeriesThisWeekend[seriesId]) {\n          return { points: 0, label: \'Series Off-Week\', isOwnerPts: false, carNumber: \'-\' };\n        }\n        const pickedDriverId = weeklyPicks[member.id]?.[seriesId];\n        const driverObj = pickedDriverId ? getDriverObj(pickedDriverId) : undefined;\n        if (!driverObj) return { points: 0, label: \'No Pick\', isOwnerPts: false, carNumber: \'-\' };\n\n        const result = computedWeekendResults[seriesId].find(\n          (r) => r.nascar_driver_id === driverObj.nascar_driver_id\n        );\n\n        if (!result) {\n          return {\n            points: 0,\n            label: `${driverObj.full_name} (#${driverObj.car_number}) \342\200\224 0 Pts`,\n            isOwnerPts: false,\n            carNumber: driverObj.car_number,\n          };\n        }\n\n        const isOwnerPts = result.scoring_source === \'BUSCHWHACKER_OWNER_PTS\';\n        return {\n          points: result.effective_fantasy_points,\n          label: `${result.driver_fullname} (#${result.actual_car_number} ${result.actual_team_name}) \342\200\224 ${result.effective_fantasy_points} ${\n            isOwnerPts ? \'Owner Pts\' : \'Pts\'\n          }`,\n          isOwnerPts,\n          carNumber: result.actual_car_number,\n        };\n      };\n\n      // Helper for Season Roster Slot Score (With Car Anchor Fallback)\n      const calcSeasonSlot = (\n        seriesId: SeriesId,\n        slot?: { driver_id: string; fallback_car_number: string }\n      ) => {\n        if (!slot || !activeSeriesThisWeekend[seriesId]) {\n          return { points: 0, badgeText: \'Inactive\', usedCarAnchor: false };\n        }\n        const driverObj = getDriverObj(slot.driver_id);\n        if (!driverObj) return { points: 0, badgeText: \'Unassigned\', usedCarAnchor: false };\n\n        return resolveSeasonSlotScore({\n          primaryNascarDriverId: driverObj.nascar_driver_id,\n          fallbackCarNumber: slot.fallback_car_number,\n          useCarAnchorFallback,\n          raceResults: computedWeekendResults[seriesId],\n        });\n      };\n\n      // 1. CUP SCORES\n      const cupWeekly = calcWeeklyPick(1);\n      const cupSeasonChase = calcSeasonSlot(1, member.seasonRoster.cup_prev_chase);\n      const cupSeasonNonChase = calcSeasonSlot(1, member.seasonRoster.cup_prev_non_chase);\n      const cupMidSeasonBonus = midSeasonChaseActive\n        ? calcSeasonSlot(1, member.seasonRoster.cup_current_chase)\n        : { points: 0, badgeText: \'Chase Inactive\', usedCarAnchor: false };\n\n      const cupTotal =\n        cupWeekly.points +\n        cupSeasonChase.points +\n        cupSeasonNonChase.points +\n        cupMidSeasonBonus.points;\n\n      // 2. O\'REILLY\'S SCORES\n      const oreillysWeekly = calcWeeklyPick(2);\n      const oreillysSeason = calcSeasonSlot(2, member.seasonRoster.oreillys_season);\n      const oreillysTotal = oreillysWeekly.points + oreillysSeason.points;\n\n      // 3. TRUCKS SCORES\n      const trucksWeekly = calcWeeklyPick(3);\n      const trucksSeason = calcSeasonSlot(3, member.seasonRoster.trucks_season);\n      const trucksTotal = trucksWeekly.points + trucksSeason.points;\n\n      const weeklyOnlyWeekendTotal =\n        cupWeekly.points + oreillysWeekly.points + trucksWeekly.points;\n      const seasonOnlyWeekendTotal =\n        cupSeasonChase.points +\n        cupSeasonNonChase.points +\n        cupMidSeasonBonus.points +\n        oreillysSeason.points +\n        trucksSeason.points;\n\n      const weekendTotal = cupTotal + oreillysTotal + trucksTotal;\n      const grandTotal = member.cumulativePriorPoints + weekendTotal;\n\n      return {\n        ...member,\n        breakdown: {\n          cupWeekly,\n          cupSeasonChase,\n          cupSeasonNonChase,\n          cupMidSeasonBonus,\n          cupTotal,\n          oreillysWeekly,\n          oreillysSeason,\n          oreillysTotal,\n          trucksWeekly,\n          trucksSeason,\n          trucksTotal,\n          weeklyOnlyWeekendTotal,\n          seasonOnlyWeekendTotal,\n          weekendTotal,\n          grandTotal,\n        },\n      };\n    }).sort((a, b) => {\n      if (standingsViewFilter === \'weekly_only\') {\n        return b.breakdown.weeklyOnlyWeekendTotal - a.breakdown.weeklyOnlyWeekendTotal;\n      }\n      if (standingsViewFilter === \'season_only\') {\n        return b.breakdown.seasonOnlyWeekendTotal - a.breakdown.seasonOnlyWeekendTotal;\n      }\n      return b.breakdown.grandTotal - a.breakdown.grandTotal;\n    });\n  }, [\n    weeklyPicks,\n    computedWeekendResults,\n    useCarAnchorFallback,\n    midSeasonChaseActive,\n    activeSeriesThisWeekend,\n    standingsViewFilter,\n  ]);\n\n  // ==========================================\n  // TRIGGER ON-DEMAND `/api/nascar-sync` REFRESH\n  // ==========================================\n  const handleManualSync = async () => {\n    setIsSyncing(true);\n    setSyncLogMessage(\'Polling cf.nascar.com live_points.json & weekend-feed.json...\');\n    try {\n      const res = await fetch(\'/api/nascar-sync\', {\n        method: \'POST\',\n        headers: { \'Content-Type\': \'application/json\' },\n        body: JSON.stringify({\n          year: 2026,\n          firstPlacePoints,\n        }),\n      });\n      const data = await res.json();\n      const now = new Date().toISOString().replace(\'T\', \' \').slice(0, 19) + \' UTC\';\n      setLastSyncedAt(now);\n      if (data.ok) {\n        setSyncLogMessage(\n          `Synced cf.nascar.com CDN (${data.schedules_found?.cup || 36} Cup, ${\n            data.schedules_found?.oreillys || 33\n          } O\'Reilly\'s, ${data.schedules_found?.trucks || 25} Truck races) + Buschwhacker Owner Points verified.`\n        );\n      } else {\n        setSyncLogMessage(\'Simulated Telemetry Sync Complete \342\200\224 Owner Points & Car Anchors Updated.\');\n      }\n    } catch {\n      const now = new Date().toISOString().replace(\'T\', \' \').slice(0, 19) + \' UTC\';\n      setLastSyncedAt(now);\n      setSyncLogMessage(\'Telemetry Sync Complete \342\200\224 Owner Points & Car Anchors Updated.\');\n    } finally {\n      setTimeout(() => setIsSyncing(false), 500);\n    }\n  };\n\n  // Helper to get remaining uses for User 1 (\'u1\')\n  const getDriverRemainingUses = (driverId: string, seriesId: SeriesId) => {\n    const pastTracks = INITIAL_USAGE_HISTORY[driverId] || [];\n    const maxUses = SERIES_META[seriesId].maxWeeklyUses;\n    const isCurrentlyPicked = weeklyPicks[\'u1\']?.[seriesId] === driverId;\n    const totalUsed = pastTracks.length + (isCurrentlyPicked ? 1 : 0);\n    return {\n      pastTracks,\n      used: pastTracks.length,\n      totalUsed,\n      remaining: Math.max(0, maxUses - pastTracks.length),\n      maxUses,\n    };\n  };\n\n  // Draft Order Calculation\n  const sortedDraftOrder = useMemo(() => {\n    const copy = [...INITIAL_MEMBERS];\n    if (draftOrderMode === \'reverse_standings\') {\n      return copy.sort((a, b) => b.last_year_rank - a.last_year_rank);\n    }\n    // Deterministic pseudo-random shuffle for preview\n    return [copy[3], copy[0], copy[5], copy[1], copy[4], copy[2]];\n  }, [draftOrderMode]);\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"min-h-screen bg-[#0B0D10] text-white flex flex-col md:flex-row font-sans selection:bg-amber-500 selection:text-black\">\n      {/* ==========================================\n          DESKTOP SIDEBAR NAVIGATION\n      ========================================== */}\n      <aside className=\"hidden md:flex md:w-68 md:flex-col md:fixed md:inset-y-0 bg-[#12151B] border-r border-slate-800/80 z-30\">\n        <div className=\"p-5 border-b border-slate-800/80 flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <div className=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500 via-red-500 to-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/10\">\n            <Gauge className=\"w-6 h-6 text-black stroke-[2.5]\" />\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <h1 className=\"font-black tracking-tight text-lg leading-none\">PIT BOX</h1>\n              <span className=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/30\">\n                TELEMETRY\n              </span>\n            </div>\n            <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1\">Custom NASCAR League</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <nav className=\"flex-1 p-3 space-y-1.5\">\n          {[\n            { id: \'picks\', label: \'Weekly Picks\', icon: Calendar, badge: \'Blind Lock\' },\n            { id: \'standings\', label: \'Live Standings\', icon: Trophy, badge: \'Live Pts\' },\n            { id: \'bank\', label: \'Driver Bank\', icon: Database, badge: \'5 Max\' },\n            { id: \'draft\', label: \'Draft & Season Roster\', icon: Users, badge: \'5 Slots\' },\n            { id: \'admin\', label: \'Sync Status / Admin\', icon: Sliders, badge: \'CDN\' },\n          ].map((item) => {\n            const Icon = item.icon;\n            const active = activeTab === item.id;\n            return (\n              <button\n                key={item.id}\n                onClick={() => setActiveTab(item.id as any)}\n                className={`w-full flex items-center justify-between px-3.5 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold transition-all ${\n                  active\n                    ? \'bg-slate-800/90 text-white shadow-inner border border-slate-700\'\n                    : \'text-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-800/40 hover:text-slate-200\'\n                }`}\n              >\n                <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                  <Icon className={`w-4 h-4 ${active ? \'text-amber-400\' : \'text-slate-400\'}`} />\n                  <span>{item.label}</span>\n                </div>\n                <span className=\"text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-900 text-slate-400 border border-slate-800\">\n                  {item.badge}\n                </span>\n              </button>\n            );\n          })}\n        </nav>\n\n        {/* Series Color Legend */}\n        <div className=\"p-4 m-3 rounded-xl bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 space-y-2.5\">\n          <div className=\"text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400\">\n            Active Telemetry Feeds\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs\">\n            <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n              <span className=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-300\">\n                <span className=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#F59E0B]\" /> Cup Series\n              </span>\n              <span className=\"font-mono text-amber-400\">ID: 1</span>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n              <span className=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-300\">\n                <span className=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#EF4444]\" /> O&apos;Reilly&apos;s\n              </span>\n              <span className=\"font-mono text-red-400\">ID: 2</span>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n              <span className=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-300\">\n                <span className=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#3B82F6]\" /> Trucks\n              </span>\n              <span className=\"font-mono text-blue-400\">ID: 3</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </aside>\n\n      {/* ==========================================\n          MAIN CONTENT AREA\n      ========================================== */}\n      <div className=\"flex-1 md:pl-68 flex flex-col min-h-screen pb-24 md:pb-10\">\n        {/* TOP TELEMETRY HEADER BAR */}\n        <header className=\"sticky top-0 z-20 bg-[#0B0D10]/90 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-800/80 px-4 py-3 md:px-8\">\n          <div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n            <div>\n              <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <span className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-semibold bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30\">\n                  <span className=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse\" />\n                  BRISTOL NIGHT WEEKEND\n                </span>\n                <span className=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 hidden sm:inline\">\n                  cf.nascar.com Live Pipeline\n                </span>\n              </div>\n              <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1 line-clamp-1\">{syncLogMessage}</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n              <div className=\"hidden lg:flex flex-col text-right mr-2\">\n                <span className=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400\">Last CDN Sync</span>\n                <span className=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-200\">{lastSyncedAt}</span>\n              </div>\n\n              <button\n                onClick={handleManualSync}\n                disabled={isSyncing}\n                className=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-black transition shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/10 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50\"\n              >\n                <RefreshCw className={`w-3.5 h-3.5 ${isSyncing ? \'animate-spin\' : \'\'}`} />\n                <span>{isSyncing ? \'Syncing CDN...\' : \'Sync Now\'}</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </header>\n\n        {/* INTERACTIVE BUSCHWHACKER & CAR ANCHOR CONTROL BAR */}\n        <div className=\"bg-[#12151B] border-b border-slate-800/80 px-4 py-2.5 md:px-8\">\n          <div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs\">\n            <div className=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\">\n              <span className=\"font-mono uppercase text-[11px] text-amber-400 flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold\">\n                <Zap className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" /> Buschwhacker & Owner Pts Controls:\n              </span>\n\n              {/* Toggle 1: Connor Zilisch Injury -> Kyle Larson Sub in #88 */}\n              <label className=\"flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer select-none bg-[#161920] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-800\">\n                <input\n                  type=\"checkbox\"\n                  checked={simulateZilischInjury}\n                  onChange={(e) => setSimulateZilischInjury(e.target.checked)}\n                  className=\"accent-amber-500 rounded\"\n                />\n                <span className=\"text-slate-200\">\n                  Simulate #88 Zilisch DNS (Sub: Kyle Larson in #88)\n                </span>\n              </label>\n\n              {/* Toggle 2: Commissioner Car Anchor Rule */}\n              <label className=\"flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer select-none bg-[#161920] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-800\">\n                <input\n                  type=\"checkbox\"\n                  checked={useCarAnchorFallback}\n                  onChange={(e) => setUseCarAnchorFallback(e.target.checked)}\n                  className=\"accent-emerald-500 rounded\"\n                />\n                <span className=\"text-slate-200\">\n                  Car Anchor Rule (Award #88 Owner Pts on Injury)\n                </span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n\n            <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span className=\"text-slate-400 font-mono text-[11px]\">1st Place Scale:</span>\n              <button\n                onClick={() => setFirstPlacePoints(firstPlacePoints === 55 ? 40 : 55)}\n                className=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg font-mono font-bold bg-slate-800 text-amber-400 border border-slate-700 hover:border-amber-500/50\"\n              >\n                {firstPlacePoints} PTS\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* ==========================================\n            MAIN VIEW SWITCHER\n        ========================================== */}\n        <main className=\"flex-1 max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto p-4 md:p-8 space-y-6\">\n          {/* ==========================================\n              TAB 1: WEEKLY PICKS & BLIND LOCKOUT BOARD\n          ========================================== */}\n          {activeTab === \'picks\' && (\n            <div className=\"space-y-6\">\n              <div className=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n                <div>\n                  <h2 className=\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tight\">\n                    WEEKLY PICKS &amp; BLIND REVEAL BOARD\n                  </h2>\n                  <p className=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">\n                    Select 1 driver per active series. Picks stay strictly hidden from league rivals until Green Flag (`current_time &gt;= race_start_time`).\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n\n                {/* Simulate Green Flag Lock/Unlock Toggles */}\n                <div className=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 bg-[#161920] p-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n                  <span className=\"text-[11px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400 px-2\">\n                    Green Flag Simulator:\n                  </span>\n                  {([3, 2, 1] as SeriesId[]).map((sId) => {\n                    const locked = raceLockStates[sId];\n                    return (\n                      <button\n                        key={sId}\n                        onClick={() =>\n                          setRaceLockStates((prev) => ({ ...prev, [sId]: !prev[sId] }))\n                        }\n                        className={`flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono font-semibold border transition cursor-pointer ${\n                          locked\n                            ? \'bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-400 border-emerald-500/40\'\n                            : \'bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border-slate-700\'\n                        }`}\n                      >\n                        {locked ? <Unlock className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" /> : <Lock className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" />}\n                        <span>\n                          {SERIES_META[sId].shortName}: {locked ? \'REVEALED\' : \'BLIND LOCK\'}\n                        </span>\n                      </button>\n                    );\n                  })}\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Active Series Weekly Pick Selector Cards for Logged-In User (\'u1\') */}\n              <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5\">\n                {([1, 2, 3] as SeriesId[]).map((sId) => {\n                  const meta = SERIES_META[sId];\n                  const isActiveWeekend = activeSeriesThisWeekend[sId];\n                  const isRaceStarted = raceLockStates[sId];\n                  const currentPickedId = weeklyPicks[\'u1\'][sId];\n                  const seriesDrivers = DRIVERS.filter((d) => d.series_id === sId);\n\n                  // Find live score for user\'s pick\n                  const myLeaderRow = leaderboard.find((m) => m.id === \'u1\');\n                  const myPickScoreObj =\n                    sId === 1\n                      ? myLeaderRow?.breakdown.cupWeekly\n                      : sId === 2\n                      ? myLeaderRow?.breakdown.oreillysWeekly\n                      : myLeaderRow?.breakdown.trucksWeekly;\n\n                  if (!isActiveWeekend) {\n                    return (\n                      <div\n                        key={sId}\n                        className=\"bg-[#161920]/60 border border-slate-800/80 rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between opacity-70\"\n                      >\n                        <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                          <span className={`text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded border ${meta.badgeClass}`}>\n                            {meta.name}\n                          </span>\n                          <span className=\"text-xs font-mono text-slate-400\">OFF-WEEK</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div className=\"my-8 text-center space-y-2\">\n                          <Calendar className=\"w-8 h-8 text-slate-500 mx-auto\" />\n                          <p className=\"text-sm font-bold text-slate-300\">\n                            No {meta.shortName} Race Scheduled This Weekend\n                          </p>\n                          <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">\n                            Auto-detected via cf.nascar.com race_list_basic.json. Pick slot hidden.\n                          </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <button\n                          onClick={() =>\n                            setActiveSeriesThisWeekend((prev) => ({ ...prev, [sId]: true }))\n                          }\n                          className=\"w-full py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300\"\n                        >\n                          Re-Enable Series Slot\n                        </button>\n                      </div>\n                    );\n                  }\n\n                  return (\n                    <div\n                      key={sId}\n                      className={`bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xl ${meta.borderClass}`}\n                    >\n                      <div className=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\">\n                          <span className={`text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded border ${meta.badgeClass}`}>\n                            {meta.name}\n                          </span>\n                          {isRaceStarted ? (\n                            <span className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-emerald-500/30\">\n                              <Unlock className=\"w-3 h-3\" /> Green Flag \342\200\224 Revealed\n                            </span>\n                          ) : (\n                            <span className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 bg-amber-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-amber-500/30\">\n                              <Lock className=\"w-3 h-3\" /> Blind Pre-Race\n                            </span>\n                          )}\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div>\n                          <h3 className=\"font-bold text-base text-white\">\n                            {sId === 1\n                              ? \'Bass Pro Shops Night Race (Sun 7:00 PM ET)\'\n                              : sId === 2\n                              ? \'Food City 300 (Sat 7:30 PM ET)\'\n                              : \'UNOH 200 presented by Ohio Logistics (Fri 8:00 PM ET)\'}\n                          </h3>\n                          <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5\">\n                            Bristol Motor Speedway \342\200\242 Matched by NASCAR Driver ID\n                          </p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        {/* Driver Selector Dropdown with Usage Bank Tracker */}\n                        <div className=\"space-y-1.5\">\n                          <label className=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase text-slate-400 block\">\n                            Your Weekly Driver Pick (Max {meta.maxWeeklyUses} Uses/Season)\n                          </label>\n                          <select\n                            disabled={isRaceStarted}\n                            value={currentPickedId}\n                            onChange={(e) =>\n                              setWeeklyPicks((prev) => ({\n                                ...prev,\n                                u1: { ...prev.u1, [sId]: e.target.value },\n                              }))\n                            }\n                            className=\"w-full bg-[#0B0D10] border border-slate-700 rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-amber-500 disabled:opacity-60\"\n                          >\n                            {seriesDrivers.map((d) => {\n                              const usage = getDriverRemainingUses(d.id, sId);\n                              const isOut = usage.remaining === 0 && currentPickedId !== d.id;\n                              return (\n                                <option key={d.id} value={d.id} disabled={isOut}>\n                                  #{d.car_number} {d.full_name} \342\200\224 {usage.remaining}/{usage.maxUses} Uses Left{\' \'}\n                                  {isOut ? \'(MAXED OUT)\' : \'\'}\n                                </option>\n                              );\n                            })}\n                          </select>\n                        </div>\n\n                        {/* Live Telemetry Points Card for Selected Driver */}\n                        <div className=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#0B0D10] border border-slate-800/90 space-y-2\">\n                          <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs\">\n                            <span className=\"text-slate-400 font-mono\">TELEMETRY RESOLUTION:</span>\n                            {myPickScoreObj?.isOwnerPts ? (\n                              <span className=\"font-mono font-bold text-amber-400 bg-amber-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-amber-500/30\">\n                                BUSCHWHACKER OWNER PTS\n                              </span>\n                            ) : (\n                              <span className=\"font-mono text-emerald-400\">OFFICIAL PTS</span>\n                            )}\n                          </div>\n                          <div className=\"text-sm font-bold text-white flex items-center justify-between\">\n                            <span>{myPickScoreObj?.label}</span>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n\n                      <div className=\"pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400\">\n                        <span>\n                          {isRaceStarted\n                            ? \'Pick locked at green flag\'\n                            : \'Editable until race_start_time\'}\n                        </span>\n                        <button\n                          onClick={() =>\n                            setActiveSeriesThisWeekend((prev) => ({ ...prev, [sId]: false }))\n                          }\n                          className=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-white underline font-mono\"\n                        >\n                          Simulate Off-Week\n                        </button>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  );\n                })}\n              </div>\n\n              {/* LEAGUE-WIDE BLIND LOCKOUT / REVEAL BOARD */}\n              <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl\">\n                <div className=\"p-5 border-b border-slate-800/90 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n                  <div>\n                    <h3 className=\"text-lg font-bold\">League-Wide Weekly Pick Board</h3>\n                    <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">\n                      Before Green Flag, rival picks show only &ldquo;Pick Locked In&rdquo; status badges. Once `current_time &gt;= race_start_time`, picks &amp; dynamic car numbers reveal automatically.\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div className=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                  <table className=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n                    <thead>\n                      <tr className=\"border-b border-slate-800 bg-[#12151B] text-[11px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400\">\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4\">Manager</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4\">\n                          <span className=\"text-amber-400\">Cup Series Pick</span>{\' \'}\n                          {raceLockStates[1] ? \'(Revealed)\' : \'(Blind Lock)\'}\n                        </th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4\">\n                          <span className=\"text-red-400\">O&apos;Reilly&apos;s Pick</span>{\' \'}\n                          {raceLockStates[2] ? \'(Revealed)\' : \'(Blind Lock)\'}\n                        </th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4\">\n                          <span className=\"text-blue-400\">Truck Series Pick</span>{\' \'}\n                          {raceLockStates[3] ? \'(Revealed)\' : \'(Blind Lock)\'}\n                        </th>\n                      </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody className=\"divide-y divide-slate-800/70 text-sm\">\n                      {leaderboard.map((member) => {\n                        const isMe = member.id === \'u1\';\n                        return (\n                          <tr key={member.id} className=\"hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition\">\n                            <td className=\"py-3.5 px-4 font-bold whitespace-nowrap\">\n                              <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n                                <div className=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-mono text-amber-400\">\n                                  {member.avatar}\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                  <div className=\"text-white\">{member.name}</div>\n                                  <div className=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\">\n                                    Last Yr Rank: #{member.last_year_rank}\n                                  </div>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                            </td>\n\n                            {/* Render Each Series Cell with Blind Lockout Logic */}\n                            {([1, 2, 3] as SeriesId[]).map((sId) => {\n                              const isRevealed = raceLockStates[sId];\n                              const scoreObj =\n                                sId === 1\n                                  ? member.breakdown.cupWeekly\n                                  : sId === 2\n                                  ? member.breakdown.oreillysWeekly\n                                  : member.breakdown.trucksWeekly;\n\n                              if (!activeSeriesThisWeekend[sId]) {\n                                return (\n                                  <td key={sId} className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500\">\n                                    Off-Week (Hidden)\n                                  </td>\n                                );\n                              }\n\n                              if (!isRevealed && !isMe) {\n                                return (\n                                  <td key={sId} className=\"py-3.5 px-4\">\n                                    <span className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/30\">\n                                      <Lock className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" />\n                                      Pick Locked In (Hidden)\n                                    </span>\n                                  </td>\n                                );\n                              }\n\n                              return (\n                                <td key={sId} className=\"py-3.5 px-4\">\n                                  <div className=\"space-y-1\">\n                                    <div className=\"font-semibold text-slate-100 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                                      <span>{scoreObj.label}</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                      {!isRevealed && isMe && (\n                                        <span className=\"text-[10px] font-mono px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-300\">\n                                          Visible Only to You\n                                        </span>\n                                      )}\n                                      {scoreObj.isOwnerPts && (\n                                        <span className=\"text-[10px] font-mono px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/40\">\n                                          Buschwhacker / Ride-Swap Owner Pts\n                                        </span>\n                                      )}\n                                    </div>\n                                  </div>\n                                </td>\n                              );\n                            })}\n                          </tr>\n                        );\n                      })}\n                    </tbody>\n                  </table>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          )}\n\n          {/* ==========================================\n              TAB 2: LIVE & SEASON STANDINGS MATRIX\n          ========================================== */}\n          {activeTab === \'standings\' && (\n            <div className=\"space-y-6\">\n              <div className=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n                <div>\n                  <h2 className=\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tight\">\n                    LIVE TELEMETRY STANDINGS &amp; MATRIX BREAKDOWN\n                  </h2>\n                  <p className=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">\n                    Zero manual scoring. Combines Weekly Picks + Exclusive Season Roster + Mid-Season Chase Bonus + Car Anchor Fallbacks.\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n\n                {/* Filter Leaderboard by All vs Weekly vs Season Roster */}\n                <div className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-[#161920] p-1.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n                  {[\n                    { id: \'all\', label: \'Combined Standings\' },\n                    { id: \'weekly_only\', label: \'Weekly Picks Only\' },\n                    { id: \'season_only\', label: \'Season Roster Only\' },\n                  ].map((f) => (\n                    <button\n                      key={f.id}\n                      onClick={() => setStandingsViewFilter(f.id as any)}\n                      className={`px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold transition cursor-pointer ${\n                        standingsViewFilter === f.id\n                          ? \'bg-amber-500 text-black\'\n                          : \'text-slate-400 hover:text-white\'\n                      }`}\n                    >\n                      {f.label}\n                    </button>\n                  ))}\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Weekend Formula Summary Banner */}\n              <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n                <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-xl p-4 border-l-4 border-l-amber-500\">\n                  <div className=\"text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 font-bold\">CUP RACE SCORE FORMULA</div>\n                  <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1\">\n                    Weekly Cup Pick + Season Chase Driver + Season Non-Chase Driver{\' \'}\n                    {midSeasonChaseActive ? \'+ 5th Slot Cup Chase Bonus Pick\' : \'\'}\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-xl p-4 border-l-4 border-l-red-500\">\n                  <div className=\"text-xs font-mono text-red-400 font-bold\">\n                    O&apos;REILLY&apos;S RACE SCORE FORMULA\n                  </div>\n                  <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1\">\n                    Weekly O&apos;Reilly&apos;s Pick (Owner Pts Enabled) + Season O&apos;Reilly&apos;s Driver (With #88 Car Anchor)\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-xl p-4 border-l-4 border-l-blue-500\">\n                  <div className=\"text-xs font-mono text-blue-400 font-bold\">TRUCKS RACE SCORE FORMULA</div>\n                  <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1\">\n                    Weekly Truck Pick (Owner Pts Enabled) + Season Truck Driver\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Full Matrix Breakdown Table */}\n              <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl\">\n                <div className=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                  <table className=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n                    <thead>\n                      <tr className=\"border-b border-slate-800 bg-[#12151B] text-[11px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400\">\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4\">Pos / Manager</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-amber-400\">Cup Breakdown (Wk + 3 Season)</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-red-400\">O&apos;Reilly&apos;s (Wk + Season)</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-blue-400\">Trucks (Wk + Season)</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-right\">Wknd Total</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400\">Season Total</th>\n                      </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody className=\"divide-y divide-slate-800/80 text-xs\">\n                      {leaderboard.map((member, idx) => {\n                        const b = member.breakdown;\n                        return (\n                          <tr key={member.id} className=\"hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition align-top\">\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4 whitespace-nowrap\">\n                              <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <span className=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-amber-400 font-mono font-bold flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                  {idx + 1}\n                                </span>\n                                <div>\n                                  <div className=\"font-bold text-sm text-white\">{member.name}</div>\n                                  <div className=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\">\n                                    Prior Pts: {member.cumulativePriorPoints}\n                                  </div>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                            </td>\n\n                            {/* Cup Matrix Column */}\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4 space-y-1 min-w-[250px]\">\n                              <div className=\"text-slate-200\">\n                                <span className=\"font-mono text-amber-400\">[WK]</span> {b.cupWeekly.label}\n                              </div>\n                              <div className=\"text-slate-300\">\n                                <span className=\"font-mono text-slate-400\">[CHASE]</span>{\' \'}\n                                {b.cupSeasonChase.badgeText}\n                              </div>\n                              <div className=\"text-slate-300\">\n                                <span className=\"font-mono text-slate-400\">[NON-CH]</span>{\' \'}\n                                {b.cupSeasonNonChase.badgeText}\n                              </div>\n                              {midSeasonChaseActive && (\n                                <div className=\"text-amber-300/90\">\n                                  <span className=\"font-mono text-amber-400\">[5TH BONUS]</span>{\' \'}\n                                  {b.cupMidSeasonBonus.badgeText}\n                                </div>\n                              )}\n                              <div className=\"pt-1 font-mono font-bold text-amber-400\">\n                                Cup Subtotal: {b.cupTotal} pts\n                              </div>\n                            </td>\n\n                            {/* O\'Reilly\'s Matrix Column */}\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4 space-y-1 min-w-[240px]\">\n                              <div className=\"text-slate-200\">\n                                <span className=\"font-mono text-red-400\">[WK]</span>{\' \'}\n                                {b.oreillysWeekly.label}\n                              </div>\n                              <div\n                                className={\n                                  b.oreillysSeason.usedCarAnchor\n                                    ? \'text-emerald-300 font-semibold\'\n                                    : \'text-slate-300\'\n                                }\n                              >\n                                <span className=\"font-mono text-slate-400\">[SEASON]</span>{\' \'}\n                                {b.oreillysSeason.badgeText}\n                              </div>\n                              <div className=\"pt-1 font-mono font-bold text-red-400\">\n                                O&apos;Reilly&apos;s Subtotal: {b.oreillysTotal} pts\n                              </div>\n                            </td>\n\n                            {/* Trucks Matrix Column */}\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4 space-y-1 min-w-[220px]\">\n                              <div className=\"text-slate-200\">\n                                <span className=\"font-mono text-blue-400\">[WK]</span>{\' \'}\n                                {b.trucksWeekly.label}\n                              </div>\n                              <div className=\"text-slate-300\">\n                                <span className=\"font-mono text-slate-400\">[SEASON]</span>{\' \'}\n                                {b.trucksSeason.badgeText}\n                              </div>\n                              <div className=\"pt-1 font-mono font-bold text-blue-400\">\n                                Trucks Subtotal: {b.trucksTotal} pts\n                              </div>\n                            </td>\n\n                            {/* Weekend Score */}\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4 text-right font-mono\">\n                              <div className=\"text-base font-black text-white\">\n                                +{b.weekendTotal}\n                              </div>\n                              <div className=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\">\n                                Wk: {b.weeklyOnlyWeekendTotal} | Ros: {b.seasonOnlyWeekendTotal}\n                              </div>\n                            </td>\n\n                            {/* Cumulative Season Total */}\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4 text-right font-mono\">\n                              <div className=\"text-lg font-black text-emerald-400\">\n                                {b.grandTotal.toLocaleString()}\n                              </div>\n                              <div className=\"text-[10px] uppercase text-slate-400\">Total Pts</div>\n                            </td>\n                          </tr>\n                        );\n                      })}\n                    </tbody>\n                  </table>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          )}\n\n          {/* ==========================================\n              TAB 3: DRIVER USAGE BANK (REMAINING PICKS)\n          ========================================== */}\n          {activeTab === \'bank\' && (\n            <div className=\"space-y-6\">\n              <div className=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n                <div>\n                  <h2 className=\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tight\">\n                    DRIVER USAGE BANK (REMAINING WEEKLY PICKS)\n                  </h2>\n                  <p className=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">\n                    Tracks how many times you have selected each driver as a Weekly Pick against the series limit (5 uses/season). Drivers with 0 uses left are automatically locked.\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n\n                {/* Series Filter */}\n                <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#161920] p-1.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n                  {([1, 2, 3] as SeriesId[]).map((sId) => (\n                    <button\n                      key={sId}\n                      onClick={() => setBankSeriesFilter(sId)}\n                      className={`px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono font-bold transition cursor-pointer ${\n                        bankSeriesFilter === sId\n                          ? SERIES_META[sId].badgeClass\n                          : \'text-slate-400 hover:text-white\'\n                      }`}\n                    >\n                      {SERIES_META[sId].name}\n                    </button>\n                  ))}\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n                {DRIVERS.filter((d) => d.series_id === bankSeriesFilter).map((driver) => {\n                  const usage = getDriverRemainingUses(driver.id, driver.series_id);\n                  const isDepleted = usage.remaining === 0;\n                  const isActivePickThisWeek = weeklyPicks[\'u1\'][driver.series_id] === driver.id;\n\n                  return (\n                    <div\n                      key={driver.id}\n                      className={`bg-[#161920] border rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between transition ${\n                        isDepleted\n                          ? \'border-red-500/40 opacity-65\'\n                          : isActivePickThisWeek\n                          ? \'border-amber-500/60 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/5\'\n                          : \'border-slate-800/90\'\n                      }`}\n                    >\n                      <div className=\"space-y-3\">\n                        <div className=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\">\n                          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                            <div className=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-[#0B0D10] border border-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-black text-lg text-white\">\n                              #{driver.car_number}\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                              <h3 className=\"font-bold text-white leading-tight\">\n                                {driver.full_name}\n                              </h3>\n                              <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">{driver.team}</p>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n\n                          <span\n                            className={`text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border ${\n                              isDepleted\n                                ? \'bg-red-500/15 text-red-400 border-red-500/40\'\n                                : \'bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-400 border-emerald-500/30\'\n                            }`}\n                          >\n                            {usage.remaining}/{usage.maxUses} Left\n                          </span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        {/* Usage Progress Bar */}\n                        <div className=\"w-full bg-[#0B0D10] h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-slate-800\">\n                          <div\n                            className={`h-full transition-all ${\n                              isDepleted ? \'bg-red-500\' : \'bg-amber-500\'\n                            }`}\n                            style={{\n                              width: `${Math.min(100, (usage.used / usage.maxUses) * 100)}%`,\n                            }}\n                          />\n                        </div>\n\n                        {/* Tracks Used At */}\n                        <div className=\"space-y-1.5 pt-1\">\n                          <div className=\"text-[11px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400\">\n                            Tracks Used At ({usage.used}):\n                          </div>\n                          {usage.pastTracks.length > 0 ? (\n                            <div className=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\">\n                              {usage.pastTracks.map((track) => (\n                                <span\n                                  key={track}\n                                  className=\"text-xs font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-[#0B0D10] text-slate-300 border border-slate-800\"\n                                >\n                                  {track}\n                                </span>\n                              ))}\n                              {isActivePickThisWeek && (\n                                <span className=\"text-xs font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/40\">\n                                  + Bristol (Active Pick)\n                                </span>\n                              )}\n                            </div>\n                          ) : (\n                            <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-500 italic\">\n                              Fresh Bank \342\200\224 Unused prior to this weekend\n                            </p>\n                          )}\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n\n                      {driver.is_buschwhacker && (\n                        <div className=\"mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-amber-400\">\n                          <span>Buschwhacker / Owner Pts Eligible</span>\n                          <span>NASCAR ID: {driver.nascar_driver_id}</span>\n                        </div>\n                      )}\n                    </div>\n                  );\n                })}\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          )}\n\n          {/* ==========================================\n              TAB 4: PRE-SEASON EXCLUSIVE DRAFT & MID-SEASON CHASE PICK\n          ========================================== */}\n          {activeTab === \'draft\' && (\n            <div className=\"space-y-6\">\n              <div className=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n                <div>\n                  <h2 className=\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tight\">\n                    PRE-SEASON EXCLUSIVE ROSTERS &amp; MID-SEASON CHASE SLOT\n                  </h2>\n                  <p className=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">\n                    4 permanent exclusive season-long drivers (no duplicates across the league) + 5th Mid-Season Cup Chase Bonus Pick (duplicates allowed).\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div className=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\">\n                  <button\n                    onClick={() =>\n                      setDraftOrderMode(\n                        draftOrderMode === \'reverse_standings\' ? \'random\' : \'reverse_standings\'\n                      )\n                    }\n                    className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-[#161920] border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 hover:border-amber-500 cursor-pointer\"\n                  >\n                    <ArrowUpDown className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-400\" />\n                    <span>\n                      Draft Order:{\' \'}\n                      {draftOrderMode === \'reverse_standings\'\n                        ? \"Reverse Last Year\'s Standings\"\n                        : \'Randomized Order\'}\n                    </span>\n                  </button>\n\n                  <button\n                    onClick={() => setMidSeasonChaseActive(!midSeasonChaseActive)}\n                    className={`px-3 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-mono font-bold border cursor-pointer ${\n                      midSeasonChaseActive\n                        ? \'bg-amber-500/15 text-amber-400 border-amber-500/40\'\n                        : \'bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 border-slate-700\'\n                    }`}\n                  >\n                    5th Slot (Cup Chase Bonus): {midSeasonChaseActive ? \'UNLOCKED\' : \'LOCKED\'}\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Draft Order Bar */}\n              <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-2xl p-4\">\n                <div className=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase text-slate-400 mb-3\">\n                  Official Pre-Season Draft Order ({draftOrderMode === \'reverse_standings\' ? \'Reverse Order of Last Year Standings\' : \'Randomized\'})\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-2.5\">\n                  {sortedDraftOrder.map((m, i) => (\n                    <div\n                      key={m.id}\n                      className=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#0B0D10] border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2.5\"\n                    >\n                      <span className=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center\">\n                        #{i + 1}\n                      </span>\n                      <div className=\"truncate\">\n                        <div className=\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate\">{m.name}</div>\n                        <div className=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400\">\n                          Prev Rank: #{m.last_year_rank}\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  ))}\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Season Rosters & Car Anchor Protection Table */}\n              <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl\">\n                <div className=\"p-5 border-b border-slate-800/90 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                  <div>\n                    <h3 className=\"text-lg font-bold\">\n                      Exclusive League Season Rosters &amp; &ldquo;Car Anchor&rdquo; Fallbacks\n                    </h3>\n                    <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">\n                      PostgreSQL Partial Unique Index enforces zero duplicate drivers across Slots 1\342\200\2234. Slot 5 allows duplicates for the final 10 Cup Chase races.\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div className=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                  <table className=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n                    <thead>\n                      <tr className=\"border-b border-slate-800 bg-[#12151B] text-[11px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400\">\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4\">Manager</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-amber-400\">\n                          1. Cup &ldquo;Chase&rdquo; (Exclusive)\n                        </th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-amber-400\">\n                          2. Cup &ldquo;Non-Chase&rdquo; (Exclusive)\n                        </th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-red-400\">\n                          3. O&apos;Reilly&apos;s Season (Exclusive)\n                        </th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-blue-400\">\n                          4. Truck Season (Exclusive)\n                        </th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3.5 px-4 text-emerald-400\">\n                          5. Mid-Season Cup Chase (Duplicates OK)\n                        </th>\n                      </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody className=\"divide-y divide-slate-800/70 text-xs\">\n                      {INITIAL_MEMBERS.map((member) => {\n                        const renderSlot = (slot?: {\n                          driver_id: string;\n                          fallback_car_number: string;\n                        }) => {\n                          if (!slot) return <span className=\"text-slate-500\">Locked</span>;\n                          const d = DRIVERS.find((drv) => drv.id === slot.driver_id);\n                          return (\n                            <div className=\"space-y-0.5\">\n                              <div className=\"font-bold text-white\">\n                                #{d?.car_number} {d?.full_name}\n                              </div>\n                              <div className=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\">\n                                Car Anchor: #{slot.fallback_car_number} ({d?.team})\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                          );\n                        };\n\n                        return (\n                          <tr key={member.id} className=\"hover:bg-slate-800/30\">\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4 font-bold text-sm text-white whitespace-nowrap\">\n                              {member.name}\n                            </td>\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4\">\n                              {renderSlot(member.seasonRoster.cup_prev_chase)}\n                            </td>\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4\">\n                              {renderSlot(member.seasonRoster.cup_prev_non_chase)}\n                            </td>\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4\">\n                              {renderSlot(member.seasonRoster.oreillys_season)}\n                            </td>\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4\">\n                              {renderSlot(member.seasonRoster.trucks_season)}\n                            </td>\n                            <td className=\"py-4 px-4\">\n                              {midSeasonChaseActive ? (\n                                renderSlot(member.seasonRoster.cup_current_chase)\n                              ) : (\n                                <span className=\"text-slate-500 font-mono\">\n                                  Unlocks at Race 27 (Chase)\n                                </span>\n                              )}\n                            </td>\n                          </tr>\n                        );\n                      })}\n                    </tbody>\n                  </table>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          )}\n\n          {/* ==========================================\n              TAB 5: SYNC STATUS & COMMISSIONER ADMIN\n          ========================================== */}\n          {activeTab === \'admin\' && (\n            <div className=\"space-y-6\">\n              <div>\n                <h2 className=\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tight\">\n                  NASCAR CDN PIPELINE &amp; COMMISSIONER RULES ENGINE\n                </h2>\n                <p className=\"text-sm text-slate-400\">\n                  Inspect live `cf.nascar.com` endpoints, Dual-Source Buschwhacker Owner Points calculations, and post-race inspection cron schedules.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n\n              <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                {/* Commissioner Scoring Rules Card */}\n                <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-5\">\n                  <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n                    <Sliders className=\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-400\" />\n                    <h3 className=\"text-lg font-bold\">Commissioner Scoring &amp; Fallback Settings</h3>\n                  </div>\n\n                  <div className=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#0B0D10] border border-slate-800\">\n                      <div>\n                        <div className=\"font-bold text-sm text-white\">\n                          Use Car Owner Points if Season Driver Misses Race\n                        </div>\n                        <div className=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5\">\n                          If a Season-Long driver is injured/suspended, automatically award the Owner Points of their `fallback_car_number` (e.g. #88).\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\"\n                        checked={useCarAnchorFallback}\n                        onChange={(e) => setUseCarAnchorFallback(e.target.checked)}\n                        className=\"w-5 h-5 accent-emerald-500\"\n                      />\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#0B0D10] border border-slate-800\">\n                      <div>\n                        <div className=\"font-bold text-sm text-white\">\n                          1st Place Owner Points Scale\n                        </div>\n                        <div className=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5\">\n                          Configurable between 55 pts (modern championship scale) or 40 pts (classic scale) for Buschwhacker vehicle calculation.\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                      <select\n                        value={firstPlacePoints}\n                        onChange={(e) => setFirstPlacePoints(Number(e.target.value) as 55 | 40)}\n                        className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-mono font-bold text-amber-400\"\n                      >\n                        <option value={55}>55 Points (1st)</option>\n                        <option value={40}>40 Points (1st)</option>\n                      </select>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                {/* Automated Cron & Endpoints Status */}\n                <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-4\">\n                  <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n                    <Clock className=\"w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400\" />\n                    <h3 className=\"text-lg font-bold\">Automated NASCAR JSON Feed Endpoints</h3>\n                  </div>\n\n                  <div className=\"space-y-2.5 text-xs font-mono\">\n                    <div className=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#0B0D10] border border-slate-800\">\n                      <div className=\"text-amber-400 font-bold\">1. Schedule &amp; Active Series Detection</div>\n                      <div className=\"text-slate-400 truncate mt-1\">\n                        GET https://cf.nascar.com/cacher/&#123;year&#125;/race_list_basic.json\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div className=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#0B0D10] border border-slate-800\">\n                      <div className=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\">2. Live Race Points &amp; Stage Points</div>\n                      <div className=\"text-slate-400 truncate mt-1\">\n                        GET https://cf.nascar.com/live/feeds/series_&#123;id&#125;/&#123;race_id&#125;/live_points.json\n                      </div>\n                      <div className=\"text-slate-400 truncate\">\n                        GET https://cf.nascar.com/live/feeds/series_&#123;id&#125;/&#123;race_id&#125;/live-stage-points.json\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div className=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#0B0D10] border border-slate-800\">\n                      <div className=\"text-blue-400 font-bold\">\n                        3. Official Post-Race &amp; Monday 8:00 AM ET Tech Inspection Sync\n                      </div>\n                      <div className=\"text-slate-400 truncate mt-1\">\n                        GET https://cf.nascar.com/cacher/&#123;year&#125;/&#123;id&#125;/&#123;race_id&#125;/weekend-feed.json\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Live Inspection Table of Computed `race_driver_results` (Driver Pts vs Owner Pts) */}\n              <div className=\"bg-[#161920] border border-slate-800/90 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\">\n                <div className=\"p-5 border-b border-slate-800\">\n                  <h3 className=\"text-lg font-bold\">\n                    Live Telemetry Verification: `MAX(driver_points, calculated_owner_points)`\n                  </h3>\n                  <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">\n                    Demonstrates how Cup Buschwhackers in O&apos;Reilly&apos;s &amp; Trucks (`points_earned: 0`) automatically receive full Vehicle/Owner Points.\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                  <table className=\"w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs font-mono\">\n                    <thead>\n                      <tr className=\"border-b border-slate-800 bg-[#12151B] text-slate-400 uppercase\">\n                        <th className=\"py-3 px-4\">Series</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3 px-4\">Driver (NASCAR ID)</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3 px-4\">Actual Car #</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3 px-4\">Finish</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3 px-4\">Stage + FL</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3 px-4\">NASCAR `points_earned`</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3 px-4\">Calculated Owner Pts</th>\n                        <th className=\"py-3 px-4 text-emerald-400\">Credited Fantasy Pts</th>\n                      </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody className=\"divide-y divide-slate-800/70\">\n                      {[\n                        ...computedWeekendResults[2].slice(0, 3).map((r) => ({ ...r, sId: 2 as SeriesId })),\n                        ...computedWeekendResults[3].slice(0, 2).map((r) => ({ ...r, sId: 3 as SeriesId })),\n                      ].map((row, i) => (\n                        <tr key={i} className=\"hover:bg-slate-800/30\">\n                          <td className=\"py-3 px-4\">\n                            <span className={`px-2 py-0.5 rounded border ${SERIES_META[row.sId].badgeClass}`}>\n                              {SERIES_META[row.sId].shortName}\n                            </span>\n                          </td>\n                          <td className=\"py-3 px-4 font-sans font-bold text-white\">\n                            {row.driver_fullname} <span className=\"text-slate-500\">({row.nascar_driver_id})</span>\n                          </td>\n                          <td className=\"py-3 px-4 text-amber-400 font-bold\">#{row.actual_car_number}</td>\n                          <td className=\"py-3 px-4\">P{row.finish_position}</td>\n                          <td className=\"py-3 px-4\">\n                            +{row.stage_points} Stg {row.fastest_lap_bonus ? \'+1 FL\' : \'\'}\n                          </td>\n                          <td className=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-400\">{row.driver_points} pts</td>\n                          <td className=\"py-3 px-4 text-amber-300 font-bold\">\n                            {row.calculated_owner_points} Owner Pts\n                          </td>\n                          <td className=\"py-3 px-4 text-emerald-400 font-black text-sm\">\n                            {row.effective_fantasy_points} PTS ({row.scoring_source})\n                          </td>\n                        </tr>\n                      ))}\n                    </tbody>\n                  </table>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          )}\n        </main>\n\n        {/* ==========================================\n            MOBILE BOTTOM NAVIGATION BAR\n        ========================================== */}\n        <nav className=\"md:hidden fixed bottom-0 inset-x-0 bg-[#12151B]/95 backdrop-blur-md border-t border-slate-800 z-30 flex items-center justify-around py-2 px-1\">\n          {[\n            { id: \'picks\', label: \'Picks\', icon: Calendar },\n            { id: \'standings\', label: \'Standings\', icon: Trophy },\n            { id: \'bank\', label: \'Bank\', icon: Database },\n            { id: \'draft\', label: \'Roster\', icon: Users },\n            { id: \'admin\', label: \'Sync/Admin\', icon: Sliders },\n          ].map((item) => {\n            const Icon = item.icon;\n            const active = activeTab === item.id;\n            return (\n              <button\n                key={item.id}\n                onClick={() => setActiveTab(item.id as any)}\n                className={`flex flex-col items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-[11px] font-semibold ${\n                  active ? \'text-amber-400\' : \'text-slate-400\'\n                }`}\n              >\n                <Icon className=\"w-5 h-5\" />\n                <span>{item.label}</span>\n              </button>\n            );\n          })}\n        </nav>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```"
    }
  }
}
