    response: "**Pit Box Fantasy** is now built, connected to your PostgreSQL database, and running.\n\n### Key Capabilities Implemented\n- **Motorsport Telemetry Dark UI & Navigation**: Designed with a deep carbon `#0B0D10` background, slate `#161920` cards, tabular numerals, and series color coding (Amber `#F59E0B` for Cup, Red `#EF4444` for O\'Reilly\'s, and Electric Blue `#3B82F6` for Trucks) across both the desktop sidebar and mobile bottom bar.\n- **Automated NASCAR Data Pipeline (`/api/nascar-sync`)**: Fetches official schedules (`race_list_basic.json`), live race points (`live_points.json`), stage points (`live-stage-points.json`), and official weekend results (`weekend-feed.json`) from `cf.nascar.com`, with an on-demand **Sync Now** button in the header.\n- **Buschwhacker & Vehicle Owner Points Engine**:\n  - **Dual-Source Points**: Evaluates reported `points_earned` alongside calculated Vehicle/Owner Points (Position scale with configurable `55` or `40` pts for 1st place + Stage 1 & 2 points + `+1` Fastest Lap bonus) and credits `MAX(driver_points, calculated_owner_points)`.\n  - **Ride-Swapping Vehicle Resolution**: Matches weekly picks by `nascar_driver_id` and displays the dynamically matched car number and team driven in that specific race.\n  - **Season-Long \"Car Anchor\" Fallback**: Stores `fallback_car_number` (e.g., `#88`) on each season roster slot and automatically awards the substitute driver\'s Owner Points when the Commissioner\'s Car Anchor rule is enabled.\n- **Blind Weekly Picks, Driver Usage Bank & Exclusive Season Rosters**:\n  - **Blind Lockout Board**: Hides rival weekly picks behind `\"Pick Locked In\"` until Green Flag (`current_time >= race_start_time`), with interactive Green Flag and Off-Week simulators.\n  - **Driver Usage Bank**: Tracks weekly uses per driver (`5` max per season) with track history and automatic lockout at `0/5 Uses Left`.\n  - **Pre-Season Exclusive Roster & 5th Chase Slot**: Enforces unique season-long drivers across Slots 1\342\200\2234 while unlocking the 5th Mid-Season Cup Chase Bonus slot with duplicates allowed."
