  planner_response {
    response: "I have redesigned **Pit Box Fantasy** around a **Sleeper / ESPN Fantasy** mobile-first workflow and an authentic **NASCAR 3-Stripe Palette** (`#FFD100` Sunburst Yellow for Cup, `#E4002B` Racing Red for O\'Reilly\'s, and `#1D63FF` Cobalt Blue for Trucks).\n\n### 1. How People Sign Up & Join the League\n- **Invite Code & Team Claim Modal (`Join / Add Player`)**: Any new player can tap **Join / Add Player** in the top bar (or in the **League** tab), enter their **Manager / Team Name** and the league\'s invite code (`PITBOX-2026`), or use **Continue with Google Sign-In**.\n- **Automatic Roster Provisioning**: Joining creates their manager record in PostgreSQL, assigns available starter slots so their lineup is immediately active, and switches the view to their new team.\n- **Active Team Switcher**: In the top summary bar, you can switch between any manager in the league (`Cole Trickle (Commish)`, `Rowdy Burns`, `Ricky Bobby`, or newly signed-up teams) with one tap to test how both the Commissioner and regular league members experience blind lockouts and lineup swaps.\n\n### 2. How the League Manager & Players Use the App Week-to-Week\n- **My Lineup (`My Lineup` Tab \342\200\224 Sleeper/ESPN Slot List)**:\n  - Displays your **3 Weekly Starters** (`CUP WKLY`, `ORL WKLY`, `TRK WKLY`) stacked above your **5 Season-Long Roster Slots** (`CHASE`, `NON-CH`, `ORL SZN`, `TRK SZN`, `5TH BONUS`) in compact, zero-horizontal-scroll rows with stylized NASCAR car number pylons.\n  - Tap **SWAP** on any weekly starter slot to open a slide-up bottom sheet showing eligible drivers, remaining uses (`3/5 Uses Left`), and live points.\n- **Expandable League Scoreboard (`Scores` Tab)**:\n  - Replaces wide desktop tables with compact mobile scoreboard cards showing Rank, Team Name, Weekend Score (`+265 wknd`), and Season Total (`2,675 pts`).\n  - Tap any manager card to expand their 8-slot breakdown; rival weekly picks show `\360\237\224\222 Pick Locked In` until Green Flag.\n- **One-Tap Driver Bank (`Drivers` Tab)**:\n  - Filter by Cup, O\'Reilly\'s, or Trucks in a tight vertical list and tap **START** next to any driver with remaining uses to slot them directly into this week\'s lineup.\n- **Commissioner Console (`League` Tab)**:\n  - Copy the league invite code (`PITBOX-2026`), add players, toggle **Green Flag Lock/Reveal**, switch between `55` and `40` 1st-place Owner Points scales, toggle **Car Anchor Injury Protection**, and unlock the **5th Mid-Season Cup Chase Bonus Slot**."
    modified_response: "I have redesigned **Pit Box Fantasy** around a **Sleeper / ESPN Fantasy** mobile-first workflow and an authentic **NASCAR 3-Stripe Palette** (`#FFD100` Sunburst Yellow for Cup, `#E4002B` Racing Red for O\'Reilly\'s, and `#1D63FF` Cobalt Blue for Trucks).\n\n### 1. How People Sign Up & Join the League\n- **Invite Code & Team Claim Modal (`Join / Add Player`)**: Any new player can tap **Join / Add Player** in the top bar (or in the **League** tab), enter their **Manager / Team Name** and the league\'s invite code (`PITBOX-2026`), or use **Continue with Google Sign-In**.\n- **Automatic Roster Provisioning**: Joining creates their manager record in PostgreSQL, assigns available starter slots so their lineup is immediately active, and switches the view to their new team.\n- **Active Team Switcher**: In the top summary bar, you can switch between any manager in the league (`Cole Trickle (Commish)`, `Rowdy Burns`, `Ricky Bobby`, or newly signed-up teams) with one tap to test how both the Commissioner and regular league members experience blind lockouts and lineup swaps.\n\n### 2. How the League Manager & Players Use the App Week-to-Week\n- **My Lineup (`My Lineup` Tab \342\200\224 Sleeper/ESPN Slot List)**:\n  - Displays your **3 Weekly Starters** (`CUP WKLY`, `ORL WKLY`, `TRK WKLY`) stacked above your **5 Season-Long Roster Slots** (`CHASE`, `NON-CH`, `ORL SZN`, `TRK SZN`, `5TH BONUS`) in compact, zero-horizontal-scroll rows with stylized NASCAR car number pylons.\n  - Tap **SWAP** on any weekly starter slot to open a slide-up bottom sheet showing eligible drivers, remaining uses (`3/5 Uses Left`), and live points.\n- **Expandable League Scoreboard (`Scores` Tab)**:\n  - Replaces wide desktop tables with compact mobile scoreboard cards showing Rank, Team Name, Weekend Score (`+265 wknd`), and Season Total (`2,675 pts`).\n  - Tap any manager card to expand their 8-slot breakdown; rival weekly picks show `\360\237\224\222 Pick Locked In` until Green Flag.\n- **One-Tap Driver Bank (`Drivers` Tab)**:\n  - Filter by Cup, O\'Reilly\'s, or Trucks in a tight vertical list and tap **START** next to any driver with remaining uses to slot them directly into this week\'s lineup.\n- **Commissioner Console (`League` Tab)**:\n  - Copy the league invite code (`PITBOX-2026`), add players, toggle **Green Flag Lock/Reveal**, switch between `55` and `40` 1st-place Owner Points scales, toggle **Car Anchor Injury Protection**, and unlock the **5th Mid-Season Cup Chase Bonus Slot**."
